; _docs_flag_cek=''; if (window['DOCS_timing']) {DOCS_timing['ifdld']=new Date().getTime();}</script></head><script nonce="9v-GYLCIJJeCSRSqvUm-rQ">document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', init);</script><body class="docs-gm material-tabbar"><div id="sheets-viewport" class=" docsshared-disable-image-copy docsshared-no-select"><div id="1662574278" style="display:none;position:relative;" dir="ltr"><div class="ritz grid-container" dir="ltr"><table class="waffle no-grid grid-minimized" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><thead><tr><th class="row-header freezebar-vertical-handle"></th><th id="1662574278C0" style="width:180px;">A</th><th id="1662574278C1" style="width:70px;">B</th><th id="1662574278C2" style="width:240px;">C</th><th id="1662574278C3" style="width:240px;">D</th><th id="1662574278C4" style="width:240px;">E</th><th id="1662574278C5" style="width:240px;">F</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style="height: 19px"><th id="1662574278R0" style="height: 19px;"><div style="line-height: 19px">1</div></th><td class="s0" colspan="6">Gear Perks, Traits, and Mods</td></tr><tr style="height: 19px"><th id="1662574278R1" style="height: 19px;"><div style="line-height: 19px">2</div></th><td class="s1" colspan="2"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=2032310408">Weapon Traits</a></td><td class="s2"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=489910551">Weapon Mods</a></td><td class="s3"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=1783872249">Intrinsic Traits</a></td><td class="s4"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=1741839492">Crossbow/Glaive/Sword Info</a></td><td class="s5"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=1073063811">Origin Traits</a></td></tr><tr style="height: 19px"><th id="1662574278R2" style="height: 19px;"><div style="line-height: 19px">3</div></th><td class="s6" colspan="2">Perk</td><td class="s7" colspan="4">Description</td></tr><tr><th style="height:3px;" class="freezebar-cell freezebar-horizontal-handle"></th><td class="freezebar-cell"></td><td class="freezebar-cell"></td><td class="freezebar-cell"></td><td class="freezebar-cell"></td><td class="freezebar-cell"></td><td class="freezebar-cell"></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R3" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">4</div></th><td class="s8"><div style="width:180px;height:149px;"><div style="width:inherit;height:inherit;overflow:hidden;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVPMzQEyWFB0ph959pcNooGkhKEKt7eKGqmePMwOkoVRZOrV1OTn6E6UjNbHlD-PAAom5n_m8HFkU7JIr76JufncXUfG71pzNosETfHPpDEMQwn1CoV0rh_WOBbpM1u2d-frL3tZIWq761YCYJc8H0r8cwhaazAWixVgg=s96-w96-h96-s" style="width:96px;height:96px;margin:26px 42px;pointer-events:none;"/></div></div></td><td class="s8"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUWn0Tw98yJ13sn8gvg1jOCsDt2wN2KvQvkrzZn0Fa45ydypxLl1fmP6gKnwZKHsGleI9U9zOTwK4eFsnjiDXqJD_FlMvSn4x4VOZN6CfECiAMw62DnlbDq9unUyO_KG-tlmfj9jwMVSQklwFTk4doS4p3qwOvLIRrv664=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s9" colspan="4"><span style="color:#ffd966;">Enhanced Traits are shown in ↑Yellow.<br><br></span><span style="color:#cccccc;">Smaller + signs are </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">color-coded</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> for </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Subclass-specific</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> fragment interactions.<br>For example: 5</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f9cb9c;">+2</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> seconds of </span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration </span><span style="color:#cccccc;">for </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Ember of Solace</span><span style="color:#cccccc;">,</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> x30</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#e0a261;">+15</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> Scorch</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> for </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Ember of Ashes</span><span style="color:#cccccc;">, and 10</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#b4a7d6;">+5</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> seconds for </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Echo of Persistence</span><span style="color:#cccccc;">.<br><br></span>All <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">, </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">, and </span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Energy sources</span> will be listed at <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">100 Stat</span>.<br>At <span style="color:#e06666;">0 Stat</span>, the amount received is <span style="color:#e06666;">0.44x</span> of the stated number.</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px"><th id="1662574278R4" style="height: 24px;"><div style="line-height: 24px">5</div></th><td class="s10" colspan="6">Weapon Traits</td></tr><tr style="height: 74px"><th id="1662574278R5" style="height: 74px;"><div style="line-height: 74px">6</div></th><td class="s11">Accelerated Heatsink</td><td class="s12"><div style="width:70px;height:74px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWpJNZP0ODcG_zRbXZwc5uUsr0yAPaKyIalNN0NJcgN2uH5Au4Bsxy_tnAg1BI03mLATUuan35SnABoxyR7d57GH0c8HFED_Y0vOlEmYHA8Q6NF188PUuTZ8KSD3HrYLBjSL0UVVhkN0Ow-ZCdJ1ItcoI2TMCxp-cwUDxc=s74-w70-h74" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s13" colspan="4">Passively grants <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">+25 Cooling Efficiency stat </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑and +2 Reload Speed </span>at the downside of<span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> 2% decreased damage</span>.<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#6fa8dc;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=1962653729">How do Heat Weapons work?</a></span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R6" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">7</div></th><td class="s14">Adagio</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV5Y67KEfFPD7lOQRj8XxuWGHnBQRMpiuvRTbNqlU8mzKBqrMFYoFrGbl1XV7_kLrYLceMOJfkn1Xysse8uFh_dYfFEAbGfrnbDxo4nmv1ZrfDBt4lMuqJIyVtJrnUZKWKmDtJCVyDqu9ekJsqBY4MvtLdbuW5slT52C2U=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>30% (27% Hand Cannons) increased damage, +10 Range, and 1.2x Fire Recovery Delay/Charge Time Multiplier/Draw Time Multiplier for 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑8</span> seconds.<span style="font-size:7pt;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R7" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">8</div></th><td class="s17">Adaptive Munitions</td><td class="s18"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ5knnh0oR8qZTyUwVrEgFwHw5PfSzzmsTZi-ENUptgbbN9qL-0OoABTz80B73jt8Vhi-OY-_9rTqn72t_CZvDc9t7_M6oX4W9FeqvZXIkdhKX0G0x5OKn8vK2TLgW7GwIGzMH_HRZM3i2HgRccJS2_TXqVpLL8vA=w70-h134" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon damaging a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Non-Matching Shield</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">Barrier Champion Shield</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;"> <br></span>Stacking damage increase <span style="font-weight:normal;">against </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant Shields</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed upon hitting a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">Matching Shield </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or an </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Unshielded </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">???% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑???%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> per hit, up to ???% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑???%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">:</span><span style="color:#c27ba0;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#93c47d;">Fusion Rifles</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">.<br></span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">10% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑14%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> per hit, up to 50% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑69.5%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> Auto Rifles, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#a481e1;">Machine Guns</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">, Pulse Rifles, and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#93c47d;">Trace Rifles</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#d5a6bd;"> </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">22% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑31%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> per hit, up to 44.5% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑61.5%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#a481e1;">Linear Fusion Rifles</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">.<br></span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">25% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑34.5%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> per hit, up to 50% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑69.5%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"> Bows, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#93c47d;">Glaives</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">, Hand Cannons, and Scout Rifles.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R8" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">9</div></th><td class="s20">Adhesive Ordnance</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWdyk7A4ayFwdj6-eQfI37O8I_NeK7jpDR0hZS-i4ihjqbfB0O59uPiDy8FWA_-hvnJmQ3_meJWKNWSOnHYuZ_VEbPc0rs8Q-Ant0QKCXuml8zIS_3h5Hx8pf1N8wW-hpIlJXtssYTkArquz7iU9f5B_Yxn9qP3fANohg=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">picking up</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Ammo </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Brick</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Generates <span style="color:#63d275;">+1 Ammo</span>.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>The next shot fired adheres a <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Sticky Bomb</span> on impact. <span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Can trigger from Kinetic Synthesis Ammo Bricks.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Sticky Bomb</span> detonates after 0.8 seconds, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">varying </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[70 ↑77]</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span> and inflicting <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Exhaust</span> over 6 meters, down to 50% Damage at the furthest point.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Damage against Combatants scales with Combatant Rank Modifiers and counts as Kinetic Weapon Damage.<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Hand Cannon, Scout Rifle</span>: 766 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑843</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Sniper Rifle</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1,044</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑1,149</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R9" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">10</div></th><td class="s17">Adrenaline Junkie</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaWcbSTZdtTzx7mR6ErSfoFB3YiyjLrwRA_8sn3WqDadwtmbv9iAxo2_C4gx1TOA5xAyQzrB1V4Fu3MrPso_A0DYdQtIN-HYdopv4U1coJ0yDuC2JbZeGVZQHFnGXoj33OC8BrrqGJ3VyWpUCAuO9fyWHzBvQrCFydL=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Kill:<br></span>6.7% | 13.3% | 20% | 26.6% | 33.3% increased damage and +20 Handling for 4.5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5</span> seconds. <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Kills</span> grant 5 stacks, even if stowed.<br>Additional Weapon or <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>Kills refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be triggered while stowed and persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R10" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">11</div></th><td class="s22">Aggregate Charge</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUiR-tXcDT9BoCIJOsSJDR8bJI4OdbQoCjVf80y7MpnQbe8mKyZnKnetZUPVCtIBjnsi7AJzm2LE_6G1_adHzm76_RmBbpSq_47b5_-K6zHrSvqohBvbBBzW5ufcpzG1__-xO-iJaTeHYgtyPrhCF4zcCjoIvxoBTLk6VU=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Against </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a64d79;">Elementally-Debuffed</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Enemies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>10%<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11%</span> | 20%<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑22%</span> | 30%<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑33% </span>increased damage. <br>Effect scales with the amount of <span style="color:#a64d79;">unique debuffs</span> on the enemy, maxing out at <span style="color:#a64d79;">3 unique debuffs</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#a64d79;">Unique Debuff List:<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Blind - Jolt</span> | <span style="color:#e0a261;">Scorch - Ignition</span> | <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Suppression - Volatile - Weaken </span>| <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Slow - Freeze - Shatter</span> | <span style="color:#63d275;">Sever - Suspend - Unravel</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R11" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">12</div></th><td class="s17">Air Assault</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa-PIBXV337xBeUMj8FXoKeOSgNlNr7H0iSHnjhX_Ti7Cmhab3eWg6bpPrUcMgHXoDMpXgpQzqUljPEyy7ZYYAAK7W-OUUvW92SXH7cIAb85nRuqoA7Oeade3VQ7G7Gbeoivdz5zIf5DywfkZnLWN-B1htv81arZYq8=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Passively grants +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑12</span> Airborne Effectiveness.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑32 </span>Airborne Effectiveness per stack for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of 2 stacks. Airborne Kills grant 2 stacks.<br>Additional Weapon Kills refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R12" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">13</div></th><td class="s14">Air Trigger</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXypot_6hyBk917M4XMiYUxDZ0onABioCOOyYZvGA55nSd59ZNMzpRxykl2_b82QjJHVXacHbtp8D80-wJIp9xcSOEZYI4lXjmqgC4gx3h_1WEdnaLGBBWswr828Q8ssQWudCDCKtHNKo9lQmdBwwDrW5XeqqpqDqV85oI=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+30 </span>Ammo Generation.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Airborne</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑35?</span> Reload Speed, 0.8x Reload Duration Multiplier, -15?% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-20?%</span> Accuracy Cone Size, and -20?% Auto Aim Cone Size.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R13" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">14</div></th><td class="s17">All-Star</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXHPflDcE0SOnjrLeIwTH4aflqkSPszv1IySoFGw1uM_gbXALlOhVFdxAAkX3aSGumN-sicCnQJKebwbz0aXMVvZAdmcJ0OZhdfY9Jt7vFq7GYHYhzBFHR1vE1drGExQFUvbBcF2KFH4Mif-31-BuBq5QvDElf6GUeVDbQ=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">picking up</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> an </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Ammo Brick</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills Magazine.<span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">35%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[15%]</span> Increased Damage and +100? Reload Speed for 6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7</span> seconds.<br>Additional <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Synthesis Bricks</span> or <span style="color:#63d275;">Special Ammo Bricks</span> extend the buff duration by 7 seconds, up to 10 seconds.<br>Timer only ticks down while the weapon with All-Star is readied.<br><br>Picking up a <span style="color:#a481e1;">Heavy Ammo Brick</span> grants 9 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑10</span> seconds of All-Star.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R14" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">15</div></th><td class="s14">Alloy Magazine</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVJxq6OJsKZQHojdhmKJNloACYSIDOZHzUU7mE68ESCUPB9WBjYmkKu9FKuqaajhRiTDJf5jZXPgJZIZ1itUYAZAXy4HHKesBmXO_I0qhCVaSKV4qpiORVXyNK-YWgN7uQuRdzRanTDOV95H-FAKwNr81TUA2uqrbKu9w=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">starting a reload</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">at or below 50% Magazine Capacity</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Linearly grants <span style="text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;">up to</span> 0.8x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.75x</span> Reload Duration Multiplier.<br>Perk dynamically scales from 0.9x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.85x</span> Reload Duration Multiplier at 50% Magazine, up to 0.8x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.75x</span> Reload Duration Multiplier at 0% Magazine.</td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R15" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">16</div></th><td class="s17">Ambitious Assassin</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZeGKjClEBXUE0sm9_K8_j2GdprO0GeWRSbhGaQdjp9KVknFIkf1KuXZrRMCkHT4YtIBbL7QdhDxJrCKDDWpnIGnccVgFQIGlpRigDsMHMqX5nuGIxIPFMGUiPb6EY1edyuKDhd-TQy08-xAdq5pxx-eSM5XxgMeT6Y=w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing a reload</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> after scoring Weapon Kills:<br></span>Overflows Magazine from reserves based on the amount of kills achieved, up to a maximum of 150% Increased Magazine Capacity. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Always rounds magazine up. Kill Counter persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span>: 20% Increased Magazine Capacity per Kill.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Special Weapons </span>| <span style="color:#a481e1;">Power Weapons</span>: 10% Increased Magazine Capacity per Kill.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Reload Speed.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 279px"><th id="1662574278R16" style="height: 279px;"><div style="line-height: 279px">17</div></th><td class="s20">Ancillary Ordinance</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:279px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUcyZD8ZG1_5YdRluiIVRrK02cbKRblgR_OoJFg9w5xK0FIM-GZalRoKpz04x7WxDQAuKQloOOqw5iDfz23p4odLoo1Bu2-W58fylxduHBL03xCSKuSh5K6JxMyUHUlyV4mOGkkZCbIwY0SGoC52GlaVB0sJ_jf8hyqz4c=s279-w70-h279" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">3 Elemental Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">4 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">killing </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">Elementally-Debuffed Enemy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#999999;">Ancillary Ordinance</span>, up to a maximum of 4? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5</span> stacks.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Kills can be scored through any means. <br>Scoring a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Kinetic Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> against an </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">Elementally-Debuffed Enemy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> will also instantly spawn a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Micro-Missile</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">. Try it with </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6aa84f;">Unravel </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Scorching Rounds!<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Direct Weapon Kill </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while having </span><span style="font-style:italic;">stacks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Ancillary Ordinance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><br>Consumes a stack of <span style="color:#999999;">Ancillary Ordinance</span> to spawn a <span style="color:#999999;">homing Kinetic Micro-Missile</span> over the <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Enemy Death Location</span>.<br><span style="color:#999999;">Micro-missile</span> aggressively tracks the closest enemy within 30 meters, exploding on impact, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">varying </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[100]</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span> over a tiny radius.<br><br><span style="color:#999999;">Micro-Missile Damage:<br></span>Primary Weapons: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">383</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Shotgun</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">435<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Micro-Missile Sidearm </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">(High Albedo)</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">348</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Grenade Launcher </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">(Mountaintop)</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">292</span><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Heavy Sniper Rifle: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">76</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R17" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">18</div></th><td class="s17">Archer&#39;s Gambit</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaElp4mmStH2bt6f6KzQzU3XVSPpWoUHE5syc4uegBNNty6Qfpd3F1E3VaQI6v8DJmbJ32Ma2mcGUQXyaVFDU71Uh_2vG7mMjtm7HZgfsMC-WF-SXQrWbpDdFEIK_-Ev3Yl7WnNQ0yjNQhfs6qvCDPUexmzRgA93X388GY=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Hipfired</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hit</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+100? Reload Speed, 0.x? Reload Duration Multiplier, and 0.4x Draw Time Multiplier for 4 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5</span> seconds.<br>Scoring additional <span style="color:#f1c232;">Hipfired Precision Hits</span> extends the buff duration by +4 seconds, up to 8 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R18" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">19</div></th><td class="s14">Archer&#39;s Tempo</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYmYdRDoaVlzHfWdElctYUWpFvrZkaE-To4qVlEezJq5_bLtzy_lT9BH1LHTW5-8_BjEVUChqxfXMxMDjsYlsTzaPl_YhHWS1QVHOjRYh5m_5N20CAwsRVgPoan3HtiT8NtYxyH9E-qsk-BhSBcwUm95sXsskHlYQ=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hit</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">:<br></span>0.75x Draw Time Multiplier for 3 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑4</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R19" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">20</div></th><td class="s17">Armor-Piercing Rounds</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVvTdsh17rCsD1ZyF8psUxZzTwrnQAWSVhhDLJqWF3gGJE2GukBg6F-EjSaChMDx0zyAGcIU_9Gclq79Kc1vVZFRObgUCOKU8GBu-kcEcDSbZ-lVlGv8tf8LM5JOFCUjaEpcypkZwOt4zq2DJ3Plys__BO1ruwTeYCpEIg=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Grants 5% increased damage against <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Combatant Elemental Shields </span>and <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Barrier Champion&#39;s Shield</span>.<br><br>Bullets overpenetrate enemies once.<br><br>Passively grants +5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+7</span> Range.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R20" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">21</div></th><td class="s14">Assassin&#39;s Blade</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVm0dpstEUNidrh-7ZkmIsQVUg1XAGCE1HBxbwNiVX4CjkUXGwT74DTBjRQxkLM7OjPz3QmQtkwJq4NazbMlIljWZRZBVZSLviypIWFM03pvlfREYZXMtAjaOhXgebAA98jdqvravT9MtKmL6fT6ALrQnnUH0obklx4xZQ=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On Weapon Kill:<br></span>15% Increased damage and maximizes Movement Speed for 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5.5</span> seconds.<br>Additional Weapon Kills refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Buff remains active while stowed.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 164px"><th id="1662574278R21" style="height: 164px;"><div style="line-height: 164px">22</div></th><td class="s17">Attrition Orbs</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:164px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWmb0W8dnz0_1gYVmOcIyB-uhhYeXT1mgxUfiVhxcZZ3blU1JLPRtWYxwEoVSzVpB9PogeMjUN0G58qMNeLYRwgOLwk2lzf-eBq_H8z-3-zcsMXF_Mo6VL9phvNjR7OEz5TaPia34EsCtHjdAo1nNj9QRFHZkYvAqQ_sEM=s164-w70-h164" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine-Based amount </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">damage instances </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5 seconds of each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>The next damage instance creates an <span style="color:#ffd966;">Orb of Power</span> that grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">0.87% ↑1.1% Super Energy.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Counter persists through stow.</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">Damage instances required</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> to make the </span><span style="font-style:italic;">next damage instance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> spawn an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Orb of Power</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>55.55% of Magazine + 1, rounded down.<br>Bows: 4 | Swords: 5 | Grenade Launchers: 3 | Rocket Launchers: 2 | Area-Denial Grenade Launchers: 26<br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Support Auto Rifles healing hits on injured teammates count as 2 hits. (33.5% of Magazine + 1), rounded down on healing hits on damaged allies.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Scorch ticks from Weapon Perks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">do not count.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 0.5 second cooldown upon spawning an Orb. Damage instances during the cooldown will not be counted.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R22" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">23</div></th><td class="s14">Auto-Loading Holster</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYCxBHtErWoH58OOX0Y2EqaW5KJmSTbBlJrF5RX2XYOn6T-q8aV67LNRi9vQim8IOuv26LGqQ8NRq-Bvg-_FoZNRIQTdOf9ayU5kLl0d5VrPW0Q7IxcTPMajGw780Tzs1Ejp0WHAhLSWIwFCZbp_WByVitoxClegQ=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon being </span><span style="font-style:italic;">stowed </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">for </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3.5 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑3.3</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills Magazine.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R23" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">24</div></th><td class="s17">Backup Plan</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY3PBsBXgHfgJU0lLj8PcOgAbPcZ_uuUHX7V-O0nRQzVy3y0amkecFeIZSPlOORSQOI7yyAs1zOrjQS0qjRE0ZDChYRz7dUA8zXMS_AtCRJ0lq3vBA9w8_X_0j-M705GqlPtjORhbPfeKGwQ9_bPrfF4O11UGoKpoM4=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying:<br></span>20% decreased damage, +100 Handling, and 0.7x Charge Time Multiplier for 2 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2.5</span> seconds.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Linear Fusion Rifle exclusive</span>: Shooting refreshes the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Weapon must be stowed for 3 seconds before it can be reactivated.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R24" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">25</div></th><td class="s14">Bait and Switch</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU7MxG99BSrS6T03H6-4p_qVG2siUqFwx9i9dTRIGEuxpTLX-tYurFFowrMVoaBPc5qWg7IuCn-w3p9ONnSWRmZ5Eidz091NZ0HcmQWu8leINX-CMI5dczHe9aElnpNY_PWc4xTN5FppuBEgida5QmzjSRBpCBOIWrQu_s=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring a damage instance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> with </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each equipped weapon within</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">7 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of the</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> last damage instance</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>30% increased damage for 10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11</span> seconds. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Buff cannot be refreshed until its duration expires. Damage Timer is disabled while the perk is active. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R25" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">26</div></th><td class="s17">Barrel Constrictor</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWhE7WIXncvCV2f5x0Bpodbcd2RhmwW4zXh4muBBCm6DmTKRfp9XbA7eluyYCEa-8P7tpaS-cxRgsgBlLY_zKmqr5hGw9kjD5J7g5AGFoiGSswmztaDr6jZb4aUrCe48S5pfGEB5EnUzFkK7bAZ7sFWC_HbxJsofSEelFc=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>-20% Pellet/Projectile Spread for 7.5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑8.5</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Buff cannot be refreshed. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R26" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">27</div></th><td class="s14">Beacon Rounds</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXWi5Rn7IBCZdKesi8oybEsTUtQNybLfdxoMS0Q6TxEqOsczqSr2Tm8iOI6LnecwZ04QTZC0okpbBYwgH3qAxF8KzlqGgps1APGZK0RMX4x1I5px54j32kBztIuXBBeiRbSL_A8EaIXNSq26td8tOIGJuLOYI5zuq6A48Q=s134-w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of Beacon Rounds for 6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7</span> seconds, up to a maximum of 4 stacks.<br>Dealing additional damage extends the buff duration to 4 seconds if the duration is &lt;4 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.</span><br><br>Beacon Rounds:<br>+15 Reload Speed, 0.9x Reload Duration Multiplier, and 45% Increased Projectile Tracking Cone Size.<br>Additional stacks <span style="text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;">only</span> increase the strength of the projectile tracking. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Projectile Tracking is only in effect when the Targeted Reticle is active.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R27" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">28</div></th><td class="s27">Bewildering Burst</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXj3BOj8N6bUec4wWX2WgCyDMIv9gP6ylodE037naKcFnsJFujT_vFu4zQroAot5wky1sIgZkpGzeByWqUdr4pdjmkc6_r5hoij1VVLMzWAivwoLn9p64HJanUuCYbpIcagR2jjAT2Bk6xqi8JGUkd8wJeuzPdBTIJxggM=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing a reload</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">within ? seconds of a Kill:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#999999;">Bewildering Burst</span> for 6<span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑7</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>The next direct hit while <span style="color:#999999;">Bewildering Burst</span> is active launches a <span style="color:#999999;">Flashbang </span>above the enemy that explodes after 0.85 seconds.<br><span style="color:#999999;">Flashbang </span>deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[4]</span> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage </span>and inflicts <span style="color:#999999;">disorient </span>to enemies within 10 meters for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3.5</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[1 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑1.25</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">]</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R28" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">29</div></th><td class="s28">Binary Orbit</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXSrk_vWkxtF8U4inbLiIIUUcChvhhRYhFmbXkjJ2g5TFuI6z60R0m31TtAgIWUz3SdomfAgY9P_NzqbhHRg6z_l_HcaZJTGDKiBRuf9U3ZnUWhz1j7Y2tPnO4hhCXBj1Qu_Hlsm4j9Eh0z7M8cCLoITsxDIMhRLYPtFKI=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a64d79;">Opposing Alignment</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;"> Elemental Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>25% increased damage for 8.5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑10.5</span> seconds.<br>Additional Kills with <span style="color:#a64d79;">Opposing-Alignment sources</span> refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc</span>, <span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar</span>, or <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void </span>Kill<span style="color:#d9d9d9;"> --&gt; </span><span style="color:#b7b7b7;">Kinetic</span><span style="color:#d9d9d9;">, </span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis</span> and<span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> </span><span style="color:#63d275;">Strand</span> Weapons receive buff.<br> <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic</span>, <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis</span>, or <span style="color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="color:#b45f06;">Kill</span><span style="color:#999999;"> </span>--&gt; <span style="color:#d9d9d9;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc</span>, <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar</span>, and <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void</span> Weapons receive buff.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R29" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">30</div></th><td class="s17">Bipod</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUhkvIxEZJdVQBnNTzwuqCkGCq-tLhh-mNPkAzYYCVNNDuQJzQg40LDOI92G177_Hfcr4yfxLTr8lqi4aB_3QSvsi-zlMmX31UGqElYnsOZ9zdyeOmrqjuD04KfluPQyTRkcjqWTJCYzyltgqVwWUEl0eVgSqMgEwg6nCg=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s29" colspan="4"><span style="font-style:normal;">Passively grants the following:<br>+1 Magazine Capacity, +5 Reserves, and 0.75x Fire Recovery Delay<br>25% decreased damage, -30 </span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#ffd966;">↑-25</span><span style="font-style:normal;"> Blast Radius, and -20 </span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#ffd966;">↑-15</span><span style="font-style:normal;"> Reload Speed.<br></span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#ffd966;">Wolfpack Rounds</span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#dd7e6b;"> </span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#e06666;">and all other perk effects, such as Cluster Bombs and Hatchling, are affected by the damage penalty.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R30" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">31</div></th><td class="s30">Blast Distributor</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVzaNr6-d7XO3uSPHE_6THAhPojhyagaOGiDYLrDvxdvXU2dKYDB7E6RbV5-38tym5MjnjcYpJnoEX99AFlvjew6KD4tGVJBaWeas1MxLWhcku1ihMv4E5FX4BQOjy9SXEMnc2KPIlhzjqD9ZJxmF1kHyQ1YQz3Z6xvFnI=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s31" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Upon dealing </span><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Weapon Explosive Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">:<br></span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#e0a261;">+10 </span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#ffd966;">↑+13</span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#e0a261;"> Grenade Stat</span><span style="font-style:normal;"> per stack for 5 seconds, up to a maximum of</span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#e0a261;"> +50 </span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#ffd966;">↑+65</span><span style="font-style:normal;color:#e0a261;"> Grenade Stat</span><span style="font-style:normal;"> at 5 stacks.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;">Buff remains active through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R31" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">32</div></th><td class="s17">Blunt Execution Rounds</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYOFaljYXZpn8281ybRAGbxhBY56beXNeN6k8I1Figdcl5-_u-4zEkBEi0OXbp4xsyvOIxY3RPuVTRkcNQ4kZ9kf7__h9RFQu-s5_Zhz6Zj9T9hDZozAElfW3j9U9VTmthFGiBo_NLWzfaBTjmt9QC1dmEWwFLUQg=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon dealing </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Melee Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while within 15 metres of an enemy:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">500%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [100%]</span> increased damage and +100 Handling for the next burst within 10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11 </span>seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 4 second cooldown after buff expires before it can be reactivated.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> <br>Buff can be triggered while stowed, but is removed on stow if active.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Any Powered Melee which requires sprinting, sliding, or performs a slam </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">will not </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">activate Blunt Execution Rounds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R32" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">33</div></th><td class="s14">Bolt Scavenger</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVpPQ1WfdhUIRjzYCirZUpTjxw5X4JnTLBmds0MaE_Y1eDR1CRbZe7blvHB__PIEwnBS_SsMusDdQo6tAHrgKtFWXKmAQeTgikzAkVZszYxn61zIUij0uYdGwDQhd0ssEqfUNtf8njtb9gEOV9fc8KPV4dKgv6ni9iNK0Y=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">picking up</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Crossbow Bolt</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+? Handling and +? Reload Speed for 15 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑16?</span> seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R33" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">34</div></th><td class="s17">Bottomless Grief</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV0MFDkNDTXh9NzJd_GA-MpxvKzYHHd2XeVysEYYBTZZrKHaCMqP8IMiuukrrQP6dAQH5kSrr4snUD986UOSbiPzL_ffuybT2AoXmpCxq4dT3JKKkLtD64iMn30WbgCzSdgnW6lkniFxvSK0dk1c22rSFAPMLuU8U2iaw=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Passively grants +30 Magazine Stat.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Last Guardian Standing</span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#dd7e6b;">:<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill:<br></span>Refills Magazine.</td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R34" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">35</div></th><td class="s14">Box Breathing</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbhNdCYw_-7fkCXvsP52qVxCl0yHKs5pUzvzgpehmnIgqECjJvDrjvVOe7s85p6JXXrpKBNBiMLuvkMwqPlwQxLwv4wDVd2P1KLiDj8RRGEptDiRQ8ziwCSM5bw4uuYwfuArIEfis-O9OnskPp1myQBzqrovUqWcL_f=w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">1.5 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑1.4 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">seconds of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">ADS</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> without firing while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine is &gt;0</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>10% Increased Aim Assist Falloff Distance and <span style="color:#e69138;">40% increased Weakspot Damage</span><span style="color:#f1c232;"> </span>for the next shot while ADS. <br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Heavy Sniper Rifles</span> and Glaives receive <span style="color:#e69138;">30% increased Weakspot Damage</span> instead.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Timer starts as soon as the Aim Down Sights input is pressed.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspot damage?</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Least convoluted way<br>Buffs </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">&quot;Precision Hits&quot;</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> against </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Shielded Combatants </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and works on weapons without </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Multipliers</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> as long as they hit the weakspot.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspot Buffs</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> do not work</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> on a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Divinity Bubble</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R35" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">36</div></th><td class="s17"><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Built </span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">To </span><span style="color:#93c47d;">Blast</span></td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXldcpKXiee_qgE8EH4pwwBPzxz_7KXvDRqGUFf6wv3oGrbrcGYblr3w02cpeDB-3x-fL9qaAtVyT0AYy3y7FVvDbP-oASnUKCbzksPWsfF1omF-mN8Y5ofJKZpgVav3o_t9JC3Y5rc8PLZsrkXWe2OyjX-P2nfaPQ21ow=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Void Overshield</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">Woven Mail</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> are </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+30? Stability, +? Aim Assist, and ?% Flinch Resist<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Buff lingers for 2 seconds once criteria isn&#39;t met. </span></td></tr><tr style="height: 299px"><th id="1662574278R37" style="height: 299px;"><div style="line-height: 299px">38</div></th><td class="s32">Burning Ambition</td><td class="s33"><div style="width:70px;height:299px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXcPDKJ-_4cxCNSzMbOzplJGCQf3kgdmRQxZoOUCnnuvvnU8JuFllyR8K4k2KwUyJhHS_E63filZyLRaZAWeDTWPQbmXmGLc6rvJUoKFr5E3y4Z9tg8cF8Sam2qDA_MWLPIM6ExPxYBKqSOiJXyIKl3T0KA5U1_4hLQ2YI=s299-w70-h299" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s34" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine-based amount of direct hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">2 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">seconds of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>The next direct hit inflicts <span style="color:#e0a261;">Scorch</span> within 2 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Hit counter persists through stow. Hits do not have to be on the same target.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Scorch </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">inflicted by </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Burning Ambition </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">counts as Weapon Damage.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br><br></span>Hits needed to prepare <span style="color:#e0a261;">Scorching Shot</span>:<br>55% of Magazine, rounded down.<span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span>Bow: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2 </span>| <span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword:</span> 2<span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑1<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Linear FR |</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Precision:</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑1</span>,<span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Burst:</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2?<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Rocket Sidearm:</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑3 Missiles<br></span>Scouts | Precision: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5</span>, Rapid: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑8<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Fusion Rifles:</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11 Bolts<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">MGs | </span>Adaptive: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑13, </span>Aggressive: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑19</span>, Rapid:<span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑28?</span><br>Autos | <span style="color:#f6b26b;">Heat</span>, Precision: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑14</span> | Adaptive, <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Support</span>: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑19</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#e0a261;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;">| </span>Rapid: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑23<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Trace Rifle:</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑29<br><br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Scorching Shot</span> and direct hits against <span style="color:#e0a261;">Scorched Enemies</span> inflict <span style="color:#e0a261;">Scorch</span>.<br><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span> inflict<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> x10</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#a4c2f4;">+5</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#ea9999;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[x4</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#ea9999;">+5?</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> against Scorched Guardians]</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;"> </span><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Scorch.<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Special </span>and <span style="color:#a481e1;">Power </span>Weapons inflict <span style="color:#f6b26b;">x20</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+10</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Scorch</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 0.5 second cooldown upon inflicting Scorch before additional Scorch can be inflicted. Cooldown is GLOBAL, not per-enemy.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 239px"><th id="1662574278R38" style="height: 239px;"><div style="line-height: 239px">39</div></th><td class="s14">Butterfly</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:239px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXteMUQl0e5c_2URZUAN2eId4j5e057yscCjTAfBosbb66N_ETQSAVJo4vvcUVodRS7kGh0UBbkw1XwS5P1nXOB2oCCyDpJYSQgJPN7N9ifq2ME48E0hYahl0bR7kpOiPxjNr2rJsTuc3v_UObao8M_tDcT7kzGGcsAy0o=s239-w70-h239" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">1.5 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑1.4 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">seconds of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">ADS</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> without firing while</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Magazine is &gt;0</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>The next Direct Damage Kill cause targets to <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">explode </span>on death, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">varying</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon-Matching Damage</span> over ~8 meters, down to 30% damage.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">On Rocket Launcher </span><span style="color:#63d275;">(Crux Celeritas IV)</span>: <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Damage Kills</span> count, but the kill must be scored while still ADS.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Timer starts as soon as the Aim Down Sights input is pressed. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Buff is removed after no longer ADS, or upon scoring a kill.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Perk can retrigger after 1.4 seconds of ADS without firing </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">as long as the weapon is loaded</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Butterfly Maximum Damage:<br></span>Scout Rifle: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span><br>Bow: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">453</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Trace Rifle</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">473 </span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Shotgun: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">590<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Sniper Rifle</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Glaive</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Crossbow:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">836<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Linear Fusion Rifle: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">689<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Rocket Launcher: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">836</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R39" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">40</div></th><td class="s17">Cascade Point</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXDw-Zkme9zFpUfJwPY_hWQ8CodKZa331pS746CTJdgdxggx9_tvdn-byA_v-rRwej-yWLZ3TEtbVr-9TM0dNxqfjjt0UY090zcekimcUJ1eCpg6-rr5aAJWSdqH_ODKZrLAW5V7xWOdiuYEmScrQn7j_wMlIhVv5fF1w=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring multiple</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;"> Precision Hits</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of each </span><span style="font-style:italic;">with a different weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring a kill with a different weapon:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#b6d7a8;">Cascade Point Ready</span> for 5 seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying the weapon while </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b6d7a8;">Cascade Point Ready</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is active:<br></span>Grants Cascade Point for 2.5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2.75</span> seconds.<br>Cascade Point grants 0.7x Fire Recovery Delay for Machine Guns and Submachine Guns, and 0.6x Fire Recovery Delay for everything else.<br><br><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span> work on a Counter System, granting Cascade Point Ready upon reaching 100%.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">2 Precision Hits</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Bows, Linear Fusion Rifles, Shotguns, and Sniper Rifles.</span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">4 Precision Hits</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Hand Cannons, Scout Rifles, and Sidearms.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">6 Precision Hits</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Auto Rifles, Machine Guns, Pulse Rifles, Submachine Guns, and Trace Rifles. </span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R40" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">41</div></th><td class="s14">Celerity</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaQBgCygHMjjGs4lmfOAtyEfx7gbOaDk2M_pAYfiuj_kCiH3G0YcqLEuXpDNDkTynuKi16x6x8a8NbvvViT-bAkzLi8f-R34LE3YDN-xprT5ZRk8RGvoByXx2Wr5S7621siaMIt2EAgKZjV5AksQ4b_Ao5usDxDBQ=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 Handling and +20 Reload Speed.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Last Guardian Standing</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;"><br></span>+100 Handling, +100 Reload Speed, +? Aim Assist, 50% Flinch Resist, increased accuracy, stronger scope highlight, and enables radar while ADS.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R41" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">42</div></th><td class="s35">Chain Reaction</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWT590_zVaHHRJBazqPQvIftYv3ZGlP-TBMGuKGhkfWglpxL9mIRIQak-o7v8b4JyWUvdtn-YtAt7HMi1UNeD5E8eMhV9qRGyuCUxEVvr54HGUW_RpJemAL4GhHbA2VHdyz_GbgyOCgd6JrU9MWz63XX84gHP_FB8E8-w=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;"><br></span>Target explodes, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">varying</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[</span><span style="color:#63d275;">Special = 44.8? </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑49.3? | </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Power =</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">72.8</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑80?</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">] </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon-Element Matching Damage</span>, down to 0% damage.<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Rocket Pulse: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">158</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑174</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> | Breech GL: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">189 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑208 </span><span style="color:#63d275;">| Shotgun, Area Denial GL:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">236</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑260</span> <span style="color:#63d275;">| Glaive:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">284 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑313</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span><span style="color:#63d275;">| 2.4m No Falloff, 6m Maximum Falloff on Special Weapons<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Wave GL, MG, Sword:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">352 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑387 </span>| <span style="color:#a481e1;">Drum GL, LFR</span>: <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">448</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑493 </span>| <span style="color:#a481e1;">RL:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">543</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑598  </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">|</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">3m No Falloff, 7m Maximum Falloff for Power Weapons</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +20 Guard Endurance to </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords</span><span style="color:#ffd966;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 239px"><th id="1662574278R42" style="height: 239px;"><div style="line-height: 239px">43</div></th><td class="s36">Chaos Reshaped</td><td class="s37"><div style="width:70px;height:239px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX8wSBd7gj45cCrvXu6eY3fQFap42gnO5mnWqjWavRbalc_sLfAORxuiyMLYOjVCkII8RwCATGr0WQhu2bCePIjR5naB8cpG7myFEwXrZlQBmI6kOnAvdoT7a-fYAQT1I9oZZaPoaYQz318oXQIzA1G5mGCvgofT8Y-Jec=s239-w70-h239" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s38" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After having maintained a state of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">dealing </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;">receiving damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> every </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> for at least</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> 12 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑11.5</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#e8cc94;">Chaos Reshaped x1</span> | 20% Increased damage for 7 seconds. <br>Dealing or receiving damage refreshes the buff duration. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>After maintaining </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e8cc94;">Chaos Reshaped x1</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> for an </span><span style="font-style:italic;">additional 12 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑11.5</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#e8cc94;">Chaos Reshaped x2 </span>| 35% Increased damage for 7 seconds and triggers a <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healing effect </span>while active.<br>Dealing or receiving damage refreshes the buff duration. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.<br><br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Chaos Reshaped x2 Healing Effect<br>Charges </span>up a <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing-over-time effect </span>at a rate of <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">5 HP/s</span> while readied, <span style="color:#ffd966;">AUTOMATICALLY TRIGGERING </span>after <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">charging 35 HP (7 seconds) </span>or upon stowing the weapon.<br>The <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Effect</span> <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 5 HP/s </span>equal to the <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">charge </span>built, effectively becoming constant if the weapon is readied for 7 seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Reduces the time needed in-combat to grant a stack of Chaos Reshaped to 11.5 seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R43" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">44</div></th><td class="s39">Chill Clip</td><td class="s40"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUrVNg9Jag69jjqa0AkH0JMzLWMgyOIEPzEDLNkI41rsqBDKC-EJCOmHqtK3CyzKgYm3s0jMEdf4okI44u02vnTXiVRJ1zRwzUnCLy01LsmwLsKuwclCsmHEaT6_ZhqBxtb4qZ91LRCrWP8GO2mdbND6z3Ri-0061rnE7U=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s41" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">at or above 50% </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑40%</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Magazine Capacity</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Direct Hits trigger a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Burst</span>, inflicting <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">x60 Slow </span>for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">4</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#a4c2f4;">+4</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[1.5</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#ea9999;">+0.5</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">]</span> seconds to enemies within 4? meters.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Rapid-Fire Fusion Rifles </span>and <span style="color:#93c47d;">Rocket Sidearms</span> inflict <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">x40 Slow</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Can only trigger once per shot.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R44" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">45</div></th><td class="s14">Circle of Life</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubi