ation by +5 seconds, up to 10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11</span> seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R46" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">47</div></th><td class="s14">Closing Time</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUhgYhaxXqg3VoK6KCORmj8TEzLidC7f1ZjyN5lFrAOf-B9ddKlnHx2bbNIdLZhBsCZRCoweIhf8zCAY2HByhVPCRHudnPH_thtXihcsexEX5CozTrYqtFYVHzg-Kc_lUzBVT1T6GKJvBg_vUiO7Yzlm66FolPGXjUnPrQ=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">As </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">decreases </span><span style="font-style:italic;">below 50%,</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> down to </span><span style="font-style:italic;">0%</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span> Grants +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, +30? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, 0.9x? Handling Duration Multiplier, and -5%? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-%?</span> Accuracy Cone Size at 50% Magazine.<br>Dynamically scales up to +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, +50? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, 0.8x? Handling Duration Multiplier, and -10%? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-?%</span> Accuracy Cone Size at 0% Magazine.<br><br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Special Weapons receive halved benefits.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R47" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">48</div></th><td class="s17">Clown Cartridge</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZGjofxF0zIXczBDCR1kh_F81eNPd1DofD