n><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑33% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[10% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">]</span> increased damage for an <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental-Pickup based duration</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Firesprites</span> and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Breaches</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> </span>grant +8 seconds. <br><span style="color:#d0e0e3;">Ionic Traces</span>, <span style="color:#9fc5e8;">Stasis Shards</span>, and both the Pickup AND Explosion of <span style="color:#63d275;">Tangle</span>/<span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Elemental Orb</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> </span>grant +4 seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>Additional pickups extend the buff duration by their corresponding duration, up to 16 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R51" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">52</div></th><td class="s43">Collective Demolition</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVMIvHNMeRdZ7cwQdsSaUVasHeApe7SiiyQQVpeasMZLc1f2LVHUJ7VfaQRQ88oHlYubH_cTVmajI7qS6BI3ylpLo_3queDjvDMokF0mc5_nLciF3Vb2RPKCi3ZiOQYwvjRc8ooTZtPHZkZv4vPUdQqMINz4VK2CPZTuow=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4"><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental-Pickup Interaction</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:</span><br>Scoring damage instances grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑increased</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Energy</span> for an <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental-Pickup based duration</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Firesprites</span> and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Breaches</span> grant +8 seconds. <br><span style="color:#d0e0e3;">Ionic Traces</span>, <span style="color:#9fc5e8;">Stasis Shards</span>, and both the Pickup AND Explosion of <span style="color:#63d275;">Tangles</span>/<span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Elemental Orbs</span> grant +4 seconds. <br>Additional pickups extend the buff duration by their corresponding duration, up to 16 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Gains:<br></span>PENDING AT SOME POINT :)<br>PENDING AT SOME POINT :)<br>PENDING AT SOME POINT :)</td></tr><tr style="height: 254px"><th id="1662574278R52" style="height: 254px;"><div style="line-height: 254px">53</div></th><td class="s43">Collective Pugilism</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:254px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUWiW4CymEpePvEbheO8fWbqL-uMH_IcuFvlHoIHtCGa-xJ4l9Zv3sr6H_v86vKWBgLXTKWLacBMkrZJrCNL7mtCku1MRl26VSZKactNvQbd_99-e2Ax8A2vrBH1EcDcYgkYEZaStETrrknaI1xBXOZHKfiaGonMUXiuQY=s254-w70-h254" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4"><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental-Pickup Interaction</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:</span><br>Scoring damage instances grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑increased</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Melee Ability Energy</span> for an <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental-pickup based duration</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Firesprites</span> and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Breaches </span>grant +8 seconds. <br><span style="color:#d0e0e3;">Ionic Traces</span>, <span style="color:#9fc5e8;">Stasis Shards</span>, and both the Pickup AND Explosion of <span style="color:#63d275;">Tangles</span>/<span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Elemental Orbs</span> grant +4 seconds. <br>Additional pickups extend the buff duration by their corresponding duration seconds, up to 16 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Ability Gains:<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Spreadshot HC:</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">0.5%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.55%<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Burst Sidearm:</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">0.78%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.86%<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Fusion Rifle</span>: <span style="color:#89cdd1;">1.15%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑1.27%</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Rocket Pulse</span>: <span style="color:#89cdd1;">1.95%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2.15%<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Sidearm</span>: <span style="color:#89cdd1;">2.34% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2.57%</span><br><span style="color:#999999;">Scout:</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">3.34%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑3.67%</span><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Rocket Launcher: </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">12.9%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑14.2%</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R53" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">54</div></th><td class="s17">Compulsive Reloader</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUsG1gMl3BZEov8RYcjYC6WMsq4_ovPENEOaETHTcHX94SkXT_BRAHq4vPeV4NQz5GDrSWD2_667_VDli5HbGapJrIllFWXJU-32oFi-7eRFaID5lor4ZAOhLCwbpcqdexhm9Vg3HV90ZLYtldwO36CMDPX4PeKQrU9-Tg=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While above </span><span style="font-style:italic;">50% Magazine Capacity</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑55 </span>Reload Speed and 0.95x Reload Duration Multiplier.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R54" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">55</div></th><td class="s14">Controlled Burst</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVTCAUC6sDjg1XNK44IAsD6yjR_AymVCXf5TxRIii9FCNNR05otbxLiSFGZUPr7-lraPEbTayQ4QDHdZKnQam-nCTSkXUotwXNIdK6yPuJsZ_UM8JJLbhfOfCWm4yKzlI4DhEYcpII1xwT1TYtiOJIijzoRs3kQ6zLHtcA=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a hit with </span><span style="font-style:italic;">every bolt in the burst,</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>20% increased damage and 0.9x Charge Time Multiplier for 2 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2.5</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> </span>seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R55" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">56</div></th><td class="s11">Cooling Baubles</td><td class="s12"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV9dgc2_QvnIxrK-xQPDiRGiMfUdNtBM6c5_lCgZt3jOEjJytpq6oET2R5qBaZYdYYjfKk280_RqXa5H4ZdpmWOya7OfHdkJf7ATvqJrpzrXwZ27StL9mePKccNOlKuE6yKy5djxI13lrcyBOZ6PhNucLR_SwRNVTIXQJ8=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;ob