ckup</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#bba5f3;">Dimensional Breach</span> until the next Weapon Kill.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Can be triggered and persists through stow.<br><br>Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#bba5f3;">Dimensional Breach</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is active:<br></span>Weapon Kills grants<span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> 22.5 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑25</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> Void Overshield </span>for 8<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#bba5f3;">+4</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span>seconds for the next 5? seconds.<br>Additional Weapon Kills extend the buff duration to 5 seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R69" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">70</div></th><td class="s17">Discord</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX0IqB23HtCMcB66O47pDqEpKZBvB-bluty5fk447wjWapbBUlRxIgVdT_DZmhp-f0mqqXYqOrj2FGZv3rwetCZEjt3al_GDdnsOX16n4ZDXwgqqI-D0Vaf6NakZJrWca7QlKMZOAOqbzrxryCkDauCWs2HCPYJlN4C5eE=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying a weapon within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">kill </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">with a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">different weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>0.75x ADS Duration Multiplier, -25% Accuracy Cone Size, and +30 Airborne Effectiveness for 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑8</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Discord </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Refills Magazine on Primary Weapons</span> | Refunds 1 Ammo per shot on <span style="color:#63d275;">Special </span>and <span style="color:#a481e1;">Power </span>Weapons.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R70" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">71</div></th><td class="s20">Disorienting Grenades</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWufOaX5gsex3_nVatAAx2wH1xcWplKrXSwq1SiRSxX19m8TsJ5x0B_CE_MucBA_eoJ15ClwHyriSU8GqtbLVb3PXt54Q3gOSWvL2gdSH2Un0a6I4IzhXHuDvCDtEarOT_L0-X78ZTYxRJryzZ7QSU67v0scuks68kuH0U=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants -200 Blast Radius, 25% decreased damage, and 15% decreased explosion damage radius.<br><br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File, Elite, and Miniboss Combatants</span> within 6 metres of the explosion are <span style="color:#999999;">disoriented</span><span style="color:#b7b7b7;"> </span>for 4.5 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Champions</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Bosses</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> can be considered </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">disoriented </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">but </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">will not be impaired by its effects</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Disorient </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">radius cannot be altered.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>briefly lose their HUD and have their screen distorted for up to ? seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Duration varies depending on the distance from the blast.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R71" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">72</div></th><td class="s27">Disruption Break</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYIaAG2YL7gHVVmN5ok52G9C-qZ-wbdprdTFbMm6S-grp0uJk8Tj8P4vx1sUDxWgkI0hbo2p-ZmNd03BIgzavGaAQQquKQHgP6j2kfCvM8W1chFZ7w9tiddK584bBVS9BqtwNj2DIP5tu83U7jpCQZsAPxkk8CdAl_-=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Barrier </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">Guardian </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Shield Break</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Inflicts <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage Vulnerability</span> on the enemy, increasing <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage Taken</span><span style="color:#b7b7b7;"> b</span>y 50% for <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5.5 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[5]</span> seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Does not affect </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Strand </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Damage.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Stacks with all other Buffs and Debuffs (including itself).<br> Can be applied multiple times on a single enemy, with each stack having its own duration and stacking multiplicatively.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R72" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">73</div></th><td class="s48">Dragonfly</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYFxTLZhGyFoSy9sJfJS4rXT5KjM77n-uSUMzw7sTr7FUAny2K0qEWH9k8-TKnZ8loCB7MX_AXUshHjhetKdy-HjKzM3NYmTIekNunxlM1N-iJocD4gek61Mbfu-EnPomxG4i1bkdHmbWOiNah_4N-u85uRPoSv1yJC=w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill:<br></span>Target explodes, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Ammo-Type Based </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[95.3]</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon-Matching Damage</span> over a 8 meter radius, down to a minimum of 0% Damage at the farthest point.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Ammo</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">332 </span>