ngth removes all bullet spread and grants higher than initial accuracy.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R77" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">78</div></th><td class="s17">Eager Edge</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXBEBoCjlqtkD8GvGJe8dzFKA3c3IsLEHtqbNfTqnEdrtHSXWSYzTdGlbi4DYfrQheBowBF67QruYUnm5S_aYRBrln0Rk6WgUEdz1bghkGMEHz4Qgr8qtdewaa2VDnwmmaMCQei_3WwKf4cKJ_ySBYFQ1mrSGdU9E8yYLU=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying a Sword:<br></span>80% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑100%</span> Increased Lunge Distance for the next swing within 3 seconds. Airborne Lunge Distance is <span style="color:#e06666;">decreased </span>by 20%.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 3 second cooldown after the buff is removed. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R78" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">79</div></th><td class="s49">Eddy Current</td><td class="s50"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX5tm16IplkNDQqkaZs0ZRfLuWfxvGenCERJ0HNqlmzCcTIsSjvxCJsO7NAkQpsWft4fj2XkhH4nAMlj6prlu7UOuu0SCB-CSPd6-RDNseo2-eyoLD4Fz-Zn-AtO8w_bPl658mVufK_qISBn7nLIhf5c0c09ndzQwuR4A=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">sprinting </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">for </span><span style="font-style:italic;">1.5 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while the</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> weapon </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">readied:<br></span>+? Handling, 0.95x Handling Animation Multiplier, +20 Reload Speed, and 0.95x Reload Duration Multiplier for 3 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Starting to sprint refreshes the buff duration.<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Amplified:<br></span>Grants the sprint bonuses passively, and increases the Reload Speed buff to +60 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R79" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">80</div></th><td class="s28">Elemental Capacitor</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZaShxe49LLKyseSwvTE0US3GwoiM0SWl8hImerV2SjF1aHRoh_UpQxhENw-WyXABeV0Y1nzgiAYtT-WdDxreSHtlMTi4wUbrn_AIp-HW0ghoN0eaoQMVanl0maA8o7_VCv7EDw8AK9iHtP2974nT4uM5LpekJ_bA=w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4">Passively grants Stat Bonuses depending on the element of the equipped <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Solar: +50 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Reload Speed.</span><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc: +50</span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55</span><span style="color:#a2c4c9;"> </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Handling.<br></span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void: +20</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+25</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Stability.<br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> Stasis: +20 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+25 </span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Recoil Direction and 20% Decreased ADS Movement Speed Penalty.<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Strand: +20 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+25</span><span style="color:#63d275;"> Airborne Effectiveness.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R80" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">81</div></th><td class="s28">Elemental Honing</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUKbZhdEtHLxNInNLqnAjjaEMEUPbpXuCyAGmMjfg2PjQqrd_5LelHu85Cvaham-K506Zsax3YYzDTpyyzKvS1sGQsUe1ymn86eHN_ti8BMHiKNBUvdbrBmtno2uDXTkrXxiEDjI1anXfWfO1c_DSwvyMDSTGdo0A09GKE=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4">Dealing <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental Damage</span> grants a stack of <span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Honing</span> for 20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑23</span> seconds for each <span style="color:#e06666;">unique </span><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Element</span> used, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#c27ba0;">5 stacks</span> by using <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">5 unique elements</span>.<br><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Buff duration</span> is refreshed upon gaining a <span style="color:#c27ba0;">stack</span>, and cannot be refreshed once<span style="color:#c27ba0;"> 5 stacks</span> have been reached.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated and persists through stow. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">does not</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> trigger the buff.</span><br><br><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Honing x1 </span>|<span style="color:#c27ba0;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">2.5%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[1.25%]</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> Increased Elemental Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">10% Increased Kinetic Weapon Damage</span>.<br><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Honing x2</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10%</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[5%]</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> Increased Elemental Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">20% Increased Kinetic Weapon Damage</span>.<br><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Honing x3 </span>| <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">20% Increased Elemental Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">30% Increased Kinetic Weapon Damage</span>.<br><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Honing x4</span> | <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">30% Increased Elemental Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">35% Increased Kinetic Weapon Damage</span>.<br><span style="color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Honing x5 </span>| <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">35% Increased Elemental Weapon Damage</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">40% Increased Kinetic Weapon Damage</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R81" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">82</div></th><td class="s17">En Garde</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXN_lfQw2lqPpvASebsGPm0De0onWRqc-2Adgn-GXl7a2Td80EvpafanZTa53rbnjGmjyCPO4fxKnYzwZtsSJqr4IQCFlrlPM7eBWiNQxLdXXlLTS8YKgaqsPPPdyCnuP8Eysi8TrWogSL-qsNGI45wRHlte1DKGQPOyMM=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying a Sword:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span>30% Increased damage for 1.5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2?</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 2? second cooldown after the buff is removed.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R82" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">83</div></th><td class="s14">Encore</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX7w3STUIGbtRG0KVbs4uwvbHYOF0u8fUPyhL_S_DhxJw9sLeiXZBObcxOOD9VmX5OYeTXFFb71dRZHrgHRs1anXIcBfZUP_WriQ1wbRMRLG1j50QqGyK9ZZSNORdesrp2hYyAc9A2BPlX5p3pPo1Fi9FTBcNUyP2hIIQ=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+5 Range, +8 Stability, and -1.25% Accuracy Cone Size per stack for 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7.5</span> seconds, up to a maximum of 4 stacks. <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Kills</span> grant 2 stacks.<br>Additional Weapon Kills refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R83" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">84</div></th><td class="s52">Energy Transfer</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVUqKmG5nyeA0TvKP7V5FWppvUz_GSLw4F6JrQVJRh4f86Qynx4zYr46NWBFzmqjX_hm2R3vBsJUwrNmOqbVDFyGcZzg71wMt1_x7Ut_i2SsrsZIhP42gB03Zh_S3z4AzdfOZKXGqG2X9HvYpGjHoy6JHcFZbyvnCdjBg=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Guarding </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">with a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Sword</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Every point of damage taken grants <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">1.5% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑1.55%</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> Class Ability Energy</span> when <span style="color:#79bec3;">Melee Damage </span>is blocked.<br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">1% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑1.25%</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> Class Ability Energy</span> when Non-Melee Damage is blocked.<br><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">0.5% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.625%</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> Class Ability Energy</span> when receiving Non-Blocked damage.</td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R84" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">85</div></th><td class="s14">Enlightened Action</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXealXeUeslBj3zfvtg4sCkMy27lPLn6WFmfxCzMlbDpFU8ivWHwmL1tcxbz7mLsey_-ms5t7M7dF1DrYsRt_vbUQ9MLUHqav0k38BrWmPuSdjx8514c7jBmWiOxwDf9stgOaJAHhWKFCMrnonKjQFVq3nZaaDcDFoyufg=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring a hit</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants stacks of Enlightened Action for 2 seconds, up to a maximum of 12.<span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span>Enlightened Action grants an <span style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;">average</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span>of +4 Handling and Reload Speed per stack, up to +50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55?</span> Handling and +50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55? </span>Reload Speed.<br><br>Enlightened Action:<br>+2 | +5 | +5 | +3 | +5 | +5 | +5 | +5 | +3 | +2 | +5 | +5 Handling and Reload Speed.<br><br>Hand Cannon hits grant 3 stacks. Bow hits grant ? stacks.<br>Automatic Weapons grant 1 stack per hit.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R85" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">86</div></th><td class="s17">Ensemble</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVlChSqpopbmnsBO1qyJIhknTanb0MPbgupRPfsx2vrkyUWZCpbrM7smHIM6Q_nw5rbvULafsrZWPY1FZ5N0IV3VhuFQBWMwdqsPdSqxl6GVC8DxnyYt79E6BDqOxZrK0Mid0G-BYc9AoL96L5cEi-TxHPZsVjsAf-TVcA=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is within 15 metres:<br></span>+30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+35</span> Handling and +40 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+45 </span>Reload Speed.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff lingers for 1.5 seconds once criteria isn&#39;t met.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R86" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">87</div></th><td class="s14">Envious Arsenal</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUtgJUhmZ8WpmHO_zW28KZDlnOhAS4-BbZrYIwsVgIm7Gf3KeW6h9bb-93rSnZP0cUuQ_pf4QBmr9qnncunPdr-EI0z_5nyEOgfFJ6odDMJcCySKe2qj7yN8sb37OFXeGk3LgxH1LjHMvUJ4AEu8gWy51hANQG6rioy1oc=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">dealing ANY damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> with </span><span style="font-style:italic;">both other weapons</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and then </span><span style="font-style:italic;">readying </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">the weapon:<br></span>Fully refills magazine.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Damage-Over-Time effects also work.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +10 Ammo Generation.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R87" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">88</div></th><td class="s17">Envious Assassin</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa4rne07Lh7ndlazu-t8BA0fTbZhh3q8vClEp8RN8bD-LPQYzu_PSSgU57GXIpa5_fb99iQ5wvYNRKmQ1_qPZI74DgPQiCeFAo5vcr4s6eT9j4zfExjEE0r3hE5lyLwUQNJh7PsYUqcCWaOLr1VImP2rpTdyMRf10n5=w70-h134" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying the weapon after scoring kills with a different weapon:<br></span>Overflows Magazine from reserves based on the amount of kills achieved, up to 200% Increased Magazine Size.<br><br><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span>: 10% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑12.5%</span> Increased Magazine Capacity per Kill.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Special Weapons </span>| <span style="color:#a481e1;">Power Weapons</span>: 20% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑22.5%</span> Increased Magazine Capacity per Kill.<br><br>Each activation can grant up to 100% Increased Magazine Capacity if activated with a full magazine. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Always rounds magazine up.</span><br><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Can overflow based on the magazine size at the moment of swapping, i.e. if empty and after reaching the max bonus, magazine capacity will be fully refilled. </span></td></tr><tr style="height: 194px"><th id="1662574278R88" style="height: 194px;"><div style="line-height: 194px">89</div></th><td class="s14">Explosive Head</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:194px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW50NSRaz21siLVcIBt726WGk0sUtgR4UAh4KniBFllt3LBzWEjJRVjqB4ApqEolEzdhEUS6Xbk8w4LVIEwEHROEzn340MIOcWWn8B5OV9XnKEJD8SC7vX1k-HvyB6uxin2uJ6Q8HSwTuNZuCBOoVkECF2dDuBDX4Zxsw=s194-w70-h194" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Bows deal 50% of their <span style="color:#999999;">Non-Precision</span> Direct Impact Damage as an <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload</span>.<br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload</span> detonates after a distance-based timer, damaging enemies within 3 meters.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Explosive Payload portion deals 30% increased damage and inflicts increased stagger against Combatants.<br></span><br>Impact Damage&#39;s <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Multiplier</span> is increased to offset the <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload portion</span> lacking the ability to score <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span>.<br>New Ratio = (Base Ratio - 50%) / (1 - 50%)<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Overall Damage Increase:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Damage is increased by 15% of the Weapon&#39;s Bodyshot Damage. </span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage Increase</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> is equal to 15% / </span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Multiplier</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">.<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Damage remains the same.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Accuracy.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R89" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">90</div></th><td class="s53">Explosive Light</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXbPnujyMYAjABT60SqKeANWhyBfiNlfTztT_nDiVcmlurgLaWKZa6MxiaOnFW6wDnbNCM5Vo4iMulqPZ7rSC1WQ5omOKG5jK23oZPCA1b2Jj9nmA49dLwXq-fMRyMnCs6RWZPQZp4aCXbNbo8GDfGc9bDQnYMQzxvSq2Q=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-style:italic;">On</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> Orb of Power</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> Pickup: <br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffe599;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffe599;">Explosive Light</span>, up to a maximum of 6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7</span> stacks.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffe599;">Stacks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">can be obtained while stowed, and are lost on death.</span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><br>Firing consumes a <span style="color:#ffe599;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffe599;">Explosive Light</span>, granting increased damage, and setting the Blast Radius stat to 100.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Grenade Launchers </span>receive 60% increased explosive damage.<span style="color:#a481e1;"><br>Rocket Launchers </span>receive 25% increased impact and explosive damage. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not increase</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Wolfpack Rounds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 209px"><th id="1662574278R90" style="height: 209px;"><div style="line-height: 209px">91</div></th><td class="s14">Explosive Payload</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLajwt6FMUBX0KAdKjDS7A_Z4yieqDAN9IE7r7NujF5e6OosDGWBVFUmXBYhATpGtr0SjEXM5nmcDNGrnECY0mIznazIa9hUp2ynb6XYaAn7lEgTaFFLno7JnL7cQbCA6_vNEdwWhqFqQwM2YHtHM3sPpFDMBcS-5Ryc=w70-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Weapons deal 50% of their <span style="color:#999999;">Non-Precision</span> Direct Impact Damage as an <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload</span>.<br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload</span> detonates on impact, damaging enemies within 3 meters.<br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload</span> portion deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">30% increased</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[7% decreased on Hand Cannons]</span> damage and inflicts increased stagger.<br><br>Impact Damage&#39;s <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Multiplier</span> is increased to offset the <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload portion</span> lacking the ability to score <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span>.<br>New Ratio = (Base Ratio - 50%) / (1 - 50%)<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Overall Damage Increase:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Damage is increased by 15% of the Weapon&#39;s Bodyshot Damage. </span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage Increase</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> is equal to 15% / </span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Multiplier</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">.<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Bodyshot damage remains the same. </span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> remains &quot;roughly&quot; the same.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Reload Speed.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R91" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">92</div></th><td class="s17">Eye of the Storm</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLairo-e350mVc8xO54loxRYGiG5HOfJkFRWIBsq2HR0_E2s9KNjZUZ-jy9BZSWO0gZe-yCmIUgU4lnUSYjVpZmgQgW5m5GsAdmDhfQ48R9EXHDTJ3115tjUE5JU-OE5F7bwdzzYhc8ki4K3PH4eElU61A66vSWvww=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">As </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#7cadff;">Shield HP</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> drops, initially triggering at </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#7cadff;">40 Shield HP</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, maxing out in effect </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">at </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#7cadff;">0 Shield HP</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Linearly grants <span style="text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;">up to</span> +30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+33</span> Handling, -40% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-44%</span> Accuracy Cone Size, and -17% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-19%</span> Accuracy Cone Growth.<br>Buff dynamically scales from 0% effect at <span style="color:#7cadff;">80 Shield HP</span>, up to 100% effect at <span style="color:#7cadff;">0 Shield HP</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-style:italic;">(also known as </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Critical Health</span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-style:italic;">)</span><span style="font-size:6pt;"><br></span> <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff lasts until </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#7cadff;">Shields </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">are restored to </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#7cadff;">80 Shield HP</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R92" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">93</div></th><td class="s14">Feeding Frenzy</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbVKvs5iz4jaAy-bx85plrCKYGHajNYT019iAz5RGN4qyAy1gY4Vad4-p4ne2Lo_Jvj50sSsa12uuS4dTHkPX8RIY3345kvKIJYYTPLGR-51iKyYUynkj2Ni3zCAWuGK9bM9KPisqPTKrgJp_axx7DSwSO3JlPSkkyz=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants Reload Speed and Reload Duration Multiplier per stack for 3.5 seconds, up to a maximum of 5 stacks.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persist through stow.</span><br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span>+8 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+13 </span>| +50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55</span> | +60 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+65</span> | +75 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+85</span> | +100 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+100</span> Reload Speed.<br>0.975x | 0.9x | 0.87x | 0.84x | 0.8x Reload Duration Multiplier.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R93" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">94</div></th><td class="s17">Field Prep</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaCofQFSNXq5vN17MNPb41Cr-v5GCn9P6r4sDZdfxkdLZDUADzOV4-dJ0BTRJpHi4kWVodKae8-7_LJ991KXhd3KgD_B7pi9Hf0dAVP6OUWaMdiQTkY8yYAkCWiRuvQF5RnHzQwUyPgQ0uIQnUkAOeZLfYV-HCdomVD=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+30 </span>Ammo Generation.<br><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Crouched</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55?</span> Reload Speed, 0.8x Reload Duration Multiplier, and 0.8x Ready/Stow Duration Multiplier.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R94" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">95</div></th><td class="s44">Firefly</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVP7a1XVQfIr1bqGATq5LQ5_Mc-Rpl_DBg1HERlQgo1HTn4kSP1HvLzbNAv31SblZ5lxF7CdfHoI5EeASlepaERMI2NIoPAbCfoC5iuV2hWJcrbmn8ohJZD53XFP55ZA12JaJWLY68Ns8QfDDsg7IAqUDdHEB32zFlETw=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">:<br></span>Target explodes, dealing up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">104 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[80]</span><span style="color:#f6b26b;"> Solar Damage</span> in a 7.5 metre radius, and grants +50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">+55</span> Reload Speed for 6 seconds. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Reload Buff persists through stow. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Damage against Combatants scales differently by Weapon Type and Combatant Rank :)</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R95" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">96</div></th><td class="s17">Firing Line</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXtGGIxL9epLt-zIt3N11oWJh_-6I6Wr7glZyEeaZBUeN902LetPcZKhuiVdMW-GSXSRu12QUNES1dYeXsWcpun5nDrdI4403ZYvpollu0BORdHjYCOz8X4G1db5HJt6VGETapRYpX7mY6V4Yt1C3OT3krVmhNG33SNkz4=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">15 metres</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">2 allies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>20% Increased <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage.<br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+10 Handling while perk is active.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R96" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">97</div></th><td class="s14">Firmly Planted</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa1Ecu4bq4UhsKK11eViwkHFrF1l_K7ofqY2ueE4WEEtiDQpsHTSDqnn8dNdmoGlUyw7IG8dtYPFWtxzIPP8ES5uSqroIf7cyalL8MBVUr94h2AKa39PBDXcBeHl0TqZhn-25W71W2xrSZJcrZeIi7WWov3zLp0KGgA=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While Crouched:<br></span>+20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+25</span> Stability, +30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+35</span> Handling, -40% Accuracy Cone Size, -17% Accuracy Cone Growth, and -80% Recoil Yaw <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Horizontal Recoil)</span><br><span style="color:#93c47d;">[Fusion Rifles] 10 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+13</span><span style="color:#93c47d;"> Stability, +15 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+18</span><span style="color:#93c47d;"> Handling, -20% Accuracy Cone Size, -8.5% Accuracy Cone Growth, and -40% Recoil Yaw </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">(Horizontal Recoil)</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R97" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">98</div></th><td class="s17">Flash Counter</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXobAOdJjEyNggr2RzfzVZ7qn45LbU9OCgHy13rNbvsYmwByHVZzzDXCA1VuZzBQtVYqRGd9AjM6xbOoZzKSRNs86PfXM0fl5v7dXGE0PMmHaNgn77ZEy3zqV6Qvc7OrDM1vVmpEYFBgkV1u-svYkyFOn-eLpIAhfUhVA=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">receiving damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">guarding</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Triggers a <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Frontal Blast</span>, dealing up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">110</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?] </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon-Matching Damage</span> and <span style="color:#999999;">disorienting </span>Combatants in a large cone up to ~8? meters away for 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑6</span> seconds.<br>Damage scales from <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">75</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[14]</span> at point-blank, up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">110</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[45]</span> at ? meters. <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Concussion strength against Guardians scale similarly with distance</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Damage against Combatants scales with </span><span style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#a4c2f4;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://url.d2clarity.com/combatant-scaling&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1792870195618515&amp;usg=AOvVaw2beGxKjnJ-k3WSht68nKJU">Combatant Rank Modifiers</a></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;"> and counts as Weapon Damage.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 2.5 second cooldown between activations.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R98" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">99</div></th><td class="s14">Focused Fury</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWiE7KazpkqpXIglNmDwpzJmWXuKiHFFhqPAbtc2ZJXn0RSg0y-1XsHUKtFgTyJXKZ9823PP12GfUN9E1HFK5JPapuv5a3XUKSabL3gy1zqq1nMxmnC3LvvbFuff6vlJn-tYpb838xSLL1LvNsxEJw4MqSi1Xios-eswms=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;">35% of Magazine rounded up,</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> as </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>25% increased damage for 11 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑12</span> seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision counter</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">reset </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">on stow or reload.<br>Buff can be refreshed while active, and persists through stow. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not increase the damage of Explosive Damage Perks.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R99" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">100</div></th><td class="s17">Fourth Time&#39;s The Charm</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaMatxsv3_Q1JRvuwmU24Q7BSqLBFKCrtDV-55gUW9n-YyvM1q3QR54mtiwzMj6vARDGZmo5HicOs5cWzAwvsjBw5WcMAiyMCHtNFJyaM-icoP9dWLYxRPXsHnC4Bo-eVDEfjcOnGn9Q7VCEBRuY7QF4krFfC32sp0d=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Scoring <span style="color:#f1c232;">4 Precision Hits</span> within 2 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑3</span> seconds of each generates 2 Ammo to Magazine.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Ammo Generation cannot generate ammo past Base Magazine Size.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Timer between hits persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R100" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">101</div></th><td class="s14">Fragile Focus</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZGRtJzLYU6_-QSQK_7FFWvXI367pTAlUplXFPzall_B0xRWPDRNryi4O66_Stp5h4ZUWgTEYClUMA5Khwcd0yuQeEAa3KjtXHln-chVexSBxFGHVI2NHle8hBqPpC_DwpaG8omboMKR2GmZSEPDX13Wj0lod65xi6W=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Grants +20 Range while <span style="color:#7cadff;">Shields </span>are active.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Deactivates </span>upon reaching <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Critical Health</span>.<br><br> Reactivates after 1<span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.5 </span>seconds of <span style="color:#7cadff;">Shield HP</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> </span>being <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restored to full</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R101" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">102</div></th><td class="s17">Frenzy</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa7tktejGfIZ4tMeyGibZHeefCXZtG8g8tVJ3677wev8xu6nyxej2mJgg1WtkP3H9F6xpC8mkzXqxPuiL2PjfqQWj4NAM7mqZ4xDYVP-CUoVFF2BWtK81OLotEuwtU_BDscAbUAeiHcfPyGy2k0nl-yWHc6zKmHcNOH=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After having maintained a state of dealing or receiving damage every 5 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑5.5</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> seconds for at least 12 seconds:<br></span>15% Increased damage, +100 Handling, and +100 Reload Speed for 7 seconds. <br>Dealing or receiving damage refreshes the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R102" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">103</div></th><td class="s14">Full Auto Trigger System</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa8jivdVLWeKdIUA6ESRHZq2q4BWZ8Tyts3T4XuMl6si_mXhm5X3qnM-U7awhzpgwUq7teEYrgBWCqV-i9nqeVEdzoYc0F6-b3RN61aNCcLB35jSNz-ONw_D8qRgpvHxbhMy8tbY3lryKaZEmQC2xYG6_5R74mjCG8i=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants 0.9x Fire Recovery Delay on Shotguns.<br>The perk version of the &quot;Full Auto Firing&quot; setting in Gameplay on every other Weapon Type.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">+And I guess it grants +5 Stability on </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">The Last Dance</span><span style="color:#ffd966;">, </span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">The Last Perdition</span><span style="color:#ffd966;">, and </span><span style="color:#999999;">Lonesome</span><span style="color:#ffd966;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R103" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">104</div></th><td class="s17">Full Choke</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWBI18NSsjbKSEncOM20iDRNls2pr-WdD5K8eUDCwBzfr4DllzYn7CmvlahSkWkv_5NfK05UINP5iPVnPJH-q1e5sLw8CaJVFyF3Uvy_-UTP-9jrBn_DTUQ8ESMTnHozv8ZLJtUJsO5DQNgVTA4btMFTRMvvmvi20hsGws=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While ADS:<br></span>-3.25% Pellet Spread.<br>Reduces <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage Multiplier</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span>from <span style="color:#f1c232;">1.1078x</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span>to <span style="color:#f1c232;">1.0294x, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;color:#f1c232;">or a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">7.6% Precision Damage Penalty.<br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +2 Handling.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R104" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">105</div></th><td class="s14">Full Court</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ_Q5_ke3MaqOkrWchgJVUN0w2Qbi2Llu6ybFbjuJEgN1SKeCgcZq4cm3bNvafnY8QDci2YJJB45mnoBuBj6L_akyc5nakA42cC75LowdlHfONaqd7k699Y6yksOEWEfBWIPObWFkS8PteZocYVc2iLhpkWoR_hUQ=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">0.2 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of the projectile being fired:<br></span>Up to 35% Increased Explosive and Burn <span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(DoT)</span> Damage based on the projectile lifetime.<br>Linearly scales from 0% increased damage at 0.2 seconds, up to 35% increased damage at 1.1 seconds of projectile lifetime<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Blast Radius.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R105" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">106</div></th><td class="s49">Gear Shift</td><td class="s50"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXSDJzG-VshCJPQZG-34g7GRTPmM4LO5eldb6rDYosyjy5LlKRHgSyfbwQGaT4t_PA0wqU68R1a9Rm6RfGGiXVaQQG89bKbWEQsqHxYKIZZkUIhsDwi6MJ25A1PWYKQT3UsN6A4uc1JUukFRAMpwgLjkU1zZI--SHdqDyY=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">reload </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">? seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or becoming </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Amplified</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Gear Shift</span> for <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑15</span> seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#89cdd1;">5 stacks</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br>Buff can be triggered and persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#d0e0e3;">Gear Shift x1</span> | 15% Increased Weapon Damage.<br><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Gear Shift x2</span> | 20% Increased Weapon Damage<br><span style="color:#76a5af;">Gear Shift x3</span> | 25% Increased Weapon Damage<br><span style="color:#45818e;">Gear Shift x4 </span>| 30%<span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span>Increased Weapon Damage<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Gear Shift x5 </span>| 35% Increased Weapon Damage</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R106" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">107</div></th><td class="s54">Genesis</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYWIxOUyraYT8ZH4fRoSS_IIDbc0OmyIe4E55oCFfrwS87yXIK1ZnwQ-s2Ob-q2CP-sMq5JSTqamYQW-Cb7eZc49_g4K9HVwBu4uWj4xEtO5L8aeGHOz515ijyr2eWBLTHRRzDhLih9HpzJ_tnFh-0yuZFNNAki_Q=w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Energy Weapons</span> generate 1 Ammo against <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Matching Combatant Elemental Shields</span> per hit.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon breaking a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">Barrier</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">Guardian </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Shield:<br></span> Refills magazine.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Handling.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R107" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">108</div></th><td class="s55"><span style="color:#f6b26b;">Golden </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Tricorn</span></td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbCl41ceNtPRfg9kZ7sNHOfEl3a0MaNjpy3mJTDqCwQ8rljiFyx5tBU6R82DMXX68YV_x8MlkhMKHFedaOtwX8dl11SmKq0K6JIBJ8XSFYXA7nxoszo178HEA5eg1rTRlItvh4eOp_HbUF7pazQkyVQUd2MRxSNHg=w70-h149" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Golden </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Tricorn </span>x1 | 15% Increased damage for 7 seconds. <br>Additional Weapon Kills refresh the buff duration to 7<span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑8</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.<br><br>On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f6b26b;">Grenade </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Powered Melee </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Kill, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while the</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> buff is active, if the </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon&#39;s Element</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> matches the </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span><span style="font-style:italic;">or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Element, </span><span style="font-style:italic;">respectively:<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Golden </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Tricorn </span>x2 | 50% increased damage for 10 seconds.<br> Additional <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>or <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee </span>Kills refresh the buff duration to 10 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R108" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">109</div></th><td class="s56">Grave Robber</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYIB1eaQnvHHrCtyFJaLeMcD81KcmJZq0nhk5vnILe08tXNl2W60OdQ6EPqOwdwq_3J0whjSR6vxAPQ8NM-AaaoWsmc-wgrhbT6ZTFiGYGEFgONY7-6X5ULOMB9ubAHNY8AfwSTMfJ796g2HML-Jjn-VK6yWCwPbwB4=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon dealing </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Powered Melee Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#79bec3;">Melee Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills Magazine.<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 3 second cooldown between Magazine Refills.</span><span style="color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Handling.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R109" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">110</div></th><td class="s27">Gutshot Straight</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbPdAC7Ld5tcr6YFewrglCQCer5p6Q0WZkDkZqBVpjulzMz_UTpywEYItMell6f4Zegwz8fq20Ggzenq84nUhqc_dfv2wK_aTQAu5CYPsuU9b8ghawF0bN6YeVRMgLZsdIwN5X_yWFfKX1QzcttpY1x_UJ-7m-5d4Gq=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">ADS</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span> -15% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-10%?</span> Auto Aim Cone Size and increased <span style="color:#999999;">Non-Precision </span><span style="color:#e69138;">Non-Weakspot</span><span style="color:#999999;"> Damage</span>,<br><br>20% Increased <span style="color:#999999;">Non-Precision Damage</span>: Auto Rifles, Bows, Hand Cannons, Scout Rifles, and <span style="color:#a481e1;">Sniper Rifles</span>.<br>10% Increased <span style="color:#999999;">Non-Precision Damage</span>: <span style="color:#a481e1;">Machine Guns</span>, Pulse Rifles, Sidearm, Submachine Guns, and <span style="color:#63d275;">Trace Rifles</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R110" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">111</div></th><td class="s14">Harmony</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYHscMrrzc94uZ2JnCir8UxRWosQPIwhDhNJ_f1OEa8gMW869A87_uG_rfdTPcntjdHTorJUi5UOK-OoxXYYuVG7BD1TF9dEjo0A46F5MSbciZQiQk-wAZ9T6ywhdo00K1085jehGJVefvS6fzMQGNs4owN5mdn_09l=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">readying </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a weapon within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of getting a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">kill </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">with a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">different weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>20% Increased damage and +15 Handling for 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑8</span> seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R111" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">112</div></th><td class="s57">Hatchling</td><td class="s58"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVXgorKRMhyJnvnxfkwOVsh5kwayre86XtK3eJZM6oicYpBfeEYA9n1jHyfz_LeDisLQaEnETiooG4rTUnX9BBho76BQioH-wwxoJRi4I1Ug97CrjpXvj7NvApQsJvUA6MA3DHooogIrWNb9Xjs9TyjcT6Rc0hgTOgaIkY=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s59" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;">OR</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> 3 kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> 3 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of each:<br></span>Spawns 1 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;"> (at a 10?% chance) </span><span style="color:#b6d7a8;">Threadling </span>on Enemy Death Location. </td></tr><tr style="height: 254px"><th id="1662574278R112" style="height: 254px;"><div style="line-height: 254px">113</div></th><td class="s48">Headseeker</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:254px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaMYHDC27A_aLgLEwx-yS6igdYx4-tzUrW3Bf5KQYlCOC8JDm9dp2jnr9LytEnYFE4KPjONLVy3wiAwfE-Wn2YYYzg7TwmbA20fTyvYStGuw5usJdDSVZ3mxVDuRitZGesVgfLbf9QtCobkqXbCOE3Olqo3UFeHRYt4=w70-h254" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon dealing direct </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">non-Precision Weapon Damage</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#f1c232;">increased Precision Damage </span>and 3?% Increased Auto Aim Cone Size for 0.55 seconds. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Dealing additional </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Non-Precision Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> refreshes the buff duration.<br></span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">The perk actually multiplies the </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Bonus</span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> by 1.2x, but the actual </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage Increase </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">results are easier to explain.<br></span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage Increase</span> per Intrinsic Frame:<br>Adaptive Pulse = <span style="color:#f1c232;">7.1%</span> | Aggressive Pulse = <span style="color:#f1c232;">10% </span>| Heavy Burst Pulse = <span style="color:#f1c232;">9.5%</span><br>High-Impact Pulse = <span style="color:#f1c232;">8.74%</span> | Lightweight Pulse = <span style="color:#f1c232;">6.3% </span>| Rapid-Fire Pulse = <span style="color:#f1c232;">10.3%</span><br>Adaptive Burst Sidearm = <span style="color:#f1c232;">8.46% </span>| Heavy Burst Sidearm = <span style="color:#ffd966;">7.36%</span><br>Precision Scout Rifle = <span style="color:#ffd966;">8.66%<br></span>Heavy Burst Hand Cannon =<span style="color:#e69138;"> 7% increased Weakspot Damage.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Stability.<br><br></span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;">What even is a </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspot</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;">? How is it different from a </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Precision Hit</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;">?<br></span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspot Hits</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> that do not register as a </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hit</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> can still benefit or trigger </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspot</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> effects, such as Headseeker, or Heavy Burst Hand Cannon&#39;s intrinsic 9.5% Weakspot Damage Buff.<br>Similarly, </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> are not always scored on </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspots</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and may not trigger </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspot effects</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.<br>One such example are </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Shielded Combatants</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">. </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">Weakspot Damage Increases</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> will work when other </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hit Increases</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">wouldn&#39;t</span><span style="font-size:8pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R113" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">114</div></th><td class="s39">Headstone</td><td class="s40"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLboy8ILEpV7tYFoB62zWaoBH1F5bQVURLUUdFwwNP86P-IgCBvbtOHdi2C9ir00bKBk72jLuYh2DEDgsmur0obQUA35jfPLtif3fqjA7w3xcEC38RdPI61CRkw8B--Xh87O38XWRyAj-UaE8ESoxw1IiM7xejN2Pg=w70-h134" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s41" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">:<br></span>Creates a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystal</span> on Enemy Death Location. <br><br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tier 1 and Tier 2 Combatants </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Medium </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Large</span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"> Crystal</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br> Tier 3 and Tier 4 Combatants </span><span style="color:#d9d9d9;">=</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Large Crystal</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> <br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>=<span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Large Crystal</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"><br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 5 second cooldown if</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6fa8dc;">5 Stasis Crystals</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">are created within ? seconds of the first.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R114" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">115</div></th><td class="s60">Heal Clip</td><td class="s61"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVAQSu98g_NNUbtpPfst0Yc12SK_xLnBAWkBhEoO3VfdqxjQyLF5wkWZe4fsZmeCEB-TWZWTlN8UPGTSAigXyuHUzm8XiPjx4oYLKaM2FATnlc591oT4NPEI4rYVxX2jDfIv6QfhqG68IwEQd2GdFep51CmDhlW1QE7ym4=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s62" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing a reload within 5.3? </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑?</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of a Kill:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x2 Cure</span>.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Allies </span>within 15 metres receive <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x1 Cure</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R115" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">116</div></th><td class="s17">Heating Up</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaHUiAf_efMJF0FKFkFCZ9DRkBNz7xjDYMV9IYeS6CDpQDen_cIwXcC1eatbhqmsgeZw57_CFehCCKE8uHh5-JaEsTj1uyI5TgeTEUliNqk5BcvidAqwxt-GJd8dTQx80Lwn5oLgcso4n_pKHuKgWK9M0742nxiNHJB=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill:<br></span>Grants a stack of Heating Up for 5.5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑6.5</span> seconds, up to a maximum of 2 stacks. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.<br></span><br>Heating Up x1 | +15 Stability, +20 Recoil Direction, -15% Accuracy Cone Size, and -15% Accuracy Cone Growth.<br>Heating Up x2 | +30 Stability, +40 Recoil Direction, -25% Accuracy Cone Size, and -25% Accuracy Cone Growth.</td></tr><tr style="height: 209px"><th id="1662574278R116" style="height: 209px;"><div style="line-height: 209px">117</div></th><td class="s14">High Ground</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXflNsSNc_40i5mDniS6cKHq5PZIlv3elSjgZKqmOMam-igXduwXsvq7tAuglayz8JYL28BxrZD11MAB27VpWZzQLcvJtyz7QQlAwdNNYfD-7xUNhufEw3icoCujIsX21vBTz09ymldCkHaxgmott2QlV9kadLXnWC8I2I=s209-w70-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[2]</span> stacks of High Ground.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">dealing damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">2?</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">[5 on </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Primaries </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">| 2 on </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Special </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Power </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">weapons]</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> meters</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">above </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">an </span><span style="font-style:italic;">enemy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">grounded</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[1 on </span><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> | 3 on others]</span> stacks of High Ground. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">The shot that triggers High Ground </span><span style="font-style:italic;">does </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">receive the damage increase.</span><br><br>High Ground:<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[5%]</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span>|<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> 17.5% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[10%]</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span>|<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> 25%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [15%]</span> Increased Damage for 7 seconds.<br>Dealing additional damage while above an enemy, or scoring a kill refreshes the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Reload Speed.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R117" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">118</div></th><td class="s17">High-Caliber Rounds</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbqomV4MvjdEo5o_YwSYpIdwTdloFdHQPQd7jxcPqL2OQByFODN71Zbg8tb8DB0XcpqxBF2Srt5RnrlmGujktUa199UF75Q7eiERhux10ZME1V5Zk2S06B0Y963Exsj2EIedGtfnl7mmMntUBrFM3Y8BlwOru5PCl65=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Passively grants +5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+7</span> Range.<br><br>Hits inflict increased Flinch on Enemies.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tier 1 and Tier 2 Rank-and-File can be repeatedly staggered. Higher Tier Combatants stagger quicker.<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> Flinch against Guardians varies based on Weapon Damage and Weapon Archetype. Flinch Increase ranges between 5% to 10%</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R118" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">119</div></th><td class="s14">High-Impact Reserves</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbonIIDd0N4VBJdab6B2CF5t6C2IgZhM9PvFUsh1qeD0SCc18EjZo9AuZX5qcjaNsDhWPc2uTF8lk8nlx1yTmuMyOrttY8kyDe2iCeyZtpf3oKAsQlYFPrcB59Jh80cDcDNhnWDhaJvrMqHF4JlFWDG2M8bJNszDQ=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">As </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">decreases </span><span style="font-style:italic;">below 50% </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑55%</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, down to maximum effect at </span><span style="font-style:italic;">7.5% Magazine</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">12.1% </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[3%]</span> to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">25.6%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[6%]</span> Increased direct damage. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not increase the damage of Explosive Damage Perks.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R119" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">120</div></th><td class="s17">Hip-Fire Grip</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbagW_1w6pXbfnmQG7ub6edSwaf9vLzlrluxhqvcsOtkQuivEvoQcdOKtQ0VUZ-lTUN2NBQ_iYQmoupzD6Pj0nNIUzXjmZEeTR3WSPHYLI5WkWcCsmZoEhKqDRT2KVHlY7FXXSrX1zfeXsMeibtmqYZknrzIJD1DfK7=w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While hipfiring:<br></span>20% Increased Aim Assist Falloff Distance, Reticle Stickiness Falloff Distance, and Damage Falloff Distance.<br>+15 Aim Assist,<span style="color:#f1c232;"> +2.7° Precision Angle Threshold</span>, -30% Accuracy Cone Size and +25 Stability.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Angle Threshold</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">does not</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> prefer </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> over </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Body Hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> if both cones overlap.<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">Shotguns</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">Sniper Rifles</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, Fusion Rifles, and The Last Word </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">do not</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> benefit from Damage Falloff Increases.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Angle Threshold</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> cannot exceed regular Aim Assist Cone Size.</span><br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Stronger effect. Accuracy Cone Size remains unchanged.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R120" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">121</div></th><td class="s14">Immovable Object</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVm5HrzTYYb0NEtaJbzs_mhmRh_E7UTGzWCox0gj9I6KpVI0i5R6XjKliAtweiWGXvkvsp0if_qdJkcWVGeg9B8Tuss3G2kz57Cfr9lSBBsG4bjhZheazdIklCSBSuPzzBgVy_cBBhT8IdF4ch5JuBJBTcx65V6HkUZBw=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">blocking </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-style:italic;">stationary</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Glaive Projectile Hits</span> <span style="font-weight:normal;">grant </span>+90% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+100%</span> increased <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">Glaive Projectiles hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> grant </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">25% Weapon Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> by default.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R121" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">122</div></th><td class="s63">Impact Casing</td><td class="s64"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZPgoye4Bxpi5mz4cL71P87QRbvYSRFJMcgpbQjnvzo4dqhyYopgLcQQtWP_dLgCN5e9C6cT0pAdr7umjbUUFfe-BOcssbjylfCA-rdI4N-pqGzlavXafqa22eDRG4oQ5niEzLGGqvlMrZY96kc6chbAI4GVDXiPKbc=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s65" colspan="4">Passively grants <span style="color:#a481e1;">10% Increased Rocket Impact Damage</span> and +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+12</span> Stability.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R122" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">123</div></th><td class="s14">Impromptu Ammunition</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV2mkRpe1nABy75EweISRGq-wRbTBIBx-WPSfaWBVn6NwyaW4NyoIzAzt3PML-K7nxL1PpW3esHq5RgNhJKfa8rJhdFfRA2zX18OtpbnkbFOOKqLUy3X3Aiq35i0Rc8ET2MsQZjc93wG9qvkgdixbaeZ6Psh1zXeqg9lM8=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#63d275;">1.15x Special Ammo Progress </span>and <span style="color:#a481e1;">1.1x Heavy Ammo Progress</span> for 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5.5</span> seconds.<br>Ammo Generation Multiplier is additive to Ammo Finder <span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Armor Mods)</span> Multipliers.<br><br>Scoring additional Weapon Kills extends the buff duration to 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7.5</span> seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R123" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">124</div></th><td class="s17">Impulse Amplifier</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa5A-KHG2gVOR3c-vsgiAD0Dt5zPxEVeYEFKPxJDboDiPbAc5jBmHrn2TSCJoV0yZeQLz3yjM6dNJDKcuQ0h8LYHtSp1OufHrJzW531aotktiBWkL-SChogWJCXGgvMGUjsWc_kRPrAhCRKMZcFKW7MXvBbejuLcCBp=w70-h119" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+25</span> Reload Speed, 0.85x Reload Duration Multiplier, and Increased Projectile Velocity,<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Rocket Launchers</span> are instead granted 0.8x Reload Duration Multiplier, alongside the usual bonuses.<br><br>Projectile Velocity Increase:<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Rocket Launchers: 10% Increased Projectile Velocity Speed.<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Support Auto Rifles: 15% Increased Projectile Velocity Speed.<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Rocket Sidearm: 25% Increased Projectile Velocity Speed.</span></td></tr><tr style="heigh