pon Damage Buffs</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">Debuffs</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> and are </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">unaffected</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">by </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant Rank Multipliers</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Increases the number of Scorch Stacks applied.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R125" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">126</div></th><td class="s17">Invisible Hand</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXo6YYu1TszSW8XGG4XD0WzFdoKr_Wb-fCiF0rofMHt-AtEhDuG4GDUG__iUoiDvKtYIlNWDrVgZSQfDcI5oq3CfuV_UCXPIVH8mmNHl5OZ3bm6ifmWmCbqGrKcjSDwPalxxKyVJ9PDndDct7keWu-PofQb7mwdNU60MNE=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">consecutively missing multiple shots </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">2.5 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each:<br></span>Grants +25? Stability for 2.5 seconds. Additional misses refresh the buff duration.<br>Buff is removed after 1? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?</span> seconds of failing to miss.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">Misses in a row required:<br></span>Auto Rifles and Submachine Guns: 10 misses.<br>Pulse Rifle: 9 misses.<br>Hand Cannons: 4 misses.<br>Linear Fusion Rifle: 2 misses.<br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Buff is removed within ? seconds of scoring a hit.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R126" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">127</div></th><td class="s66">Iron Gaze</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbLxLloMy9BidGBrhQTKj6ZiEzkA9WD_XF27z3OlVOnSwOVoo_-JbowPkPHV1q43tNF7NgewdVFz-a32nWrABBDX0iMqMazHq03XUpcb_CGDUo1swdJ5vBkg_Zf_flCswLZ2BLIkXjkoVWpK9nYTkUQFlfUSWXYqWcw=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 Aim Assist and -20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-15</span> Range.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R127" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">128</div></th><td class="s67">Iron Grip</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaxBtmwHdUy-HI4R1FjLsBzgJM4EjoHI3F37z6kITNbC34J46a2UQLVwnZrIVfTweXdUfI6Hd1J9h1v6oMnirVnfWi3hu-mmKmTfZk48LUvGgwQ3XxBTuZR4SsbGsSbehkthoo966ksnC5NqnriZKhY2Q6Wo7l2ioBX=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 Stability and -20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-15 </span>Reload Speed.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R128" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">129</div></th><td class="s66">Iron Reach</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZzlzOMlD0USwepkJqa3776cyq3TSryiVXzOObnRVWtolKffK6dtlgRE3fDgRzn0Xmy4Qv_lF6PHm3VD_tbhZXP7vIuA5FG28aD8bAq30b2HJ7XUPQNaWK_MyBWu_dWUYybmJR_xO-cLUgnN866PcIdrsyhiZwWTCnG=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 Range and -20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-15</span> Stability</td></tr><tr style="height: 329px"><th id="1662574278R129" style="height: 329px;"><div style="line-height: 329px">130</div></th><td class="s68">Jolting Feedback</td><td class="s50"><div style="width:70px;height:329px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUU632xVRiI8j-9x_dhNu3bwu3y0jZIF4mLhTAtc-ZuMCwDAQGmhGV5ZMbsfNyGw-54xZlVchhQEeBf2eQmlpULdhabBS6u1R0SZQB5lFNeqIPCO30mrLQ-Aij24Nl_kwY5037fSI6OpPoqjNPq3EEwlcGmweRcKQ0xvb0=s329-w70-h329" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;">multiple direct hits </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of each:<br></span>The next direct hit inflicts <span style="color:#76a5af;">Jolt</span>. <br>Being <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Amplified </span>reduces the amount of hits needed to trigger <span style="color:#76a5af;">Jolting Feedback</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Hit counter persists through stow. Hits do not have to be on the same target.</span><br><br>Direct Hits needed to grant <span style="color:#76a5af;">Jolting Shot</span> |<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Amplified</span>:<br>SMGs, <span style="color:#63d275;">Traces</span>: 18 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑17 </span>|<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> 13</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Machine Gun</span>: 16 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑14</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">11<br></span>Auto Rifle: 15 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑14</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">11<br></span>Pulse Rifles: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">9<br></span>Sidearm: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑9</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">7<br></span>HCs (+Uncivil): 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑4</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">2<br></span>Scout Rifles: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑4</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">| 2<br></span>Bow: ? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">| 1</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Rocket Pulse</span>:<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> | 5<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword:</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span>7<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑4</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> | 3<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Rocket Sidearm</span>: ? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑3</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">2<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Glaive</span>: 4 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑3</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">3<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Linear Fusion Rifle</span>: 4? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑3</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">2</span><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Heavy Grenade Launcher</span>: 3 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2</span> |<span style="color:#89cdd1;"> 2<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Shotguns, Snipers</span>: <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2</span> | <span style="color:#89cdd1;">1</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R130" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">131</div></th><td class="s14">Keep Away</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWXif45_9aLTgXia823Pg5pfAK2eBZ3zxdOauejVdIi7F_7vmS5cUAWkXs7K5RmV5wq5VgQ4ymgCL4TGoBtDgCNJBjrEbbYE3XCThfkFCDzApUjRVKNjzFwqSDz63fPzOoc3NgK-G-RQLFr7FAxdeVkNN13Dhrp_dlDDeU=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">While no enemies are within 15 metres:<br> +10 Range, +30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+35</span> Reload Speed, and -5?% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-?% Accuracy Cone Growth</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R131" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">132</div></th><td class="s17">Kickstart</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbyxoX3Cmt-0BODIZZOm1MmAyksVHHUI5g-iffmICDZbcaFJJ80DtBJJFvCn7-07KYHunrWg8nqJ9wXuoNw4IRZmGcbo78sTK83rwMNqYguVa1Pp5pNGZLrjLjBM1gIGcNUe8B4mNV3Q4tnxaiBHGq_1h6rCtcvnYLn=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;">Upon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">sliding</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, after sprinting for </span><span style="font-style:italic;">1.5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>15% Increased damage and 0.8x Charge Time for ? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?</span> seconds.<span style="font-style:italic;"> <br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Buff duration is increased to ? seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R132" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">133</div></th><td class="s14">Kill Clip</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYejKLueF9bjnOmKkyTAGXGt1kWHfmTalD6Q3Hi0_EVLakabP_RmBUrbn_gstjitDuYs7TE4yDJ5kACbpD7kngXnznW30DwXCexJS-r57VIsvGZG-VaEroZ_5qw2326Ef_L00UhTS8cAJJm52JaA8bPcnBg_2nKIBDc=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing a reload </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3.6</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>25% Increased damage for 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5.5</span> seconds. <br>Buff can be refreshed through additional activations.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not increase the damage of Explosive Damage Perks.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Buff duration is increased to 5.5 seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R133" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">134</div></th><td class="s17">Killing Tally</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWWyRUHy_-O1OCBYZjwji-45I19cM9KPEy_NcI-vm4gfy91f8PMHZ-4UXzqSoa6wbgDWgPe8R5AltKsGRF4_ROCaSNEAzEkg0sEfdU2HQtqpnv4xnTDBenJjaXCjReduSyAU_WJAfkrPPLaba0DLhy7Ic2djDUhjR4YMw=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On Weapon Kill:<br></span>Grants a stack of Killing Tally, up to 3 stacks. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Stacks are removed on stow or reload.<br><br></span>Killing Tally:<span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10% | 20% | 30% increased damage<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">5% | 10% | 15% increased damage<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +10 Magazine Stat </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">(Identical to Tactical Mag)</span><span style="color:#ffd966;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R134" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">135</div></th><td class="s14">Killing Wind</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbzx_Yl1KhqcDTYxt9iNUg7WIFrg2iRqzIQUP9xO1gVnkWXfVacM5_k5PJy8emoUCRMTAROZ_OFoIcnQzkeu1dc3X3DWTQ_-OFU5E1rUvKdixXFLSrUCf6Lk28qdkiCadnoy3ily5ftafo8DmzKdgiFjeEDp18BpQyy=w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On Weapon Kill:<br></span>+20 Range, +50 Mobility, +40 Handling, and 5% Increased Damage Falloff Distance for 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5.5</span> seconds.<br>Scoring additional Weapon Kills extends the buff duration by +5 seconds, up to 8 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Initial buff duration is increased to 5.5 seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 299px"><th id="1662574278R135" style="height: 299px;"><div style="line-height: 299px">136</div></th><td class="s27">Kinetic Tremors</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:299px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX_ZIDlKdGRSwlEjJ0k74HUWmcU9ydzIkrxaWIaKi0EFjJw6K5sjHRrjgIaQz1lO4uGgN1endVPWTjFnLwkDfeq9S_OckHkOIZcvr4NII16bqTVtpDG5hK_iwgsLNZLyT5WDwOmLjLPad5FU91wXhuNv8zW9mFJMvPjp90=s299-w70-h299" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">0.25 seconds </span><span style="font-style:italic;">of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring multiple direct hits</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> within</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> 3 seconds</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> of each against a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">single enemy</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Emits 3 <span style="color:#999999;">shockwaves </span>underneath the enemy at the place of activation, at a rate of one per second.<br>Each <span style="color:#999999;">Shockwave </span>deals up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">90 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[20]</span><span style="color:#999999;"> Kinetic Damage </span>over a 6 metre radius. <span style="font-style:italic;">Shockwave hits count as weapon damage.</span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Kinetic Tremors cannot be re-triggered on the same enemy within 2 seconds of the last shockwave.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">Hit counter persists through stow.</span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span><br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tremor Damage against Combatants:<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Shockwave</span> damage is based off of the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant Rank</span> it is initially triggered on. <br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Deals 33.3% increased damage if triggered on an Miniboss or Boss</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">.<br></span>Damage is affected by <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Bonus Damage</span> and scales with <span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://url.d2clarity.com/combatant-scaling&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1792870195627656&amp;usg=AOvVaw2y7Mylan5qGUrxa3H_ZKqB">Combatant Rank Modifiers</a></span>. <br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span>Hits needed to activate:<br>Submachine Guns: 14 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑13</span><br>Auto Rifles: 12 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11<br> </span>Pulse Rifles: 11 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑10<br></span>Non-Burst Sidearms: 8 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7</span><br>180RPM Hand Cannons and Scout Rifles: 6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5<br></span>120RPM and 150RPM Scout Rifles | 140RPM Hand Cannons : 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑4<br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Micro-Missile Sidearm</span>: 4 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑3</span><br>Bows and Sniper Rifles: 3 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R136" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">137</div></th><td class="s14">Lasting Impression</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLawDRih0UCLkx9PxvNETyYEIhJkAPyTjGlXa4WP_eyUqTTN7_sSBUQYklRSh_A4RTRzm0JU5p1QRnot1agrHmK-dUQyUu2NgZElcffOpQdJn0Ra1GwA8H54FgvyF1UECLRIJeslKEzklxt2XORitTmbD4hG9oQCvWqH=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants +50 Blast Radius.<br><br>Rockets attach on impact, detonating after 3 seconds, dealing an additional 35% Explosive Damage.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants an additional +5 Blast Radius.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R137" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">138</div></th><td class="s69">Lead from Gold</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbkRo6ZAwe6oN635tHSpSS9sJWC6k1kI9V5ykl5bBIOrrM9KamIuh7xttmOTXFznhKIpauVOGVpDPYLcsuHZ4tZFF3X25xc5jv6W0XVrNj4fOL337uA-GWcm09S0aou98NjCwjUgpwR0XtmPYBuX7tBlTuFdSB18TvL=w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Heavy Ammo Brick Pickup</span><span style="font-weight:normal;">:<br></span>Grants 25% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑35%</span> of <span style="color:#63d275;">Special Ammo Reserves</span>.<span style="color:#63d275;"><br></span>Equipping two <span style="color:#63d275;">Special Weapons</span> halves the amount of ammo granted to each to 12.5% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑17.5%</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed</span><br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Increases the amount of Special Ammo received to 35%.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R138" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">139</div></th><td class="s70">Lead from Light</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXIH0lacmI_wn8C3f2JKD8fF4tnzDErrWHcQCBAgD91s-5rYmAFIw4xlvDZDsynLQUGwqtF0scbctQOwqlPUUV0xMq3Lh0Of7oH2GiM_xP5QZTQjTcW5fufLV-BMBqW5QQcPTQU2szu30FfLFmadGuQM8shypK8OEunb2g=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Orb of Power</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Pickup: <br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Lead from Light</span>, up to ? stacks.<br><br>Weapon Kills consume a stack of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Lead From Light</span> to grant <span style="color:#63d275;">1.25x Special Ammo Generation Multiplier</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Maximum Lead from Light stacks are increased to 6.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R139" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">140</div></th><td class="s43">Light Touch</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX3U010R4MbP2dGVpFJO0GrJKsKNyueUxI0c_rPHEcvjGk-4sl7V61I8VGVZd-4XQbYNqxEys0HwhzBwvt-CF_JhRzLx0q7VHJEEbbzmnnJorVlt-Mkc9QKt3xZqwIvuDcYL7Vw54VYdzOQ27iST0eSsaZ0dfzY3Kj_yA=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Amplified</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Radiant</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">Devour </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><br>+? Handling, +Reload Speed, 0.?x ADS Duration Multiplier.</td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R140" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">141</div></th><td class="s14">Lone Wolf</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW7M23kDnAXrZiQbAfG7tWVflg-PlT5Tfz0JBFrDDNwiOc_D_GChw4OuCbN_moi6-NbJjHvYQO7JZvCoKOz7GO3Z6_x75oM0THuHzozJuzgNoN9bPWfSX6NeDdv-FFh50xVRzkXhUat-u9RiPOVOhGSQ5UWsU-X0kIYyA=s134-w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants +5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+6</span> Aim Assist, 0.9x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.85x</span> ADS Duration Multiplier, and +15 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+16</span> Airborne Effectiveness.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">no </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">are within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">15 meters</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Bonuses are doubled to +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+11</span> Aim Assist, 0.8x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.75x</span> ADS Duration Multiplier, and +30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+32</span> Airborne Effectiveness.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff appears as active on the weapon buff display.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+6 Aim Assist, 0.85x ADS Duration Multiplier, and +16 Airborne Effectiveness.<br>+11 Aim Assist, 0.75x ADS Duration Multiplier, and +32 Airborne Effectiveness while no allies are within 15 meters.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R141" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">142</div></th><td class="s43">Loose Change</td><td class="s23"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUNaW9Sh29J5GMv6m09Xr3WzVjVKGR4xZYUgY09pKFnHl_JKCq7-ZkadmjS3e9TesEQn3p_mX_7Aga72L1wuxbHKPZTuW4dtfC_GLIdT9kEM80Ccx2aBui533JsQkjiITbZZW0uV9MtIZMqI_RTjcjp6SlZHM3X5x4lFc0=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s24" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">inflicting</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Debuff</span><spa