3" style="height: 164px;"><div style="line-height: 164px">144</div></th><td class="s71">Magnificent Howl</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:164px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWF9agK0SwQFf8MoYvRKz5znmDhaMuH4NMlXI9uWKVRSzsJFKwF7Yp2kqNAcf7GZ6mAUJHMNjvlS8qAh3P1dF25f4cK10P_vH8Ug-3g4NFmIpz53XwA-AA69MoLCxFkAxM_yqpd0-W6oTeD9IQuknjqL6Ko8IjvWfc2sw=s164-w70-h164" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Scoring a <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span> grants a <span style="color:#f1c232;">stack</span> of <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Final Blows</span>, up to<span style="color:#f1c232;"> 10 stacks</span>. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Stacks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">are consumed on reload, and persist through stow. Cannot gain </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">stacks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e37683;">Magnificent Howl</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is active.</span><br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing a reload</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while having </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Final Blows</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">stacks</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>Converts all <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Final Blow stacks</span> into <span style="color:#e37683;">Magnificent Howl stacks</span>.<br>Firing consumes a <span style="color:#e37683;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#e37683;">Magnificent Howl </span>per shot, granting 50% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑55% </span>increased damage and ?% Increased Damage Falloff Distance.  <br>Scoring a <span style="color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span> while <span style="color:#e37683;">Magnificent Howl</span> is active grants <span style="color:#e37683;">x1 Magnificent Howl stacks</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e37683;">Magnificent Howl stacks</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> persist through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Magnificent Howl Damage Buff is increased to 55%.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 164px"><th id="1662574278R144" style="height: 164px;"><div style="line-height: 164px">145</div></th><td class="s72">Master of Arms</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:164px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXFni2kLHBU3FaAAnC7JIK9a03WGrCmJ9xpGjkMdbQhVwKH-a2tK1ULhqz_mgxsxJkUdLSWvtirMbfx46oLnsqBSNNwQhmE8e2MeEPBvfMOKpaddVNpHvlWXQmQlUeINm2M3wCxwN3SaH_CViq7YerzhF8VJKbJtEVRaSc=s164-w70-h164" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> with </span><span style="font-style:italic;">any weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Master of Arms x1 </span>| 15% Increased Damage for 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑8?</span> seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Timer starts on Weapon Kill.<br>Buff persists through stow.<br><br>Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> with </span><span style="font-style:italic;">any weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">Master of Arms x1 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is </span><span style="font-style:italic;">active</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Master of Arms x2</span> | 25% Increased Damage for 4 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5?</span> seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Timer starts on Weapon Kill.</span><br>Additional Kills with any weapon refresh the <span style="color:#ea9999;">Master of Arms </span>duration. Buff drops down to<span style="color:#ea9999;"> x1 Master of Arms</span> upon expiring.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Buff duration is increased. x1 to 8 seconds, and x2 to 5? seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R145" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">146</div></th><td class="s73">Mega Kill Clip</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW_yGh-yaQp6Yijol-wFYGmgmp4mBTYO8vz635PIUQjNG4YEBIgBQJHQPdNaj4dLVhm1cvpQ0H_S4NWWeEqxfkDvSGCtBKSKl8btwFI_jicvssvMgq-IMxqzAZQZRXAQt6ylgWgbQIc7QBER6SbFo0Ts8fXESlnRcRLWDY=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing a reload </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">?</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><s