:italic;">Buff persists through stow.<br><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Target explodes, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">varies </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[95.3]</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon-Matching Damage </span>over a 7.5 meter radius, down to a minimum of 50% Damage at the farthest point.<br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Explosion Damage</span> is increased by the amount of <span style="color:#f1c232;">Meganeura stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#f1c232;">x1</span> = Dragonfly | <span style="color:#f1c232;">x2</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">40%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%]</span> | <span style="color:#f1c232;">x3</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">67.7%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%]</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Damage against Combatants scales differently by Weapon Type and Combatant Rank :)<br><br>Meganeura Damage:<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons =</span><span style="color:#b7b7b7;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">378 | 530 | 634<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat Primary Weapons</span><span style="color:#999999;"> =</span><span style="color:#b7b7b7;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">551 </span><span style="font-size:6pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">(634/1.15 lol)</span><span style="color:#b7b7b7;"><br></span><span style="color:#63d275;">Sniper Rifle = </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">493 | 691 | 827</span><span style="color:#63d275;"><br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Machine Gun = </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">452 | 541 | 758</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R147" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">148</div></th><td class="s42">Melee Momentum</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:10