e="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> against a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#8e7cc3;">Void-Debuffed Enemy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;"><br></span>Grants<span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> Void Overshield </span>for 8<span style="font-size:7pt;color:#bba5f3;">+4</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑9</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#bba5f3;">+4.5</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span>seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 209px"><th id="1662574278R184" style="height: 209px;"><div style="line-height: 209px">185</div></th><td class="s14">Reservoir Burst</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYOPB-A90YjbAqz21DmdbMfrK4uNMxa1EdVzNRWRFjikxkTqjM1ewQwxfBtHfBVFGtBNi0A_qdjkNlK9_VkIWL_UoXF1BX_k1QE9XWd0cubvlm60T1RQL92RuFKgYzAwEIiebvtpJMglnN7LvzEcg0GdsfyfYG8EktB=w70-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively grants +30 Magazine Size.<span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">at or above</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">100% Magazine Capacity</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants 30% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑33%</span> Increased damage.<br>Direct Damage Kills cause enemies to explode on death, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">varying</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[162] </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental Damage </span>in a ? metre radius.<br><span style="font-weight:norma