9px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">235</div></th><td class="s49">Trickle Charge</td><td class="s50"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWlDt7ImuqzwxsG8NcFeZH9-Ps7YJrPkhaLaxkUinjiJRQ0IwxAxp3yo5hP-Dx230qImxRiLVTKPw3r0YjgiE-oArubtQiW163rb7WLuI_yOnX4PZAz1e3sbwDYs6KXt0VW3_tmtROrr06DnOfhmUrPwvBzrMnCcDa0sVU=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon receiving a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Bolt Charge stack</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills ?% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑10%</span> of Magazine.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does NOT dissipate heat.</span><span style="color:#e06666;"><br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">discharging Bolt Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills ?% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑20%</span> of Magazine / <span style="color:#e0a261;">Dissipates </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑100%</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Trickle Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> will refill/</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">dissipate </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">stowed weapons.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R235" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">236</div></th><td class="s77">Triple Tap</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYrimnnALfANmh2hIU0AFUbQ-Bmj9LAIRN_Owg8UH1G6t8xHVHG3PpLi6ja7N