-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon breaking a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant&#39;s </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental Shield</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">Guardian&#39;s Shield while in </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">:<br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#7cadff;">50</span> <span style="color:#7cadff;">HP Overshield</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> </span>for 10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11.5</span> seconds.<br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Damage dealt to Overshields does not stop Health Regeneration.<br><br></span><span style="color:#7cadff;">Overshield can stack with other overshields, such as Void Overshield and Class Stat Overshield. Overshield layers are determined by &quot;First In, First Out&quot;.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R238" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">239</div></th><td class="s14">Under Pressure</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb8e_lroYFvg9mCdmtqgg9BNvaliCR3iF1J7gKHCGCD9YwdXmGAup8_1udkjQnT9DberzB00lCyvf4XZD8aCbp_siZd-yofOYknZ6f3Ar4DQ4H8T0jprG8YWZ0KzxZF0GWcwQVyM36h8oTB4ff3Za79LX_wOM-u5g=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">As </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">decreases </span><span style="font-style:italic;">below 50%,</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> down to </span><span style="font-style:italic;">0%</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span> Linearly grants -12.5% to -25% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑-30%?</span> Accuracy Cone Size, and up to +30? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Stability.</td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R239" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">240</div></th><td class="s17">Under-Over</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVQWZk7Xhk-zZHb9hd09pxyzGT0bsQObjobdmH6KM3kwyRPXzT7VLsUWbif3LlQ5TE8_B0cWf3tx4_HtdXVUDRBmW83U_CwKq-pT9Kkj2LDazdMOV6C50EbThyd1i1poMu_mOAzLYRVfyOyzKVUgV623SnPUaVPnWL6ft8=s134-w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Passively increases direct damage dealt against shielded enemies.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Does not increase the damage of Explosive Damage Perks.<br></span><br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">50% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑55%</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> Increased Damage </span>against <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental Shields</span> and<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Barrier Champion Shields</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">.<br>125% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑140%</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> Increased Damage against Combatant Overshields.<br><br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">20% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑22%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> Increased Damage against Guardian Overshields.<br>20% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑22%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> Increased Bodyshot Damage against Guardians with Woven Mail.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R240" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">241</div></th><td class="s78">Unrelenting</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaJliPC8Rcl1_d6VJPL2dKVseluREyAjO_FuX58P_0Ra7jcAjTJaRWzQeIHpM8smeKGiFj0MxZ11tv_O4fFaBFHd6877VjDNUK-XGnuES2urzXorMhKSqQ_Y9kKE8SLWQjdZasWOtKesD3x_N8obmJHV0c-gA0EEpC6=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;">100% Counter Progress</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> through </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-And-File = 34% | Elites/Minibosses/Bosses = 100% </span>|<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians = 67%</span>.<br><br>Begins <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Health Regeneration</span> and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 65 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑70</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> HP.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R241" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">242</div></th><td class="s17">Unstoppable Force</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWsDnX9cf_dKebG5JFXZdZB1YHftaSdxYkJf6sVEmCrMMwfamXJb-7lu0XH159LzBThBT6TERT1z9qzM2h82yt2_lg86oYCZze4KZ7wRNjLjrXtXhUNe974L0bAVCq9BLvsHXYZyHvIGo9GyvKu8KIwI_5QHRVzQq2LDdY=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon blocking damage with </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Glaive Shield</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>20% increased projectile damage for 4 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑5</span> seconds, or until no longer blocking.<br>Blocking additional damage refreshes the buff duration.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R242" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">243</div></th><td class="s14">Valiant Charge</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaIour3x6fAcSC23IMWv6eJKBkepp62APHBsIq26JR_4iJxvcLez9EobyYHQcU_CbIELoay6vh2hEUJ_QM3Bdmq2Rw54OtbYeWCBTKmnWg7vA3ZPkRDgwjoFKk_fbp6WjWhgcHEUovaUT4mjE8CtglZYsuduMxz7w=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">guarding</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> against a hit...or receiving </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">healing </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">from an </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">guarding?</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>80% Increased Lunge Distance for the next swing within 1 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑1.5</span> second.<br>Guarding against additional hits refreshes the buff duration.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R243" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">244</div></th><td class="s68">Voltshot</td><td class="s50"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY8UTSUes080_66H4MpHR27EjCLRdxWxNw9jgjWtGzZKpw1rND5uHzsBuRhpW7avalsS2oDmdwbbIaP4rFivBnNynX2d9a_tKa2ChiYq10jlAdkWaev80So0NlRWUlmrfOKKimeqR0cArnmle43-qcQhI2BUnc4udqI=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s51" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">finishing a reload </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">5.3 seconds </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">of a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>The next Weapon Hit within 7 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑8 </span>seconds inflicts <span style="color:#76a5af;">jolt. <br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Reload timer and buff both persist through stow. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Jolt is not counted as Weapon Damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R244" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">245</div></th><td class="s14">Vorpal Weapon</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWuTIFuER8dqi7QnujMBk1IzBmx0r4AmHdokeosiDJQXJ2_I9jhzfEyf1WD3_PJPR0o9v-x_pEvqIXFoJ7G0CttqGtvWY9A2AouiJIOyJG5VwgrmMMaiACgzBoae3CjBoxf8fuHeLeIEifviS7Pkee3rPcnaCX-NuHO4Ng=s134-w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Passively increases damage dealt towards <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss, Champion, Boss, and Vehicle Combatants</span>, <span style="color:#ea9999;">as well as Guardians in their </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">.<br></span><br>Damage Increases:<br><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">20%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">60%<br></span><span style="color:#93c47d;">Special Weapons:</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">15%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">20%<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Power Weapons: </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10%</span> |<span style="color:#ea9999;"> 20%<br></span><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Stability and +5 Guard Resistance </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">(Swords)</span><span style="color:#ffd966;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R245" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">246</div></th><td class="s17">Well-Rounded</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYp9z_OkHKdhRtJVTlqKks0JAFcMZEEgCENchxeGif7cnuDD9nsPdCjqUkhuKR2Rk_Nl4rYHj3dvuBRHH5fSqo2zXubTKNAW8RqnI0JoZ7t587HYyt4j_Rd8kMIDyNqCZ4HVClsW3Whr-XEa99_SFQaiC6k2mI8GXk4=w70-h119" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Usage</span> and <span style="color:#79bec3;">Powered Melee Hits </span>grants a stack of Well-Rounded for 15 seconds, up to a maximum of 2 stacks. <span style="color:#f1c232;">Super Ability Cast grants two stacks.<br></span>Additional <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Usage</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Powered Melee Hits</span>, or <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Casts</span> refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span><br><br>Well-Rounded:<br>x1 = +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+12?</span> Range, +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+12?</span> Stability, and +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+12?</span> Handling.<br>x2 =  +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+24?</span> Range, +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+24?</span> Stability, and +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+24?</span> Handling.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R246" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">247</div></th><td class="s14">Wellspring</td><td class="s26"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ2sxAcbaGQOov5AiEHLwp02vr1seZ3OIs1ms5ImlvbI-SVd00tX2Vs6tA40dzzn5UOJujvfK_Wm8oqEMug1WexUHlHGkfAv3SgRqU-lMSa_UbBrjJ3n1Yw-DfiuhBe-j3Y1iwpKHsxJqDuUNHWv0BH99F6CJPWPeyW=w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants 8% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑9%</span> Ability Energy split equally amongst all uncharged abilities.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On Abilities with multiple charges, once the ability has at least one full charge it will count as charged and will only receive a third of the regular Ability Energy per kill.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R247" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">248</div></th><td class="s17">Whirlwind Blade</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaIZkqQFq7FdB9ffa05ORy6jzi8ppqcJXb3skGsUzUCGcziU4HrZ1m4_xRsNTkAQy64iGXAwQIY1lOPCjDOOwbbZyrxCXIDaH_3MCqT5uyfmZnXK2ma-1JABY7uHpA30Hm7Ctx-NO4eEmw23bQT0m-A0Wnq1M8mLrDL=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Powered Sword Hit</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>3% | 6% | 9% | 12% | 15% | 18% | 21% | 24% | 27% | 30% Increased damage <span style="font-weight:normal;">for </span>3.5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑4</span> seconds.<br>Additional Powered Sword Hits refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Blocking or stowing removes all stacks.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R248" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">249</div></th><td class="s86">Withering Gaze</td><td class="s46"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWxmaGvEtJr6VqH7bynOPz028H-FN_Bm6P7bBAg9qsEqvTJL9J25_-3iHJQPtgBzpc38-vvq6QjG1_xVcdiBLmwwEw3RwCeZ1hB4O9CWuYii_gU0b6l9MDiJsSJf5YZUnqyee3m_xxcSUDw3C7olTarIvCIYrv1eZX2OLA=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s47" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After </span><span style="font-style:italic;">1.5 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑1.4 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">seconds of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">ADS</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> without firing while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine is &gt;0</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>The next direct damage shot fired while ADS inflicts <span style="color:#c27ba0;">weaken</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Timer starts as soon as the Aim Down Sights input is pressed, and is reset upon scoring a hit.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">The weakening shot benefits from the 7.5% damage increase against Guardians.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R249" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">250</div></th><td class="s17">Zen Moment</td><td class="s25"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaAFTmPromblLTbyGoKQ2ibGKDA3fOAB_NMVonvWc7dngdOURk1PQ8YTMtDVGEMk4sJpQiZ7cxr9uXSBgE4TxY_CYYLXnw8gjioPGl3NjvjUjYAUAvjro2FgnA5UN5DA_1nYAhZn2v48Gd-V4sUbZh3x8slq5owWWdI=w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On Hit:<br></span> Grants ?% Flinch Resist, -15?% Visual Weapon Shake and -15?% Reticle Bounce per stack for 1 second, up to 5? stacks. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Has no effect on </span><span style="font-style:italic;">actual recoil/camera movement</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, despite the in-game perk description.</span><span style="font-weight:normal;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>Pulse Rifles and Sidearms grant 1.5x as many stacks per hit, only needing ? hits to be at maximum effect.<br> Hand Cannons and Scout Rifles grant 2x as many stacks per hit, only needing ? hits to be at maximum effect.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +5 Stability.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R250" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">251</div></th><td class="s87" colspan="2"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1i1KUwgVkd8qhwYj481gkV9sZNJQCE-C3Q-dpQutPCi4/edit%23gid%3D242217075&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1792870195655861&amp;usg=AOvVaw3z_i7Ew7b8aena6gfktgVW">For in-depth Damage Stacking info, check out Court&#39;s Modifier Database </a></td><td class="s88" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:bold;">Reload Perk Notes:<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;">Generate = Grants Ammo to Magazine out of thin air, up to its Base Magazine Size. </span>Does not work with Overflown Magazines.<span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:bold;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;">Overflow = Increases Base Magazine Capacity by a certain amount, rounded up.<br><br>Refill = Reload, but does not have an animation and doesn&#39;t proc on-reload perks. Pulls from reserves on </span><span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;color:#93c47d;">Special </span><span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;">and </span><span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;color:#a481e1;">Power </span><span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;">Weapons.<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">For Heat Weapons, it will instead be &quot;Dissipates X Heat&quot; to discern it from manual venting<br></span><span style="font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"><br>Reload = Procs on-reload perks. </span>Manual Reload, Marksman&#39;s Dodge, and <span style="color:#ffd966;">Dragon&#39;s Shadow</span> all count as regular reloads.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">For Heat Weapons, finishing a manual vent will count as a regular reload.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 24px"><th id="1662574278R251" style="height: 24px;"><div style="line-height: 24px">252</div></th><td class="s89" colspan="6">Weapon Mods</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px"><th id="1662574278R272" style="height: 24px;"><div style="line-height: 24px">273</div></th><td class="s89" colspan="6"><span style="color:#ffd966;">Enhanced Weapon Mods</span> are equippable only on <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Tier 4</span> and <span style="color:#fbbdec;">Tier 5</span> Weapons.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R273" style=