ss="s90">Icarus Grip</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX5BiqeMyd8Jy-dkaFROJEdA69VHgfGlYYsfRjTqE6DuMJO4o95ACyKsT53bhxRtpIHNFqYve6SseRBJJoiCpQtFrNF5A_XX8YeyYQzaC0QilcgCymYDxrFi7tOVNo0vlnLkh4urXhZiL1gYWu9UqBho23qtyIeRyOJvg=s70-w70-h59" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">+15 Airborne Effectiveness <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑and +5 Handling</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R298" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">299</div></th><td class="s91">Marksman Optics: High</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZwumC6ApK5PWHXthmCLbbj8A3PWFCM5-YpO2kq1VVbYWqi8hzajXTqCOcw-CPf0SL3qRNLzz0qklPBDKCoWGOsaAQfHo_Pt__aoUekoMqfMmpmGC-oyzJdl5Vd7UUi5tUyxn8LxDSPhjNqew=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">+2 Zoom.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R299" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">300</div></th><td class="s90">Marksman Optics: Low</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLavzzny--AoDqHZMtykrLZKC40U_VuvtkqDxu3HjE1nm_KaFkXZD5YHD4B7SoopKVum_fYhplXonD9H57a1x5Jbs1Wkinp4U3bl5YJ99w4NXzRdB2e1VvFoXZzzJ-zKn3pLvuS7sey3MKoaNA=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">-2 Zoom.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R300" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">301</div></th><td class="s91">Quick Access Sling</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXwW_gvLccMXKR83Euw9JuvVMaC08S415nEiaN7THnt8qGrl9h8QGSx37YNoEFVYs_bRHH7XS2UEnP57akkqAhqsuDv7Ah-igAY7eP2fgzyEkbcw2KmXPx51bT04WhnI1gSTXvalJw1EADpE_9WvTDbq7STXKMUf3sMr2Q=s70-w70-h59" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">0.9x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.?x</span> Ready/Stow Animation Duration Multiplier.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R301" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">302</div></th><td class="s90">Radar Booster</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZdqlv_ZT4ybGyJb2gMyEFHo5P8qLkMFLDuyAfYYFP9spLAsevs8l_HksmpuCYlwtRiU4gqaNl46I9qf_xg6VIIyI8l8wbY_GEVxv08EgImUIYg9g48teRUNBOWSe9rJUz2DP36dMlO26_7YA=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">Maximum Radar Distance increased by 8 metres.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Increases the radar range from 48 meters to 56 meters.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R302" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">303</div></th><td class="s91">Radar Tuner</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZrPl7VAUPgDPF1h4EbtUgQRmz4D0N77IDYIWcDXfUhTJqmksBlS9uxbFNES6EPxKLkVxUFCp4dURd3-MQQODYPesccOjXQAxkSsaiJsiHPg_dE5ibcjqJZcEidXd1f3KJTfv8nqZFflpeACQ=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">Radar returns instantly after no longer ADS.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;">Radar normally returns after 1.5 seconds.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Adds the benefits of Radar Booster.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R303" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">304</div></th><td class="s90">Sprint Grip</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZzezNNd3hfjcNioGNKLgCEqs9agiHKU9kSYCQoM6QIS6xS9TwnUlNry3oAoegIES59nZ_zJ_2V53h13ugEe-M-I5G3eFtnx47wAKMqR4H6UNW0jwTkW0wNX9dEO7bgJ64JM9d6maqHVuXRaQ=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After sprinting for 1.5 seconds:<br></span>+35 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> ADS and Ready Speed Handling until no longer sprinting.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R304" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">305</div></th><td class="s91">Stunloader</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb9EbaNEmeBHAY7XjkzSUYXPwJCMKoSsuhmK0IpXGfWRn0lKbu20jORt9DlbqLqCr1zYVr_02VAW4WhHsWhR1ObvpIFijAd2iqDt6-2v-wIFGZlLE3QnoidcYbNNaJhyHtAj6OTPA9rcUG0FQ=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">stunning</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Champion</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills 50% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑60%</span> of Magazine.</td></tr><tr style="height: 164px"><th id="1662574278R305" style="height: 164px;"><div style="line-height: 164px">306</div></th><td class="s74">Synergy</td><td class="s75"><div style="width:70px;height:164px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaPtWIY9FmQMiuUIDndlKJvA7aFxOSJAjhgbfr0Cw-AWbo7TJVYsFqAJVDe3A3d32UXDTQLmsRdTV9x4NVCP0h7zndfEsloVq5zS2Py4vtn_x5LgFkhovmQvIiyXDDV6qEk3MiVSSN-IPiRcA=w70-h164" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s76" colspan="4">Upon reaching <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">100% Counter Progress</span> by scoring Weapon Kills:<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-And-File</span> =<span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> 8.34% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑12.5%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite</span> = <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">16.7%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑20%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Miniboss </span>= <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">34%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Boss </span>= <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">50%</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"> </span>| <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>= <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">16.7%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑25?%</span><br>Spawns a <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon-Matching Elemental Pickup</span>. <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Weapons</span> spawn an <span style="color:#ffd966;">Orb of Power</span> that grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">7.15% Super Energy</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Kill counter persists through stow. </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Simultaneous Kills that exceed the counter dont progress into the next counter</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Enhanced Synergy does not trigger nor is it affected by the global cooldown of pickups.</span><br><br><span style="color:#e06666;">All of the following </span>applies only to <span style="color:#999999;">BASE Synergy</span>.<br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Synergy </span>ignores the <span style="color:#e06666;">global cooldown</span> for <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Pickups</span>, but will trigger the <span style="color:#e06666;">global cooldown</span> upon spawning one. <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Synergy </span>has its own <span style="color:#e06666;">cooldown </span>depending on the <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">spawned Pickup</span>:<br><span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Ionic Traces</span> = 0 seconds | <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Firesprites</span>, <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Void Breaches</span>, and <span style="color:#9fc5e8;">Stasis Shards</span> = 5 seconds | <span style="color:#63d275;">Tangles </span>= 12 seconds<br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Kills during Synergy&#39;s cooldown do not contribute to the activation.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R306" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">307</div></th><td class="s91">Tactical</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbnTnemyXREymVx8TrMLzFqfDGX9VVSw8DtdmkSNbBwtpMmVskAQd46l3Si0SCgwyxIzoRA-bRpxeAdoxCnzBVsNZ18E3fJ6_aosvmBU-qgSYj_caIiYfWqkroJ5h9VCB7DsiAmW3MgmbRR_Q=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">+6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+7</span> Handling and +6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+7</span> Reload Speed.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R307" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">308</div></th><td class="s90">Targeting Adjuster</td><td class="s21"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbfUIEg4LOGpFNsEN8CIZlED80FVwI4dsjZCRc3a8HopE6fxkR9UbSZfEAt1frpULgmMPnLSNfcUkMN6rHmrznu6-iHfxzTUEzK1066PYrYgL8TlQuaHZGQpmDX0MBZobCDqWBIduUYpKI=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s19" colspan="4">+5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+7</span> Aim Assist.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R308" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">309</div></th><td class="s91">Tension</td><td class="s15"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb9lW9Y30NeM1CsqU1uJlgUcs9uEeajU0tIIQOUcLZuigD3PXrDnq3YJLLWtYbk7MjA7He9wQUXLLcHlEkPCKq0a4TIR6ucNQ_Gy3NI8wgDODJNhdPY5ID_c6oD0vobdC8u0LNQDPj6Oc8=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s16" colspan="4">+6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+7</span> Draw Time and +6 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+7</span> Accuracy.</td></tr><tr style="height: 24px"><th id="1662574278R309" style="height: 24px;"><div style="line-height: 24px">310</div></th><td class="s96" colspan="6">Intrinsic Traits</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R310" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">311</div></th><td class="s97">Adaptive Burst</td><td class="s98" rowspan="3"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbBrYCm7SXHa1pImPU2Q065_tSGQPrcJSr0GBXTUGhBc1aAmmG6DVz62-f0x7IJAFaNKHX8k8iYKJq5I3PyBVmM54ao9TxX5KUE1y9Sg5ljel8HQxsAkrT1btetITI8QUFvyRrMDvVx5dHyGLQ1vv-76_FrGge9W_pj=w70-h179" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">Fires 3-round bursts.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R311" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">312</div></th><td class="s100">Adaptive Frame</td><td class="s101" colspan="4">No intrinsic bonuses whatsoever.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R312" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">313</div></th><td class="s102">Adaptive Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">(Rocket Launchers)</span></td><td class="s103" colspan="4">Deals 10% increased damage over High-Impact Rocket Launchers.<br>1 Impact : 3.5 Explosive Damage Ratio. 50.5 RPM</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R313" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">314</div></th><td class="s100">Aggressive Burst</td><td class="s104" rowspan="6"><div style="width:70px;height:359px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa4-4gMG3AKwKhqnsngBTh5MDP6M546Y-SneF3Tbat46xBH_oELVWAdaUPSWN_sd3u-4-aEvxEudeYeViDlmbUkiksJ9qNDW420FE-5vwvBZ9zvnB9N0oea7sodRMvN1l92G0nBMl317mT6-GMxQZLMqz4mAzlZtrQv=w70-h359" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4">Fires 4-round bursts.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R314" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">315</div></th><td class="s97">Aggressive Frame</td><td class="s99" colspan="4">No intrinsic bonuses whatsoever.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R315" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">316</div></th><td class="s105">Aggressive Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">(Fusion Rifles)</span></td><td class="s106" colspan="4">Fires a 3-round burst of 4 pellets each in an increasingly wider spread.<br>Deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">113</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[28.8]</span> damage per pellet x 4 = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">452 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[115.2]</span> per burst x 3 = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1356 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[345.6]</span> damage per ammo spent.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R316" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">317</div></th><td class="s102">Aggressive Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">(Rocket Launchers)</span></td><td class="s103" colspan="4">Deals 10% increased damage over High-Impact Rocket Launchers.<br>1 Impact : 3.5 Explosive Damage Ratio. 54.5 RPM</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R317" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">318</div></th><td class="s100">Aggressive Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Scout Rifles)</span></td><td class="s101" colspan="4">Reloads two ammo at a time.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R318" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">319</div></th><td class="s105">Aggressive Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Shotguns)</span></td><td class="s106" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a Kill:<br></span>0.75x Fire Recovery Delay for 4 seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R319" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">320</div></th><td class="s100">Area Denial Frame</td><td class="s104"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXFFnbrUq4TlXjFx3HqnJcPl_SUmsb-U4jnwJs6xvDJhWGO98DNRJQyi2soxkaOLErIIXFFV5E0lVTkEeE456OZVfYV5gq8x2Ihuq498rM7KB-lcCzwU2-I8Jjz7sC_Q4CXYsLRyomQTsaoOCw3mRZsRJwigN2ZAf13Bq0=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4">Shoots a burst of 5 projectiles at the cost of 1 Ammo.<br><br>Projectiles create a lingering <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">damage field</span> after 0.5 seconds of impacting.<br><br><span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Damaging Field</span> deals damage every 0.25 seconds for 5.65 seconds, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">52.5</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage up to 22 times per field.<br>Enemies can only receive damage from a <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">single field</span> at a time.</td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R320" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">321</div></th><td class="s107">Balanced Heat Weapon</td><td class="s108"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU9zOemq5rW58465Z2n2p34iglzhBUHSuLFian7Zz6rs6npK6ouklBvdwabMOzS9nglaKH2e3gVusNbcZZtJI-6mr8zXRLhJAssN0ud2T1zFeYQyEpCKLya3J7wUpbnjWYu_kbjMhXiOi7EeduSgGEcHVc1SgV3xnBlGg=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s109" colspan="4">Firing generates <span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat </span>equal to the <span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat Generated stat</span>. <br>Passively <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">dissipates </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat </span>equal to the displayed <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Cooling Efficiency value </span>each second, even while stowed.<br>Reaching <span style="color:#e0a261;">1000 Heat</span> triggers <span style="color:#e06666;">Overheat</span>, forcing a Manual Vent and rendering the weapon <span style="color:#e06666;">unusable </span>until its <span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat</span> is <span style="color:#e0a261;">≤150</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">beginning </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Manual Vent</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Heat</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">≥875</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">2x Vent Rate Multiplier</span>.<br><br>Primary Ammo<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Balanced Heat Weapons</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> intrinsically deal 20% Increased Impact Damage to Elites, Mini-bosses, Bosses, and Vehicles.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#6fa8dc;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=1962653729">Additional information regarding Heat Weapons.</a></span></td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R321" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">322</div></th><td class="s100">Double Fire</td><td class="s104"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVg42_xbQUpPVnbONELt3FkrudHMqE9aDYbsXU5QcKSdo5iNcbuxMq-9FPLxOUow7-ZsuvF6asGif2S10ItiJIRjQDwoJm1bxmGEQeaLsnKjJfbKI-DhD6IdaeUfRM_eULKQ548yR0WFIU_RkPRapL12zvNYIEpZTG5D1I=s70-w70-h59" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4">Fires 2 rounds at a slight offset from the reticle at the cost of 1 Ammo. </td></tr><tr style="height: 194px"><th id="1662574278R322" style="height: 194px;"><div style="line-height: 194px">323</div></th><td class="s11">Dynamic Heat Weapon</td><td class="s12"><div style="width:70px;height:194px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVfOy9GfNqKwNWfd3x4nvTeDT8XBqP34GVL2sW3p9BW_VV4poIs1-b3BvQzXkIgWIKmYnKpZb4xO93JGhIryfomc2HEKDS5DRdyjrTBzepix02rgkAgxNtmdjTzU1ZgpaiRnbj7EAm7Wy9VnK8VyWuEQuedVeqzY9jDxQ=s194-w70-h194" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s110" colspan="4">Firing generates <span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat </span>equal to the <span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat Generated stat</span>. <br>Passively <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">dissipates </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat </span>equal to the displayed <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Cooling Efficiency value </span>each second, even while stowed.<br>Reaching <span style="color:#e0a261;">1000 Heat</span> triggers <span style="color:#e06666;">Overheat</span>, forcing a Manual Vent and rendering the weapon <span style="color:#e06666;">unusable </span>until its <span style="color:#e0a261;">Heat</span> is <span style="color:#e0a261;">≤150</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">cancelling </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Manual Vent</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Heat</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f9cb9c;">≤125</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Dynamic Heat Limiter</span> | <span style="color:#e0a261;">-50% Heat Generation</span> for 5 seconds or until stowing the weapon.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Triggering </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Dynamic Heat Limiter</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> through reload or sprint after having dealt damage will freeze the timer until shooting.</span><br><br>Primary Ammo<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#e0a261;">Dynamic Heat Weapons</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> intrinsically deal 15% Increased Impact Damage to Rank-and-File, and 38% Increased Impact Damage to Elites, Mini-bosses, Bosses, and Vehicles.<br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Additionally, they deal 2.5% increased direct damage to Guardians.<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#6fa8dc;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="#rangeid=1962653729">Additional information regarding Heat Weapons.</a></span></td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R323" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">324</div></th><td class="s100">Heavy Burst</td><td class="s104" rowspan="2"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVg42_xbQUpPVnbONELt3FkrudHMqE9aDYbsXU5QcKSdo5iNcbuxMq-9FPLxOUow7-ZsuvF6asGif2S10ItiJIRjQDwoJm1bxmGEQeaLsnKjJfbKI-DhD6IdaeUfRM_eULKQ548yR0WFIU_RkPRapL12zvNYIEpZTG5D1I=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4">Fires 2-round burst.<br>Grants 10?% Flinch Resist when ADS.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R324" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">325</div></th><td class="s97">Heavy Burst<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Hand Cannon)</span></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">Fires a 2-round burst that deals <span style="color:#e69138;">9.5% Increased Weakspot Damage</span>. <br><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Not to be confused with </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Damage</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, as they are independent of each other, such as shooting a </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Divinity Cage</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or scoring a hit on a </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e69138;">weakspot </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">while not being within the </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Angle Cone</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><span style="font-size:7pt;"><br></span>Grants 10% Flinch Resist when ADS.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R325" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">326</div></th><td class="s100">High-Impact Frame</td><td class="s104" rowspan="2"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbatXLxDv3hygB29Y5PSEAU3ej9WqQmPXOtRIcTTQNBbDFXapE63i20SMRw7ddUhqDOikIfV-onS3QYRWNdLVG2V0Xfug6uWqQaBulM8_37mV2_Q9pUYADcxGv4twQF-xApwRKLpFoQCHPGLDJnedFz5dchbKx6rGXn=w70-h119" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While moving at or below 2.8 metres per second and ADS:<br></span>-20% Accuracy Cone Size and -17% Accuracy Cone Growth.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Can also work while airborne if the movement speed criteria is met.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R326" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">327</div></th><td class="s102">High-Impact Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Rocket Launchers)</span></td><td class="s103" colspan="4">Baseline damage for Rocket Launchers.<br>1 Impact : 8.7 Explosive Damage Ratio. 46.5 RPM</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R327" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">328</div></th><td class="s100">Legacy PR-55 Frame</td><td class="s104"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV4Tt1CczrGUCOD1uAq49gv6hJI3ZVBqOFga-F9aaL6CtSQTuuGI9UDslmp7Jt-dIA0Ri8-hq6OQGHNdNTH5UffF6_qu7xh9Pv2xNasEmhxkc_Rcp7FqVrXxbSYotfgYHVgdhHLv8MnWl9-whByPduXGxIzTXrY_Am65b4=s70-w70-h59" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While hipfiring:<br></span>+30? Stability, <span style="color:#f1c232;">+1? Precision Angle Threshold</span>, -70?% Accuracy Cone Size, and -?% Accuracy Cone Growth.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R328" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">329</div></th><td class="s97">Lightweight Frame</td><td class="s98"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYs8dwenW6iSf0BN5cescJ-v3Gqbo_kbmOxWiXeEcukImGVHkMBuWaLlqI4k9X4BY3_0Qda8fnlev3klQfD7OP1o1cVMxZcjOeFQ2B2FsPzImBVbwpc43AynukBr6tcEHl3RiJTlxIkMpXmT2u3t8401Yy02sgnlxHc=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 Mobility, and 6.25% Forward Movement Speed Bonus.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R329" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">330</div></th><td class="s100">Micro-Missile Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">(Special Grenade Launchers)</span></td><td class="s104" rowspan="2"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUevmc3U0R6cJc5FoVO4Fh3ZJvkoWpmJ6aoW8PWsNKEexextFurgV_tDKeKYkvbdlqBfShh0nII54mtdD03XDer2S3NKiFhaaadYZGUzLscW3XEc4VhNTKn90YY4y9U05gJN9sOIEiIBkHLGOsbERWjHfl5q0fz_0ZEfXQ=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4">Passively grants +20 Mobility, and 6.25% Forward Movement Speed Bonus.<br>Deals 50% Decreased Self Damage.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R330" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">331</div></th><td class="s97">Micro-Missile Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#63d275;">(Pulse Rifles and Sidearms)</span></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">Uses <span style="color:#93c47d;">Special Ammo</span>. <br>Shoots micro-missiles that track locked-on enemies.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R331" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">332</div></th><td class="s100">MIDA Synergy</td><td class="s104"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYaucdU-HDjFk71OFW4lqppj8KiBveSTShsWm6vqEnKjbO0KqSj5BZQcbxLyytnK4e6QuePlVn8NXgKVGh0Pf_AtYMATa8TLVvYXdK6muuNGhtr1ZC3ictL83ujcNUkd9xtrQ4fSj0VN_7ERmVgTVNjb5IFoo-Gf9Z9=w70-h59" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4"><span style="color:#999999;">SMG: Behaves like a Lightweight SMG</span> | <span style="color:#63d275;">Shotgun: Behaves like a Precision Shotgun<br></span>Forward Movement Speed Bonus is increased to 10% while <span style="color:#ffd966;">MIDA Multi-Tool</span> is equipped.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R332" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">333</div></th><td class="s97">Precision Frame</td><td class="s98" rowspan="3"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaGWTVJG8sNhuWxRJzTfZ6UWGX7M4yHW0Oa-zXOeOTvklwAgigihFyym2Iz33kte_4xB9NnUxw2Q50HPsQq2eg1RELsSVBfFL94ScIOHXecli-bUU-v0pxmqofb8lk13s-YT7RFWH_3fL1WwR0dZE5fayXT2fucLA=w70-h179" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">-20% Recoil Yaw (Horizontal Recoil).<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Fusion Rifles</span> only receive -10% Recoil Yaw.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R333" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">334</div></th><td class="s102">Precision Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Rocket Launchers)</span></td><td class="s103" colspan="4">Intrinsic Tracking Module<br>Deals 5% decreased damage over High-Impact Rocket Launchers.<br>1 Impact : 3.5 Explosive Damage Ratio. 42.5 RPM</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R334" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">335</div></th><td class="s97">Precision Frame <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Hand Cannon)</span></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">+25 Airborne Effectiveness, 10% Decreased ADS Movement Speed Penalty, and -20% Recoil Yaw (Horizontal Recoil).</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R335" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">336</div></th><td class="s100">Rapid-Fire Frame</td><td class="s104" rowspan="2"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZk3sSAdbfCEOG3l_CdNNx-kvFyRpNQVX_p3eVI3Oq29kUYKRiHYYcQofBVNxbyU6J9OVd7dge19lolpLRLwiUL_1AFFKv1UMSow2Ke25FyzELvYvFTYyJEa_5GEnceSdsGBguC2IavYiKiEzFy9fdt1etcXgIwQXjI=w70-h119" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon starting a reload while magazine is empty:<br></span>0.8x Reload Duration Multiplier.</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R336" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">337</div></th><td class="s97">Rapid-Fire Frame<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Shotguns)</span></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">Passively grants 0.8x Reload Duration Multiplier.</td></tr><tr style="height: 74px"><th id="1662574278R337" style="height: 74px;"><div style="line-height: 74px">338</div></th><td class="s100">Shot Package<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(Felwinter&#39;s Lie)</span></td><td class="s104"><div style="width:70px;height:74px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVamCxat0fj0EEsQHrTey_L0fZ3ODhQbMj1dzXExNfvHDNA4uLT417v3rAZRkQNZHm8-LNFTMbA6YpTqxg-jKogWiRzgMsrZP76bsk2nVCR37wI2ZeEoCPwMU3QTtWvgPkJNBDPqB31KxlZu8zM8YGde9lI0pdfiYt1zrg=s74-w70-h74" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s101" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While ADS:<br></span>-2.5% Pellet Spread.<br><br>Otherwise identical to an Aggressive Frame Shotgun</td></tr><tr style="height: 59px"><th id="1662574278R338" style="height: 59px;"><div style="line-height: 59px">339</div></th><td class="s97">Spread Shot</td><td class="s98"><div style="width:70px;height:59px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWNFiEghra0ymAkFwOHqoviPQkR9so_TOwTY1IoSEBjWtefQAi5XNrLreOZ2e4N5lD6VlRxJYiejs4z7g_w_v8OVXNGpn5KqNgVpA1fNyN490ZgMd4F-gJGOR-O0GW4dzo8NIjwYtCsuwqoOtnumn0xkURCDTgy7KkOsYA=s70-w70-h59" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">Fires a spread of 12 pellets, each dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[10]</span> damage with a <span style="color:#f1c232;">1.2x Precision Multiplier</span>.<br>Pellets disappear after 25 meters, and deal a minimum of 0.33x damage at Maximum Damage Falloff.</td></tr><tr style="height: 329px"><th id="1662574278R339" style="height: 329px;"><div style="line-height: 329px">340</div></th><td class="s111">Support Frame</td><td class="s112"><div style="width:70px;height:329px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWDf6lEcAhTaJr01kCbDeCq9c6YLxxsu787A0e1rcgbw_YIiThTvBr5MOF9lsWrhiB2OaGMeh3rRGUQLtXrg2DTuzj8OHyFMDS6SiTguOJh-saUxgp4jpmUyOqfy-qFZcsKXCcKTTTwnzAT9Etq9e6p_X8gE3qZDYsaDrA=s329-w70-h329" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s113" colspan="4">Shoots slow, tracking projectiles that travel at a speed of 40m/s. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Projectiles do not have a distance limit, but will eventually lose their tracers.<br> Has 50% Increased Aim Assist Falloff Distance at 0 Range, down to 25% at 100 Range, compared to a regular Auto Rifle.<br></span><br>Dealing ANY<span style="font-size:6pt;font-style:italic;"> (really, ANY!)</span> damage generates <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon Energy</span>, at a rate of <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">1% Energy</span> for every <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">4</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[3.6]</span> damage dealt, reaching 100% Charge after dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">400</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[360]</span> damage.<br>Dealing damage with the <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Support Auto Rifle</span> doubles the <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon Energy</span> gains, generating <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">1% Energy</span> for every <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">2</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[1.8]</span> damage, requiring <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">200 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[180]</span> damage to fully charge.<br><br>Looking near an <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span>within range widens the reticle. Hipfiring while an <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span>is in <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healing range</span> will shoot <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healing projectiles</span> that have much stronger tracking.<br>Consumes <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">2% Weapon Energy</span> per <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healing shot</span> fired towards an <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally</span>, <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restoring 13.3 HP </span>to them on impact.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Targeting Range = 28 + (0.1 x Range Stat) meters, up to 38 Meters at 100 Range.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">If multiple </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">are targeted, then the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">healing shots</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> will alternate between </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">allies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">5 healing hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">1 second of each</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> on </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">allies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:</span><br>The next <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">healing hits</span> within 1 seconds of each on <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span>bestows them with an <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Element-Matching Effect</span>, and applies <span style="color:#e6b8af;">Support Frame Boost</span> to the user and the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">targeted ally</span>.<br><span style="color:#e6b8af;">Support Frame Boost</span> grants 10% increased weapon damage for 6 seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Stacks with everything.<br></span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Arc Support Frames</span> bestow <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Amplified </span>for 7 seconds to the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">targeted ally</span>.<br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Solar Support Frames</span> bestow <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restoration x1</span> for <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">4</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#f6b26b;">+2</span> seconds to the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">targeted ally</span>.<br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Void Support Frames</span> bestow <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">15 Void Overshield</span> for <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">10</span><span style="font-size:7pt;color:#b4a7d6;">+5</span> seconds to the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">targeted ally</span>. <br><span style="color:#63d275;">Strand Support Frames</span> cause the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">targeted ally </span>to release<span style="color:#63d275;"> 4 Unraveling Projectiles</span>.<br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Support Frames</span> bestow a <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Frost Armor</span> for 5 seconds to the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">targeted ally</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>Only triggers </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">On-Heal Effects</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> upon applying </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Rapid Healing</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">. Shots that </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">restore missing health</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> count for &quot;on-hit&quot; related interactions.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 1.5 second cooldown upon applying the Support Frame Boost before additional healing hits count towards the Support Frame Boost on the same ally.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R340" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">341</div></th><td class="s97">Together Forever</td><td class="s98"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZxXeRLBqUQTWfs0A-tATiaSRCedXGW_MYiZMGtr6mATLCbe_AMEXqc229L5wufBgt3N_af8CErlhvDBvWmpIq1WKGUE8GCUumsGFfJTWpQPqowQpJ6WukwdTOmZix5Nprmb4o7cr4vXJbquWDMPRaDuvHoLscoh3qO=w70-h89" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s99" colspan="4">Weapon Kills refill <span style="color:#ffd966;">Sturm </span>and grant it an <span style="color:#ffd966;">Overcharged Bullet</span> with increased damage, up to<span style="color:#ffd966;"> 25 Sturm Overcharge stacks</span>.<br>Scoring an additional Weapon Kill within 3 seconds of the first grants <span style="color:#ffd966;">3 Sturm Overcharge stacks</span>.<br>Further Weapon Kills within ? seconds of the last grant <span style="color:#ffd966;">5 Sturm Overcharge stacks</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 29px"><th id="1662574278R341" style="height: 29px;"><div style="line-height: 29px">342</div></th><td class="s114" colspan="6">Heavy Crossbow Information</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R342" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">343</div></th><td class="s115">Bolts</td><td class="s116"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVpPQ1WfdhUIRjzYCirZUpTjxw5X4JnTLBmds0MaE_Y1eDR1CRbZe7blvHB__PIEwnBS_SsMusDdQo6tAHrgKtFWXKmAQeTgikzAkVZszYxn61zIUij0uYdGwDQhd0ssEqfUNtf8njtb9gEOV9fc8KPV4dKgv6ni9iNK0Y=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s117" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bolts </span>deal <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1192</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage with a <span style="color:#f1c232;">1.34x Precision Multiplier</span>.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bolts </span>embed themselves on impact for a <span style="color:#a481e1;">Persistence-stat based duration</span> and can be picked up to recover <span style="color:#a481e1;">1 Ammo</span>.<br>Picking up a <span style="color:#a481e1;">Bolt </span>also picks up all other <span style="color:#a481e1;">bolts </span>within 2? meters of the Guardian.<br><br>Bolt Pickupable Duration = 20 + (<span style="color:#a481e1;">Stat </span>* 0.3) seconds</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R343" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">344</div></th><td class="s118">Charged Bolts</td><td class="s116"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXIe2-D-a9nty4V8ymIpAE20r3Oc1H44yKaXXpgNDUqyhTVk1XYBTsCqCjtrUW1tfe-lQTQgskGH5XvcN2Q3G36ceD5BHJ8Hc8Y2Q0M7TbKGtcvQECctHXGMptKAmHa_-RyQhk14raLWiNrF3ZnZPr_It7arcaukzls5w=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s117" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bolts </span>attached to targets deal <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">55</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> Damage every ? seconds up to 19 times, dealing up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1102</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage over ? seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Damage does not stack with additional bolts.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +2 Handling.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R344" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">345</div></th><td class="s119">Explosive Bolts</td><td class="s116"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVd386L7jom28yemrU9DnXs5VM7lNq72F0uX4nOxb3KDMCuPTchYGuMke7nIyRr8bEcNKHDzaIlaQCRTYLOU27bVWMeeM0QFGN3xeHPdke4JqvptPkWI3e9mp5bK-gUbT31lOx5VBtiQAq5tw_N3-UDFcEuuSAgcHLrw7A=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s117" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bolts </span>deal <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">548</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> Impact Damage with a <span style="color:#f1c232;">1.34x Precision Multiplier</span> and explode after 1 second, dealing up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">736</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> Explosive Damage over 5? meters.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +2 Ammo Generation.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R345" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">346</div></th><td class="s120">Heavy Bolts</td><td class="s116"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV-IvWuMyelA-EHUq-cVRE03EV71IE4FPDfaBVzryOVVCfkkHVfrZwTrN2RMkrm75yjT1GZ2-B_h5rHt1ETPS-xsCbh3p6ejSDqZTIAZnAKlxX28W--8QDIXgvGQ1P1_cFnxtCoZ7vequzJDBK6bw6eSMPOXlVvHXe-7tY=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s117" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bolts </span>deal 10% increased damage, but are slower and have a heavily arced trajectory.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Heavily limits the ability to score a </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Hit</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> on distant enemies due to Aim Assist altering the trajectory.<br><br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +2 Velocity.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R346" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">347</div></th><td class="s121">Serrated Bolts</td><td class="s116"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWZc3rtDwpTVHtd8P-jm15BF9whew5Bwv4o9a1hbtlN2EFnCO27AZ0vgTeM3r2YDaIXEnrjXYbHE2H6_EOMJFg7e1sK7HbDk-LvcNi7-81LqHt72uY54t4bos7YhQJogJhxKgsUk1D9c06Sid5gC7IUvhpOPwIWFG7w_9w=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s117" colspan="4">Recovering a <span style="color:#a481e1;">bolt </span>embedded in an enemy deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">303</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> damage.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +2 Persistence.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R347" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">348</div></th><td class="s122">Spring-Auger Bolts</td><td class="s116"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX4e5Zf44qFub2nG0iLCSrRXSZYLz6u6LFui9i-OE8FprXysK70R6zb7ylNQ_iz0G-dDGd7Wfy-oRRLOSYSVgAQADHYzlklCNHGn72RBq8y8UjgKl7h6MlSyOLCZRCUgQOsUF5MbXxVIN7A2gOWB06cnhwKNv95ILLhFZc=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s117" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bolts </span>release an impulse after 1? second of impacting, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">16</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> Damage and staggering enemies within 2.5 meters.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Passively grants +2 Reload Speed.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 29px"><th id="1662574278R348" style="height: 29px;"><div style="line-height: 29px">349</div></th><td class="s123" colspan="6">Glaive Information</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R349" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">350</div></th><td class="s124">Melee Attacks</td><td class="s125"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXcFt7MViLUCn9cDBLfUFcBzuH7D2bjUMQtOY4kP88AuPq2WpkdSspOU5ss_Wx_lz-yyfa0YbLIPFLct0IK-bhcTXwZV_lrifEOt2wP1mc4lgdEOWssmair3Lzr_vZmYS2hl5URTtLPt6zhY2iSWuiwbJlEqHoseNvMc_E=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s126" colspan="4"><span style="color:#89cdd1;">[Melee] </span>while a <span style="color:#93c47d;">Glaive </span>is readied lunges towards enemies up to 7 meters away, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">227 </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[97.04]</span> damage. <br>Can be chained into a 3-hit combo with a 0.467s delay between hits.<span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Animation delay after combo ends can be skipped by [ADS]</span><br>The final hit of the combo deals <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">78.5%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[88.8%]</span> increased damage.<br><br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Glaive </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Attacks</span> are treated as <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Damage</span> <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Unpowered Melee Attacks</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Weapon Damage Buffs don&#39;t buff Melee Attacks. Doesn&#39;t benefit from Titan&#39;s Melee Damage Intrinsic.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 74px"><th id="1662574278R350" style="height: 74px;"><div style="line-height: 74px">351</div></th><td class="s124">Projectile Attacks</td><td class="s125"><div style="width:70px;height:74px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWsDnX9cf_dKebG5JFXZdZB1YHftaSdxYkJf6sVEmCrMMwfamXJb-7lu0XH159LzBThBT6TERT1z9qzM2h82yt2_lg86oYCZze4KZ7wRNjLjrXtXhUNe974L0bAVCq9BLvsHXYZyHvIGo9GyvKu8KIwI_5QHRVzQq2LDdY=s74-w70-h74" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s126" colspan="4">Glaive <span style="color:#93c47d;">Projectile Attacks</span> are treated as Weapon Damage, and will benefit from any generic or weapon-specific damage increases.<br><br>Prevents <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Attacks</span> for 0.2 seconds after shooting.</td></tr><tr style="height: 239px"><th id="1662574278R351" style="height: 239px;"><div style="line-height: 239px">352</div></th><td class="s124">Weapon Energy &amp; Shield</td><td class="s125"><div style="width:70px;height:239px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVm5HrzTYYb0NEtaJbzs_mhmRh_E7UTGzWCox0gj9I6KpVI0i5R6XjKliAtweiWGXvkvsp0if_qdJkcWVGeg9B8Tuss3G2kz57Cfr9lSBBsG4bjhZheazdIklCSBSuPzzBgVy_cBBhT8IdF4ch5JuBJBTcx65V6HkUZBw=s239-w70-h239" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s126" colspan="4">Scoring a <span style="color:#93c47d;">Ranged Projectile Hit</span> grants <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">25% Weapon Energy</span><span style="color:#93c47d;"> </span>by default.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Glaives </span>passively generate <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">1% Weapon Energy per second</span> while readied.<br><br>[ADS] with a <span style="color:#93c47d;">Glaive </span>projects a frontal shield that grants Damage Resist against attacks that strike it, at the cost of draining <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon Energy</span> and a Movement Speed Penalty.<br>Base Glaive Block Movement is normally 0.85x without <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon Energy</span>, and 0.66x with <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon Energy</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">The time to raise the shield is based off of Handling and ADS Speed values.<br><br></span>Glaive Shield:<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">97.5% Damage Resist against Combatants.<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;">50% Damage Resist against Guardians. </span><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Ammo Weapons</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> and </span><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee Attacks</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> are only granted 30% Damage Resist.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Vexcalibur </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ea9999;">uniquely has 50% Damage Resist against all damage from Guardians.<br></span><span style="color:#ea9999;"><br></span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon Energy Drain Rate:<br>0 SD</span> = 6.5s | <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">50 SD</span> = 12s | <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">100 SD</span> = 18? seconds<br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Drain Rate</span> = 6.5 + (<span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Shield Duration</span> x ~0.1) </td></tr><tr style="height: 29px"><th id="1662574278R352" style="height: 29px;"><div style="line-height: 29px">353</div></th><td class="s114" colspan="6">Sword Guard Information</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R353" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">354</div></th><td class="s127">Sword Guarding</td><td class="s128"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWWRS9d4WTWTiYbBOK2XKyn7_SKaIdgC9WxtNbLSOcw_VB2lp0sYzSiLfaQXskVCkPvJdtCauynpX1_MrtlbQ-9AvHum1esqkYLwhz__-tGG-ebGHdwE7n-H_8dHQTm7L-IRLuZb29IN9ILjXsOTAJn5fHdKZ8oaic2ZT8=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s129" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">[Guard]</span> projects an energy shield in front of the user that constantly drains over time, the rate of which is determined by <span style="color:#a481e1;">Guard Endurance</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Applies a 0.85x Movement Speed Multiplier while </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">guarding</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br><br>Attacks that strike the shield deal decreased damage, with the damage resistance being determined by <span style="color:#a481e1;">Guard Resistance</span>.<br>Scales from <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">82.5%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[52.5%]</span> to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">95%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[65%]</span> Damage Resist based on the <span style="color:#a481e1;">Guard Resistance</span> stat.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R354" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">355</div></th><td class="s127">Charge Rate</td><td class="s128"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ_xGdUjnoUsCb9AtfcIQ_Xow9inya1e39721JfEbuskwIrY4LDNmZ4f4YVqL_Od15dPO3m2aOMvM9ZNFtiLr9WSH5QWlDxr3WR4J0HUTCAILr3TPE5vFxxiHbP8999RuqrVSueeFuTeq9LwkZOWkLTri_XW5yp-beF=w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s129" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Charge Rate</span> determines the delay before <span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword Energy</span> is regenerated, and the rate at which it<span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span>is regenerated.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> Using any </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Sword Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> restarts </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Energy Regeneration Delay</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, regardless of which equipped Sword drained it.<br></span><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword Energy Regeneration Delay, in seconds</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">10 CR</span> = 2.65s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">30 CR</span> = 2.45s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">40 CR</span> = 2.25s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">70 CR </span>= 1.65s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">100 CR</span> = 1.05s<br><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword Energy Regeneration Rate</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span>= 1.35 - (<span style="color:#a481e1;">Charge Rate</span> x 0.01)</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R355" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">356</div></th><td class="s127">Guard Endurance</td><td class="s128"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZpV4abXZYL4i1Rg4Y2D-BsbrR2agffFLakxAxyOad6EqM_eO48DzRPVG6FizhanWIGC5ScbNWs_eUaw9VT_qLQtbczdrC-P64dqojNO31GWJ74Ny_lKNVaUHNR1UiPnMzdaYnAsxQgNqxVW05CS-vXZjuwKseDk5hE=w70-h119" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s129" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword Guard</span> passively drains <span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword Energy.</span> <span style="color:#a481e1;">Guarding </span>against any damage pauses <span style="color:#a481e1;">passive drain </span>for ? seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword Energy Drain, in seconds</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">0 GE</span> = 2.5s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">40 GE</span> = 5s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">60 GE</span> = 6.35s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">90 GE</span> = 9s | <span style="color:#a481e1;">100 GE</span> = 12.5s<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Stronghold</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Infinite Guard Swords</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> do not drain any </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Sword Energy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R356" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">357</div></th><td class="s130">Guard Resistance</td><td class="s131"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZ5Jb2YR4MJmQIj4p2oI-PeTr7v9tUagEscPaV4I_uGK54erB3c5YFzkbxnN6JHRFHhA7jSaiEhmAguKQLyDzZnMGrNcvhGMQiSxTZnD_psLupOsXk4czji49wfKFUItrg13KYk-uCPzkemow=w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s132" colspan="4"><span style="color:#a481e1;">Guard Resistance</span><span style="color:#b4a7d6;"> </span>determines the amount of Damage Resist the <span style="color:#a481e1;">Sword Guard</span> provides against blocked attacks.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Internally, this is the Stability stat, which means that effects that increase Stability, such as </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Rally Barricade</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, will increase the Damage Resist.</span><br><br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Guard Damage Resist</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">82.5%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[52.5%]</span> at <span style="color:#a481e1;">0 Resistance</span> to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">95%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[65%]</span> at <span style="color:#a481e1;">100 Resistance</span>. <br>Damage Resist = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">????????</span> |<span style="color:#ea9999;"> 52.5 + (0.125 x Stat)</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 24px"><th id="1662574278R357" style="height: 24px;"><div style="line-height: 24px">358</div></th><td class="s133" colspan="6">Origin Traits</td></tr><tr style="height: 209px"><th id="1662574278R358" style="height: 209px;"><div style="line-height: 209px">359</div></th><td class="s134">Accelerated Assault<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Shiny Renegade Drops<br>Vanguard Alerts</span></td><td class="s135"><div style="width:70px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVNqc2mWKQBdexzAdMbcbz21LgHExs9fVRF9EzvrSUp7-ePTBy6kPm1QaItOyhmGNMcq_P8YSDZxjYIkUiJRnuYT8nuEm1Oz7d4u33QJIzvpIIwPi-pXDQHjXA8oVhepLUd_P_vRkzYuDuNhdi4BkMnoT3Jb770ymPzvw=s209-w70-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s136" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a 