rpose x5</span> | +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, 0.?x Draw Time Multiplier, and +5 ↑+? Charge Rate.</td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R370" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">371</div></th><td class="s170">Contending Cascade<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Call To Arms<br>Event</span></td><td class="s171"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXDwbCRvCtujV-mCGaWXtCGuBOxIzc-ph4W8xviM6XBrOp3y12Ho45dRtcyKruoe8b4rmLxVmr_NiOzEgbX4OLht4yGS0ghBd0euSdaCfGofkh-DgGPvp_YVnqovO-BFLIOlk-BjMvFo3N4Mt86kxmUt6U9gtwskbd7dyo=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s172" colspan="4">Grants a stack of <span style="color:#b3ccb7;">Contending Cascade</span> for each kill scored within 4 seconds of each from <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">any source</span>, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#b3ccb7;">12 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑10</span><span style="color:#b3ccb7;"> stacks</span>.<br>Renames to <span style="color:#ffd966;">Crowning Cascade</span> upon reaching <span style="color:#b3ccb7;">12 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑10</span><span style="color:#b3ccb7;"> stacks</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#b3ccb7;">Stacks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">are lost on death.<br></span><br><span style="color:#b3ccb7;">Contending Cascade</span> grants increased Handling and Reload Speed, up to a maximum of +? Handling and +? Reload Speed at 12 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑10</span> stacks.<br>Scoring a Weapon Kill while <span style="color:#ffd966;">Crowning Cascade</span> is active triggers an <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Elemental Explosion</span>, dealing <span style="color:#63d275;">102 GL</span> | <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">258 Bow</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?]</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Damage</span>, down to 0% damage over 7 meters.<br><br><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑The requirement to be impressed is lowered to 10 rapid kills.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R371" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">372</div></th><td class="s173">Crossing Over<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Prophecy Reprises<br>Dungeon</span></td><td class="s174"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVMffrL9zZ5NsUYFr4oYoDqaoi9yER26jL5PLitDKMQKRUFiVj4d5iyLQ0wJWEO7dVPCSr3PDgGIkcDJkZixgPYe5Xc1LhcBsK6nQKOIjTfYHDY2wuSqkkcXd_1XFvWS6Vys4QRmGDtnIW6DYhQ46_45kEDsTwd4rzp7o4=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s175" colspan="4"><span style="color:#d8a4b3;">For the top 50% of the Magazine:<br>Linearly grants +10 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+12?</span><span style="color:#d8a4b3;"> Range and +? ↑</span><span style="color:#ffd966;">+15?</span><span style="color:#d8a4b3;"> Handling, </span><span style="text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#d8a4b3;">down to</span><span style="color:#d8a4b3;"> +5 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#d8a4b3;"> Range and +? </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#d8a4b3;"> Handling.<br></span><span style="color:#72709e;"><br></span><span style="color:#9593bc;">For the bottom 50% of the Magazine:<br>Linearly grants 1.5% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑2.1%</span><span style="color:#9593bc;"> increased damage, </span><span style="text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#9593bc;">up to</span><span style="color:#9593bc;"> +3% </span><span style="color:#f