">Episode: Revenant</span></td><td class="s180"><div style="width:70px;height:254px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX9m9agjnFngkTDS7CHiQi7JEXC-Vi8MzIOqyg8qlhZt63jF-bCeNUFFwR0qNrmCtcVPL8mPrREeySEiCa6DPBUmI9n05hGwauSXObeSESFutZiHbUsPuXxarke-OhcMqyXTn-49uM0RaPnNHBNELL6cwzq4CUz5OpTFOc=s254-w70-h254" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s181" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">100% Counter Progress</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> by scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-And-File </span>= <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">25%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑34?%</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Elite+ </span>=<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">100% </span>| <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians </span>= <span style="color:#ea9999;">25% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Counter persists through stow.</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"><br><br></span> Spawns an <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Element-Matching Dark Ether Charge</span> that floats in the air for 5? seconds before expiring.<br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Dark Ether Charges</span> can be detonated by either shooting at them or coming into contact with them.<br><span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Dark Ether Charges</span> deal up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">386</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[50]</span> <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Element-Matching Weapon Damage</span> over 3? meters. <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Damage against Combatants scales with </span><span style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#a4c2f4;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://url.d2clarity.com/combatant-scaling&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1792870195674001&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kuZe4fp3M10NPpSM7IQ-I">Combatant Rank Modifiers</a></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">. Kills with </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Dark Ether Charges</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;"> progress the counter.</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Dark Ether Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> damage counts as Weapon Damage. Damage is always attributed to the creator, regardless of who destroys the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Dark Ether Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span><br> <br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">interacting </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">with a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Dark Ether Charge</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills the Magazine.<br>Grants 40% Increased Magazine Capacity of all equipped <span style="color:#cf404e;">Dark Ether Reaper Weapons</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Magazine increases are rounded up.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Dark Ether Charge Progress is paused if a Dark Ether Charge has spawned.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R374" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">375</div></th><td class="s182">Dawning Surprise<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Dawning<br>Event</span></td><td class="s183"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLYF4x_12ANkYPsHqzjgutMsK1ndj2C2V-rDYuzU5XqxGEGzug4tPPSxhi0-oQU9STYYfDhgw9vWlAfGrVSZDvdqOPRd_-hY6ScGOporT46wi07l-wAQ2aDlEGwTJkGjFPQRyCept0i5ot6-83MPlmTJo6EAqUWLPBGN=w70-h134" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s184" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;">100% Counter Progress</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> by scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-And-File = 16.7% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑20%</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> | Elites, Minibosses, and Bosses = 50%</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians = 16.7% </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑20%</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br></span>Spawns a 📦Box-Shaped <span style="color:#6d9eeb;">Dawning Gift </span>for the user and their <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">allies</span>, which remains on the ground for up to 10 seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#6d9eeb;">Dawning Gift</span>:<br>On Pickup | 9% <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span>, <span style="color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span>, and <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class</span> Ability Energy, <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 22 HP</span> and <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">begins Health Regeneration</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R375" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">376</div></th><td class="s185">Dealer&#39;s Choice<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">The Pale Heart<br>Destination</span></td><td class="s186"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXVBu09uew5_qBvSOpzg411F64Vk-IcezHaBb43lc8vA2WKPskBRuaZ1nwv7lk6bLeu3YSy0uasMsOgIJxJR_OfY42eKvlzfJo5Rf6M-Jr-AM7QDPKX7jeisow5k_cAFyc47OB1fHUW9vlleqEVtlf6NClkUJCKpFHhOg=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s187" colspan="4">Weapon Kills grant additional <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Energy</span>.<br>Equipping additional <span style="color:#df4545;">Dealer&#39;s Choice Weapons</span> increases the amount of <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Energy</span> gained.<br><br><span style="color:#df4545;">x1 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">+0.3% ↑+?%</span> | <span style="color:#df4545;">x2 </span>= <span style="color:#ffd966;">+1.6% ↑+?%</span> | <span style="color:#df4545;">x3</span> = <span style="color:#ffd966;">+3% ↑+?% Super Ability Energy.<br><br></span>The following <span style="color:#ffd966;">Exotic Weapons</span> count as additional <span style="color:#df4545;">Dealer&#39;s Choice Weapons</span>, but<span style="color:#e06666;"> do not benefit</span> from the <span style="color:#ffd966;">Super Ability Energy gains</span>.<br><span style="color:#999999;">Ace of Spades</span> | <span style="color:#999999;">Khvostov 7G-0X</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span><span style="color:#fbbdec;">Ergo Sum</span> | <span style="color:#e0a261;">Still Hunt</span><span style="color:#ffd966;"><br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Microcosm</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 109px"><th id="1662574278R376" style="height: 109px;"><div style="line-height: 109px">377</div></th><td class="s188">Disaster Plan<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Season of the Deep<br>Gambit Prime Reprises</span></td><td class="s189"><div style="width:70px;height:109px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWyEvxYHnYLDoaCgKD5zQiZlfmg2AYxdRPmk5oLyMEpSk7exXtdxLDDMr1U5qOnLML1rHLA46k6-r8ubMPyMDPfITtvZlg2Qw2MhMLaX5v6S1Zavrnn9qDSLh-2c3egpoZmbnZv-aHPlTfCocB5WNC6qT2BeXNf5gJeNw=s109-w70-h109" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s190" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">firing/swinging</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, after picking up an </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Ammo Brick:<br></span>+15 Range and 15% Flinch Resist for 1.5 seconds. <br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords receive +100 Charge Rate for 1.5 seconds.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 109px"><th id="1662574278R377" style="height: 109px;"><div style="line-height: 109px">378</div></th><td class="s191">Dragon&#39;s Vengeance<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Season of the Wish</span></td><td class="s192"><div style="width:70px;height:109px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xW2d0R9NwCuvlCrf9MWABdVP74232TE2yBtEI8TqySq2cKrhj6kxOEIsLOzpts74PXjFknlBYmCOMVZSynm6jqgbXGbo0zqHd-6-5wzDFOcDw2BdbPbW8gPNAgvhQq9rJ214-dDYl094_d8D3RBljHZ0iyZ8R4lHrAFTA=s109-w70-h109" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s193" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon reaching </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Critical Health</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or on </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Ally Death</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills magazine. <br>+5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, +10?<span style="color:#96d5de;"> </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">+↑?</span><span style="color:#96d5de;"> </span>Handling, and 0.975x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.?x</span> Charge/Draw Time Multiplier for 11 seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R378" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">379</div></th><td class="s194">Dream Work<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Solstice<br>Event</span></td><td class="s195"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLaH91wv1GWsulmKYapb6uzDC65yAgm_nzBDWbtkOsfaQugzgoreSh523mG0Dd3PhDYQ9YRYlvGiqZxOmxrl-y7Hfw7Jal5FCBMTAyMY0znnP1dmLQNCXKULh1zDyBhMhS_8mtmKAI-HLehlvGWl5qsYYv63Al-AWg=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s196" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">an </span><span style="font-style:italic;">assist</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">kill </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">on an </span><span style="font-style:italic;">enemy damaged by an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">ally</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, up to </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">once per reload</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills 66% of Magazine and grants +? Reload Speed for ? seconds. <br>Bows are additionally granted 0.?x Draw Time Multiplier.<br>Refill can overflow, up to 66% Increased Magazine Capacity. <br>Buff can be triggered while stowed if the <span style="color:#ffde7d;">weapon </span>did damage. </td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R379" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">380</div></th><td class="s197">Elliptical Orbit<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Pantheon</span></td><td class="s198"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUnookA9T4aCtUhZC_MniWPl2VbuE6ZT4iz4KBFjb2xFYET0lkeHxcQT7IFMJtgxUa6rfpB5ZXYOzteRcJ3lNSuvxDlgz_bYXSS67a4SFnkXgV-rVEnIG4ZbHNbH-3aXEOof29C8nAwUGDvM4NFKJ3Ann1Zxx9FSEV3pY4=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s199" colspan="4"><span style="color:#cccccc;">Passively grants </span><span style="color:#ffe599;">Inner Orbit</span><span style="color:#cccccc;">.<br></span><span style="color:#ffe599;">Inner Orbit</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> | +? Stability, +? Reload Speed, and ?% Flinch Resist.<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#cccccc;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#cccccc;">sprinting </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#cccccc;">for </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#cccccc;">1.5 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#cccccc;">:<br></span><span style="color:#cccccc;">Replaces </span><span style="color:#ffe599;">Inner Orbit</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> with </span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Outer Orbit</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> for 3 seconds.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#cccccc;">Sprinting for ANY amount of time will refresh the buff duration, and can trigger while stowed.<br><br></span><span style="color:#f1c232;">Outer Orbit</span><span style="color:#cccccc;"> | +? </span>↑+45? <span style="color:#cccccc;">Ammo Generation stat.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R380" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">381</div></th><td class="s200">Exhaustive Research<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Kepler<br>Destination<br></span></td><td class="s201"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVtK0qMfGQvlQGj8oThYMNshiYLldlUtVco_eo0JtSBF1QlI80z35Ppz71Ul4B0q-UAJil4Y0e9QItpoT6-TuAufOnplzhB0Vd_pBdbS6uDx4NybL1EflS20wfuIPy8-kwP-turKPjBPv7hIGCTjfOK0xo4-IEVz3uuVlM=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s202" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">ADS </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">near an enemy within 60 meters without firing</span>:<br>Loads up a <span style="color:#e4b253;">Micro-Missile </span>over 0.6 seconds.<br><br><span style="color:#e4b253;">Micro-Missile </span>replaces a regular shot, releasing a <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Weapon-Matching Missile</span> that deals Ammo Type-Based <span style="color:#d5a6bd;">Explosive Damage</span>, down to 0% damage over 3 meters.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">435 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑479</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[50] </span><span style="color:#999999;">Primary </span>|<span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">710 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑781</span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">[75] </span><span style="color:#63d275;">Special </span>|<span style="color:#ea9999;"> </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">651 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑716</span><span style="color:#ea9999;"> [62.5] </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Heavy</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 5.5 second cooldown after firing a missile before it is able to load another rocket.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 164px"><th id="1662574278R381" style="height: 164px;"><div style="line-height: 164px">382</div></th><td class="s203">Explosive Pact<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Last Wish Reprises<br>Raid</span></td><td class="s204"><div style="width:70px;height:164px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUvj8yxNgrqjr-UbwNKEGxo7JuN7isZz4P1mL_N4jUvHaQK_poCXopsbUQXzV_lJgK8O0GJC2017E6cZcyuS3gJTugkwd_2TYH7CZ-sFENjrstuJ_Nd-V3x-ImVKYbSW9FjwzVD5prr-1h1jEzxXttlBsub-REiggwM9A=s164-w70-h164" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s205" colspan="4"><span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade Ability Usage </span>or <span style="color:#e0a261;">scoring a Grenade Kill</span> grants a <span style="color:#61cbd9;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#61cbd9;">Explosive Pact</span>, up to <span style="color:#61cbd9;">5 stacks</span> for 7.5 seconds<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Grenades</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> grant</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#61cbd9;"> a stack</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> each time the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Healing Orb </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">is picked up, either by </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">allies </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">or the caster.<br></span><br> Each stack of <span style="color:#61cbd9;">Explosive Pact</span> grants +Stability, +Reload Speed, and Reload Duration Multiplier for 7.5 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#61cbd9;">Explosive Pact:<br></span>+? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> | +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> | +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> | +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> | +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Stability<br>+8 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> | +16 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> | +20 ↑+? | +24 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> | +44 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed<br>0.98x | 0.98x | 0.975x | 0.96x | 0.945x Reload Duration Multiplier</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R382" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">383</div></th><td class="s206">Extrovert<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Season of the Haunted</span></td><td class="s207"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUmJfZBlXcdu8aemkdPQVd5BSgwsJ6Iz0oeXLehxULC54KQUQ8pWHnfbuc7BzcuizDATVliE8eFklkXsyX6lfSVKsQ_nf22ZX69TaCCfryaFdzI4Ch_IX28EMT23r-OimTubaTicinzcGGmYT-JeaU3b5k51IEcnKl5vg=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s208" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">After 0.25 seconds of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">scoring a Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">15 metres</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 enemies</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> or a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#cc4125;">Nightmare</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restores 60 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;"> HP.</span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Glaive Melee Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> can also trigger the effect.<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 3 second cooldown after activation.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R383" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">384</div></th><td class="s209">Eyes Up<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Cosmodrome<br>Destination</span></td><td class="s210"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xX8tA1tIkGv8mS1MKfY3b9aCwpqtjXx_jGVgadpjbTMhMM40X4BFRpfGH_8uT5EQAhoo-A31-IYirnp44AlSeluO9_G1BQD0ZVGdAVjE7jZz0LWsSsI9zfz4f6bSJTkQJtt0BsZ7gGvtITpZ01hEf-XaOETk3dMxq6PaMI=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s211" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;text-decoration:line-through;">After having maintained a state of dealing or receiving damage for at least ??? seconds:<br></span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;">Scoring a kill within 3? seconds of dealing or receiving damage grants </span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#c39b68;">Eyes Up x1</span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;"> for 8 seconds.</span><br>No idea, inconsistent :) Definitely kill based though!<br><br>Additional Kills grant a stack of <span style="color:#c39b68;">Eyes Up</span> for 8 seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#c39b68;">15 stacks</span>.<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br></span>Additional Weapons Kills while <span style="color:#c39b68;">Eyes Up</span> is active extend the buff duration by +4 seconds, up to a maximum 25 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#c39b68;">Eyes Up</span> grants +Range, +Reload Speed, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">increased damage against Combatants</span>.<br>Initially grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1.5% increased damage</span>, scaling up to <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5%</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R384" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">385</div></th><td class="s212">Fail-Deadly<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Nessus<br>Destination</span></td><td class="s213"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUaHl9cuQcumxu5rnC-vaPrXyS_x85B-vGYQbDGePbSDBDrzaDfsivRDJnGvDCnLBIxrC5wwsQ6uIZGv1qiO3K9Ek8fSqHG3OR-D5yCN8Nv815cBd8CkmoTM_u-UbGrBL2R2X_ZW74AzX7Zb3qNdnMimyWBsBw2OzwQ1aQ=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s214" colspan="4">Each Damage Instance scored grant a stack of <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Fail-Deadly</span>.<br>Maximum stack amount is equal to the Magazine.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Rocket Launcher</span> <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">maximum stack</span> is 2x its Magazine Capacity. Requires <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x2 </span>for <span style="color:#a481e1;">2</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;"> (3 if Bipod)</span> <span style="color:#a481e1;">Rockets</span>. <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">x4</span> allows <span style="color:#a481e1;">4 Rockets</span> with Bipod.<br><br><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Fail-Deadly</span> grants up to 100% increased Base Magazine Capacity, +15 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, and +5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Aim Assist at <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">maximum stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">All stacks are removed</span> upon scoring a kill with the weapon.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.<br>Base Magazine Increases change the base value, meaning it stacks with Increased Magazine Capacity effects like Overflow and increases the amount of Shells loaded for Shotguns.<br>This also means it changes mag-based effects such as gaining Bolt Charge.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R385" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">386</div></th><td class="s215">Featherweight<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Sparrow Racing League<br>Activity</span></td><td class="s216"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWBUB6GvDkzf57f0K0D_TeOMoYMXjgRmC8wMjuL9xsU0M8BbxdmN7EyDr_UG3r6_UbwvgLxXpnq1JQK5boZ1Y3apu8DRsoVoZXRScvBvb1scAMyvglb5A2eBZJYI67rvu_Tx6uPsnzXxy5REa5UBjcyN7rsgHySRSi_lQ=s134-w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s217" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#fe4e40;">Featherweight </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#fe4e40;">Featherweight </span>for 10 seconds, up to 10 stacks.<br>Stacks are shared across different <span style="color:#fe4e40;">Featherweight </span>weapons.<br><br><span style="color:#fe4e40;">Featherweight </span>grants ?% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?%</span> Increased Movement Speed per stack, up to ?% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?%</span> Increased Movement Speed</td></tr><tr style="height: 359px"><th id="1662574278R386" style="height: 359px;"><div style="line-height: 359px">387</div></th><td class="s218">Field-Tested<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Field-Forged Foundry</span></td><td class="s219"><div style="width:70px;height:359px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLbGcZvKE3mn9E-8HkWPW3ixsMwk_mZ8OTyzhrtmgStp7j1o_1qAZkvmNS4JAvFpf2Yyl2wyZLO90OgiTAw3S_S2FRFLN-f8PpYmJKcDcczc5t6ezfZjRUGO_Hu9WohK8zBVBqBeXsQ3VNdT9KvG7eTtDg8pLmxYkxoM=w70-h359" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s220" colspan="4">Scoring Hits and Kills progress a Counter, which grants stacks of <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Field Test</span> at certain thresholds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#6aa84f;">5 stacks</span>. <br><span style="color:#6aa84f;">Field Test</span> grants +Range, +Stability, +Handling, and +Reload Speed, or <span style="color:#a481e1;">+Charge Rate</span> and <span style="color:#a481e1;">+Guard Resistance</span> for <span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is only removed on death.<br><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6aa84f;">Field Test Stat Bonuses:<br></span>+3 | +6 | +9 | +12 | +20 Range<br>+? | +? | +? | +? | +30? Stability<br>+? | +? | +? | +? | +? Handling<br>+5 | +10 | +20 | +35 | +50 Reload Speed<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">+5 | +10 | +20 | +35 | +55 Charge Rate<br>+5 | +10 | +20 | +30 | +40 Guard Resistance<br><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">Counter Points needed to reach </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#6aa84f;">x1 | x2 | x3 | x4 | x5 Stacks</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:</span><br><span style="color:#999999;"> x51 | x151 | x351 | x651 | x1001 <br></span><span style="color:#93c47d;">x26 | x76 | x176 | x326 | x501<br></span><span style="color:#a481e1;">x11 | x31 | x71 | x131 | x201<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Counter Information:<br></span>Each damage instance counts as 1 hit. Kills count as multiple hits, with the amount varying across Weapon Archetypes and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Combatant Rank</span>.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;">Kills for Counter:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Tier 1 and T2 Rank-and-File = x1 | T3+ Combatants = x4 | T1 Elites = x5 </span>|<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians = x10<br><br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span> and <span style="color:#93c47d;">Shotguns </span>receive x5 Points from kills.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Snipers </span>receive x4 Points from hits, and 2.5x from kills.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Breech-Loaded Grenade Launchers</span> receive x2 Points from kills.</td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R387" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">388</div></th><td class="s143">Fleet Footed<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Trials of Osiris<br>Ritual</span></td><td class="s144"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWlJMxADzVMWewacHJE7APBR7LmCRAdGbQB3G8JHNrtDmkyg7HoE47fUCkAAvoOGcvSU4QLod5XPz3PKreTmYuLe-oFxD5H3-DfqhK_bN83sQ-X3aQ9n1vRIeQ5RJMMmopVZDYrTFAlX8cuUZK9W9dmQ1X5YAE42IBTWw=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s145" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">dealing damage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#c7a067;">Fleet Footed x1</span> | +15 Airborne Effectiveness and ?% Increased Movement Speed for 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑6</span> seconds.<br>Dealing additional Weapon Damage refreshes the buff duration.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#c7a067;">Fleet Footed x2</span> | +30 Airborne Effectiveness and ?% Increased Movement Speed for 5 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑6</span> seconds.<br>Dealing additional Weapon Damage refreshes the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff is removed on stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R388" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">389</div></th><td class="s221">Forge&#39;s Kin<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Black Armory Reprises</span></td><td class="s222"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVGzLklzpAduGSZ2RoiSyc3Gxmym1c0s1OBtExLJPQFAHrJ_KN2JqxNeCV--RkgjjRWYsE8RXnQKZ6-Gz_p8dIUURoWshGQeoB5mWZ15cwlWLQYB7TCEtTpLean9XXWhVOMDYjugDlc52hBrYC_jeg27ySuToHVdr9K43g=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s223" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> with a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Black Armory Weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, or </span><span style="font-style:italic;">readying </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Black Armory Weapon</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">7 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of scoring </span><span style="font-style:italic;">any Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#e06666;">Forge&#39;s Kin</span> for a varying duration.<br>Timer only begins upon readying the weapon. <span style="color:#e06666;">Timer cannot be refreshed until it expires.<br></span>Equipping additional <span style="color:#e06666;">Black Armory Weapons </span>enhances the effect of <span style="color:#e06666;">Forge&#39;s Kin</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#b7b368;">Forge&#39;s Kin x1</span> | +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+15?</span> Reload Speed and +? Ammo Generation for 5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#57839f;">Forge&#39;s Kin x2</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">5%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑7%</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">increased damage against Combatants</span>, +? Reload Speed and +? Ammo Generation for 7 seconds.<br><span style="color:#a86629;">Forge&#39;s Kin x3</span> | <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10%</span> <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑13%</span> <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">increased damage against Combatants</span>, +? Reload Speed and +? Ammo Generation for 9 seconds.<br><br>The following <span style="color:#ffd966;">Exotic Weapons</span> count as <span style="color:#e06666;">additional Black Armory Weapons</span>, but<span style="color:#e06666;"> do not benefit</span> from Forge&#39;s Kin.<br> <span style="color:#999999;">Izanagi&#39;s Burden</span> | 🍞<span style="color:#e0a261;">Jötunn</span><span style="color:#bba5f3;">🍞</span><span style="color:#e0a261;"> </span>| 🦋<span style="color:#bba5f3;">Le Monarque🦋</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 164px"><th id="1662574278R389" style="height: 164px;"><div style="line-height: 164px">390</div></th><td class="s224">Frame of Reference<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"><br>Desert Perpetual<br>Raid</span></td><td class="s225"><div style="width:70px;height:164px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVLhAAe3FGT0PbJWZyBtSUCYmSKqSJQMM-OlPSOTqnOHC56YW_WicwfW6xqdLL12NfMszS8QpLI8mYgRnGAo1ez-CW_SKTZ9zqKal2LnyVF9CoXZQ6VLV9zTfUt7guM2C2w5MtJiegzmx3iJE6c-ikT7aL1X9AUcaeYhw=s164-w70-h164" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s226" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill:<br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#ffe599;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#ffe599;">Frame of Reference</span> for 8 seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#ffe599;">5 stacks</span>.<br>Additional Weapon Kills refresh the buff duration.<br><span style="color:#ffe599;">Frame of Reference timer</span> is paused while stowed. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Remaining duration is rounded up to the nearest second.</span><br><br><span style="color:#ffe599;">Frame of Reference x1</span> | 1.45% Increased Weapon Damage, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, and +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed.<br><span style="color:#ffe599;">Frame of Reference x2 </span>| 2.8% Increased Weapon Damage, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, and +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed.<br><span style="color:#ffe599;">Frame of Reference x3</span> | 4.2% Increased Weapon Damage, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, and +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed.<br><span style="color:#ffe599;">Frame of Reference x4</span> | 5.6% Increased Weapon Damage, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, and +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed.<br><span style="color:#ffe599;">Frame of Reference x5</span> | 7% Increased Weapon Damage, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Range, and +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R390" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">391</div></th><td class="s227">Gravity Well<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Rites of the Nine</span></td><td class="s228"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUFjhFEAC3lozpCBhpPP6ICW8R_qtGA5oqN1dfs15S9u4TnfWE0KcgS9q85ixnyXPdXUdgUufXoMQmEBVYuEB3XE7cR9Rb_cMiX1fyPKy1uxYQsv_p5swIFw4rlrM1YHPYpBO0okQ1T1Kp-Q-7rP6BSN68gfMYllZ-4hb8=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s229" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon finishing a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">reload</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Pick ups <span style="color:#63d275;">Ammo </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Bricks </span>within 15 meters.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Triggers On-Ammo Pickup Synergies. Will also pick up </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">Motes </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Crests</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R391" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">392</div></th><td class="s230">Gun and Run<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Gambit<br>Ritual</span></td><td class="s231"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLb7wI2f5AXYBzpeKLN4qNSyGoABUjLW5nsl-3C2T9ftjCGrsJ3mzKxx2DV5qOZeXoWwFHrhpFBXZxn0l-WjplzNVeNeDLHyYlwwmfNlaJ-qLnE8CHGPFgISbqDvvYv_Rx1uwxwVNON_pPVYOW123TYfNNiZ2KmLC2Ur=w70-h149" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s232" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#38ad69;">Gun and Run</span> for 10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑11</span> seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#38ad69;">3 stacks</span>.<br>If <span style="color:#38ad69;">Gun and Run </span>expires, the next Weapon Kill will instead grant <span style="color:#38ad69;">however many stacks</span> were previously held.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;">sprinting </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">for at least </span><span style="font-style:italic;">0.75 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Magazine isn&#39;t full</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#ccae3b;">Consumes </span>a <span style="color:#38ad69;">stack</span>, refilling 25% of Magazine every 0.85 seconds and refreshes the <span style="color:#38ad69;">buff duration</span>. <br>Bows receive 0.85x Draw Time Multiplier for ? seconds.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Does nothing for </span><span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords (Chivalric Fire)</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R392" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">393</div></th><td class="s233">Hakke Breach Armaments<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Häkke<br>Foundry</span></td><td class="s234"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVUByaRyTl-3vsCdGNE3IyxHP5_-2N04HwUJr-NYvSAFgmZHQWoT4FIED4gxJ1uXZepNxCc2ANysKX2kdSX8L-s1qDjBZztyZ7nSm6dSBiSL15_SEejh-EMGy8ptIG5U2O90REk2CoDVsesW0XGJvSP_7zW_BcawOpFdAc=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s235" colspan="4">Passively grants increased damage against Vehicles, Turrets, and Constructs.<br><br>15% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑20%</span> Increased Damage against Vehicles <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">(such as </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Cyclops</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Shriekers</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Tanks</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">)</span>.<br>30% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑35%</span> Increased Damage against Turrets and Constructs.<span style="color:#ea9999;"><br></span>45?% Increased Damage against <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Stasis Crystals</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R393" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">394</div></th><td class="s236">Harmonic Resonance<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Root of Nightmares<br>Raid<br><br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">+Epochal Integration</span></td><td class="s237"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXgibiZmExf6mAGjelFoQEFPhUl86uwQffvSnPw837KiFAev1OARm6g0iW7LiZOnlwYA1rMPII8TrXDSeeSZ3XCQlULcUk-OWQDginPljTNOedkawRd4VQFvSSASz0O9vDEfcs6-KeQJ1cScV2__B6qt0VKYei8BavsbCM=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s238" colspan="4">Equipping more than one <span style="color:#c06fd6;">Root of Nightmares Weapon</span><span style="color:#d5a6bd;"> </span>grants increased Handling, Reload Speed, and damage towards enemies wielding <span style="color:#a2c4c9;">Light </span>and <span style="color:#b45f06;">Darkness</span>.<br><br>List of enemies affected:<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> <br>Dread Combatants (+Nezarec) and Lucent Hive Lightbearers </span>|<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#ea9999;">Guardians in their </span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability </span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#ea9999;">or </span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#fbbdec;">Transcending</span><span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#ea9999;">?</span><span style="color:#ea9999;">. DOES NOT DO ANYTHING TO GUARDIANS.<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;"><br></span><span style="color:#c06fd6;">Two Weapons</span> | +10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, 0.95x Reload Duration Multiplier, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3.33% </span>increased damage.<br><span style="color:#c06fd6;">Three Weapons</span> | +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+? </span>Handling, +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed, 0.95x Reload Duration Multiplier, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10%</span><span style="color:#96d5de;"> </span>increased damage.</td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R394" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">395</div></th><td class="s239">Head Rush<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Season of the Witch</span></td><td class="s240"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVZKjscEdNsdQa4P3DzvbCy3EQlBPIUcnEWYHFqXRq_UQhGEoOlYWcqjLHD-FnWBeOkp2VfY78ELkg2kxzrrIKkduD35U2yP3Ok4rYBDnmKBBThDDexkxE-rXS58gIhXVlE-oEXBuDMSSdPjTTCNwtzowJeSZqcxn_a7XU=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s241" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon standing up after crouching for 2 seconds, or after sliding:<br></span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">15% Increased damage against Hive Combatants</span>, +30? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#96d5de;"> </span>Handling, and +30? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed for 5 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be triggered while stowed and persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R395" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">396</div></th><td class="s242">Heretical Behavior<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Pit of Heresy<br>Nether Heretical Weapons</s