 class="s245">Hot Swap<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Dares of Eternity</span></td><td class="s246"><div style="width:70px;height:109px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZL9NfEgcyhekdf6xAIutxa7UIg4KXsTUpcDnVgX2sBYJwBJas_x_cRkPUWGHE9gWzZX8DJJGsP2D93h_zWuszgi5JMZLzBIrWZfFUk-KSXX3pddwbXe8mPnZNidXywSdlTd_FdSpynYabdZrHWOygUhnVhuFR_tL-D=w70-h109" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s247" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying the gun after receiving any damage within ? seconds:<br></span>+30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+35</span> Handling for 4 seconds.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">+100 Guard Resistance, +100? Guard Endurance, and +100 Charge Rate for 4 seconds on Swords.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R397" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">398</div></th><td class="s248">Ignoble Deeds<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Shattered Throne<br>Dungeon</span></td><td class="s249"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU5uvNYbIpdD1Xo1oXuwHs4MX0DMxZNLmJRv71Dd6GQUu99EgG6SLbm5uEIEnAKyYwoYn0D1nBXqsqRKsYZjJn6hgatr5JFoPV_yzHV9R52X0DfeaFGuEppQnlKqX9vyeB4HR1SpVCTRnh9CDkjCzXA0KbGpoH5-EmclOQ=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:left center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s250" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon inflicting an </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#c27ba0;">Elemental Debuff</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#666666;">x2 Ignoble Deeds</span>, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#666666;">10 stacks</span>. <br>Scoring a kill <span style="color:#ccae3b;">consumes </span><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">1</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[2] </span>stacks of <span style="color:#666666;">Ignoble Deeds</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.<br></span><br><span style="color:#666666;">Ignoble Deeds</span> grants +30? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+35?</span> Handling and +30? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+35?</span> Reload Speed. <span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords receive +20? </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#a481e1;"> Charge Rate.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R398" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">399</div></th><td class="s251">Imperial Allegiance<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Equilibrium <br>Dungeon</span></td><td class="s252"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU9ir__vYjnl-754UVXt8Ygg3G3j9QA9m6t_KuVOXRx7tl_6vyeD7nVgUZkxzKZNLxaxy9GWLLKVZmRlXSB6Dq_MwIdndBakmqv3L-ebFeuqILAB-Rm8tG-ySobcpZ0GoJqH14vtN38Ry2-KxxMMOQB6HCGmeVGRTIf=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s253" colspan="4">Grants a stack of <span style="color:#e06666;">Imperial Allegiance</span> per <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">ally </span>within 15 meters, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#e06666;">3 stacks</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#e06666;">Imperial Allegiance</span> grants <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">1.035x Cooling Multiplier</span>, and <span style="color:#a481e1;">+? Charge Rate</span> per <span style="color:#e06666;">stack</span>.<br>Additonally, each <span style="color:#e06666;">stack </span>grants <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3.5%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%]</span> increased damage while <span style="color:#e0a261;">above 50% Heat</span>/<span style="color:#a481e1;">below ?% Sword Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#f4cccc;">Imperial Allegiance x1</span> | <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">1.035x Cooling Multiplier</span>, <span style="color:#a481e1;">+? Charge Rate</span>, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">3.5%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%]</span> increased damage.<br><span style="color:#ea9999;">Imperial Allegiance x2</span> | <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">1.07x Cooling Multiplier</span>, <span style="color:#a481e1;">+? Charge Rate</span>, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">7%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%]</span> increased damage.<br><span style="color:#e06666;">Imperial Allegiance x3</span> | <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">1.105x Cooling Multiplier</span>, <span style="color:#a481e1;">+? Charge Rate</span>, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">10.5%</span> <span style="color:#ea9999;">[?%]</span> increased damage.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R399" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">400</div></th><td class="s254">Indomitability<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Brave Foundry<br>Onslaught</span></td><td class="s255"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXMi9gRNRp6XyCfPWMWZr-mRZ07OeCV25sHTR6m70haKPHiLHa9LEud5sGBukJE6v7DLUOkPFcIcYlSTApY_KXfxThx6T9pgrgH6Q2EhNF5yHbUcaiSjnnWXk3lD6PKMa9W5v1agBE6UdwhjXymO36vdadgVynF5voung=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s256" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While a</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a2c4c9;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a2c4c9;">Light </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is equipped:<br></span