Launcher: 25% Increased Damage<br> Machine Gun: 50% Increased Damage <br>Sniper Rifle: 100% Increased Damage<br>Fusion Rifle and Shotgun: 150% Increased Damage<br></span><br><span style="font-style:italic;">Hits required to trigger </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#d5a6bd;">Tracking Missile</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#999999;">Hand Cannon, Pulse Rifle, and Submachine Gun</span>: 40% of Magazine + 1.<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Fusion Rifle</span>: ?% of Magazine.<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Shotgun</span>: 5 at Close Range, 4–3 at Medium Range.<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Sniper Rifle</span>: 40% of Magazine + 2.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Grenade Launcher</span>: 30% of Magazine.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Machine Gun</span>: 25% of Magazine + 1.<br><span style="color:#e06666;"><br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a cooldown between firing a missile and additional hits counting towards the next missile.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#999999;">Primary Weapons</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> = ~2 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑?</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> seconds.<br></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a481e1;">Power Weapons</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> = 3 </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑1.5</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;"> seconds</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R406" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">407</div></th><td class="s275">Noble Deeds<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Season of Defiance</span></td><td class="s276"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https: