tle="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s292" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Stunning </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Champion</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">:<br></span>Refills Magazine, <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">restores 60 HP, and begins Health Regeneration</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 209px"><th id="1662574278R424" style="height: 209px;"><div style="line-height: 209px">425</div></th><td class="s323">Subjugation<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Sundered Doctrine<br>Dungeon</span></td><td class="s324"><div style="width:70px;height:209px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUyLKBvAgrOFBOkWHzzDW-C39-6vZ-Jd0SMRuDAynUDhE0wa7wSRB2KLJnUYs2uAo_S2y4H_kkaCF0JVMFIIu-Upzb28b-Gc900WjNTXryTBSMEzNLeU8qHfx3dgjS8iBn-7TdWuYtdTn9aECGogBO7uDNr1Zf3fk3nf0c=s209-w70-h209" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s325" colspan="4">Perk behavior changes depending on the <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">enemy rank</span> when dealing damage:<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Against </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;"> and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Elite Combatants</span>: <br>Shots <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">explode </span>on hit, dealing <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">6.5</span> <span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;">(</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">32.5 </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑?</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;"> </span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;color:#93c47d;">on Shotgun</span><span style="font-size:7pt;font-style:italic;">)</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span>additional damage as an <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Explosive Payload</span>, damaging enemies within 3? meters.<br><span style="color:#93c47d;">Trace Rifle</span>: <span style="color:#f9cb9c;">Once </span>every 4 hits, after 4 hits.<span style="color:#a4c2f4;"><br>Damage against Combatants scales with Combatant Rank Modifiers and counts as Weapon Damage.<br></span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑Explosion Damage is 25% higher.<br></span><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Against </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Champions</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Minibosses</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">, and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Bosses</span>:<br>Inflicts <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Exhaust </span>for 5 seconds on hit, <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">reducing Combatant Damage Output by 25%</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians</span>:<br>?% Flinch Resist for ? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?</span> seconds.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R425" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">426</div></th><td class="s326">Sundering<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Warlord&#39;s Ruin<br>Dungeon</span></td><td class="s327"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUhzor6M9fqMvQJk_9S7bj2rQbNI1ZsenSH2Xq4X1f1n9EcD_rdM7oOYXrr-iyNNt8B-UcMAoB7a72Gynq5hcSaZ82dXwMX1kNgj9hP8aQUtFcpiD771-2NYWw_r9qOeycipVI24MK9umMMtdkeUm5-_TFEYslQewRTMA=s104-w70-h104" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s328" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon </span><span style="font-style:italic;">destroying </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">a</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Vehicle Combatant</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, Construct, or breaking a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#7cadff;">Shield</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>+40 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed, 0.95x Reload Duration Multiplier, and 0.9x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.?x</span> Draw Time Multiplier for 7 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R426" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">427</div></th><td class="s329">Suros Synergy<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">SUROS<br>Foundry</span></td><td class="s330"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXK30CYtWWnnQUfyuxLmMAvPG5PnQfpOaxfsHi5lZXVT55Ziv64NfINkYFoOLSt81KIlweAkQ06tsHeU0X6VdW-CHYvIni3q2C-d2Akvu5r_gxDmmMCuBCmIQmzKexoWOhUvdXzya-lgcEnaGIFCBGhiU_UyaQzxkIex0A=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s331" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon finishing a reload:<br></span>+40 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+45?</span> Handling and 20% Flinch Resist for 6 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Buff cannot be refreshed until its duration expires</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">. Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R427" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">428</div></th><td class="s332">Tenacity<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Reclamation Weapons</span></td><td class="s333"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUMsFuL5VrBjl-jVbD-Rro7ioZwVebfgfnAXvynC_OkP4EsWu-PddBWT1iLMYTaxLKazoEhs223H7NcpIR7S9WKmKmVCfDMV7ji1Rxqcofi4hLRUkz95dl8h38y3UZZHQEPMe0YpNEmIoqSpUstO1jKxV7yuU-0ZKqdPA=s134-w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s334" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, while within </span><span style="font-style:italic;">15 meters</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of an </span><span style="font-style:italic;">enemy</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a <span style="color:#cc4125;">stack </span>of <span style="color:#cc4125;">Tenacity</span>, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#cc4125;">20 stacks</span>.<br><span style="color:#cc4125;">Stacks </span>persist until death.<br><br>Each <span style="color:#cc4125;">Tenacity stack </span>grants 0.5% increased damage, Handling and Reload Speed.<br>Grants up to 10% increased damage, +50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55?</span> Handling, and +50 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+55? </span>Reload Speed at <span style="color:#cc4125;">20 stacks</span>.</td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R428" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">429</div></th><td class="s335">Tex Balanced Stock<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Tex Mechanica<br>Foundry</span></td><td class="s336"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXBLjV3IHp95Jguhu2bR68Yjokybpil69ODtC4irszjgFQ3YxVYB3bIH2-mpnRji4XRXHk1tjnOz8xNwQbwNl1vJcbYcHjgReSOTEf-stkTM89yO8qF26nkc76QWfaQEEY-pxsdVKZOJ11GYSuMzcO-ze1c1osc2y2wvHI=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s337" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> 4 Hipfire Hits</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within 4? seconds of each:<br></span>Grants <span style="color:#d87273;">Tex Balanced Stock</span> for 4 seconds. Scoring additional hipfired hits refresh the buff duration.<br><br><span style="color:#d87273;">Tex Balanced Stock:</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#d87273;"><br></span>+20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> </span>Range, +20<span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑+?</span> Handling, +20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed, 0.9x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.?x</span> Reload Duration Multiplier<br><span style="color:#f1c232;">+1.5° Hip-Fire Precision Angle Threshold</span>, 10% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?%</span> Decreased ADS Movement Speed Penalty, and <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">35% Increased Stagger Force</span>.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 149px"><th id="1662574278R429" style="height: 149px;"><div style="line-height: 149px">430</div></th><td class="s338">Timelost Magazine<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Vault of Glass<br>Raid</span></td><td class="s339"><div style="width:70px;height:149px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV-eAcXCZ_-YZn1Eloz5ueRWoHNUKx_Ffz-xXQan5fb6FQEP2ROiYIVjP11qs5f6B4hO6SH2iyVAPjg5StUN2e9dCjZr_3uwcZAv_pIzQAfzPRcxB618kq0neSTjB_N0wlIRmGAx0VhYVUFV3WXsp_anyf8ywOOHI1Y4Tw=s149-w70-h149" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s340" colspan="4">Weapon Kills grant additional <span style="color:#ffd966;">+1?% ↑+?% Super Ability Energy</span>.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability End</span><span style="font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Refills Magazine.<br>100% Increased Base Magazine Capacity for 20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+21</span> seconds. <span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Found Verdict reloads 2 shells at a time.<br>Base Magazine Increases change the base value, meaning it stacks with Increased Magazine Capacity effects like Overflow.<br>This also means it changes mag-based effects such as gaining Bolt Charge.<br>Buff can be activated while stowed, and persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R430" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">431</div></th><td class="s341">To Excess<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Season of the Haunted<br>Menagerie Reprises</span></td><td class="s342"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUxOwZm5Q5zuzDgJsaqNXJPjFe_1GFlTjru04CR3_6dJw9ZNwVSjmaSys_THFpCpAKQJbAqDQHT2pYGn9I5GoxOXqH63f9wnktqWjygpINErRo2iV4YLtjEhfc1tol3pT3cIMjTsZI4FBGJ8Z2pLvzIZK4QXevgMibsVVs=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s343" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> while </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">Super Ability</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> is charged:<br></span><span style="color:#e0a261;">+20 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+25</span> <span style="color:#e0a261;">Grenade </span>and <span style="color:#89cdd1;">+20 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+25</span><span style="color:#89cdd1;"> Melee</span> for 12 seconds.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R431" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">432</div></th><td class="s344">Unburied Treasure<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Grasp of Avarice<br>Dungeon</span></td><td class="s345"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXKEySBNGUh44DG2ctXv-yEKNs6vjrdhH4Cs1GQL8U0XHkwTIPEoSdCJmCurB8AA3p1WT8_pGWutJqZMHpvgS_ivii0YFc1jlRxrewF4kovq7MuCPVuo9VliwFCL_57yXQEK8R_FPqIKvNKL5mLbC2ATWhzsHWNeyHuRIw=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s346" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon readying the weapon:<br></span>Up to +10 Range and -?% Accuracy Cone Size for ? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑~0.5</span> seconds, scaling down to +5 Range and -?% Accuracy Cone Size after ? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑1</span> second.<br>Scales <span style="color:#e06666;">down </span>to no benefits? over the remaining ? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑3.5</span> seconds of the buff duration.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords receive ?% Increased Lunge Distance.<br></span>Buff is removed on stow.<br><br><span style="color:#e06666;"> Incurs a 3 second cooldown once the buff is removed before it can be retriggered.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 89px"><th id="1662574278R432" style="height: 89px;"><div style="line-height: 89px">433</div></th><td class="s347">Unsated Hunger<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Season of the Deep<br>Reckoning Reprises</span></td><td class="s348"><div style="width:70px;height:89px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xU1yLNbTrrO757KWJiRUKgzUnsyhLW8e9c6NXr5es7YN4uF2c0Z9i28WKS3bz5KX1qe7z22c5S5u824lWbMNsgTpc-wKKhj6ruBHC02Or5ohntZZoTPXVLKxeRzIXHeoUP75lW4p-BYpxKDdoqzevBei8UTwVoBWO4_sCA=s89-w70-h89" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s349" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">While </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e0a261;">Grenade</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Melee</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">, and </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Abilities are all uncharged:<br></span>+20 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+? </span>Stability, +60 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, +60 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed. <br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords receive +50 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#a481e1;"> Charge Rate and +40 </span><span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span><span style="color:#a481e1;"> Guard Endurance.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R433" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">434</div></th><td class="s350">Vanguard Determination<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Vanguard<br>Ritual</span></td><td class="s351"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xWji_nqQxNkqZcGDoB7zIRzZRflxIL6GwiCRc-45It61nhcuBRa2GDrQXyYMf_VNBFHCub8vsck06i-ET_zq7YeX0QUu0PCiMp53VgT1FwbhF96YzUrZhr9DD2I5NTWMSgBGwuAfLQsow313j0dvwqMU01C4NRz3goT_Ck=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s352" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;">within 20 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span>Grants a stack of <span style="color:#6d9eeb;">Vanguard&#39;s Determination</span> for 10 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑12.5</span> seconds, up to a maximum of <span style="color:#6d9eeb;">3 stacks</span>.<br>Scoring additional Weapon Kills within 20 seconds of <span style="color:#b4a7d6;">Class Ability Usage</span> refreshes the buff duration.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Buff remains active through stow, and </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6d9eeb;">stacks </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">are shared across different weapons with the </span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#6d9eeb;">Vanguard&#39;s Determination</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> trait.<br></span><br><span style="color:#6d9eeb;">Vanguard&#39;s Determination | </span>2% | 4% | 6% Damage Resist.</td></tr><tr style="height: 104px"><th id="1662574278R434" style="height: 104px;"><div style="line-height: 104px">435</div></th><td class="s350">Vanguard&#39;s Vindication<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Vanguard<br>Ritual</span></td><td class="s351"><div style="width:70px;height:104px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLZWdpBjhzQGzHgARRgGivC562bZwqJDlLpas5goSLZgkB1b1Ejkoox2vfin21f0LMMYi8HkEo8oCuyge7cuHkGvUzNy49d4kn0qRDhz0A7hDNHz0oqvwQi7Mp-1ErHRm9AoEiXJfrcWk1P3-eO-0a5OrFHrCgMyDi5P=w70-h104" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s352" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">On </span><span style="font-style:italic;">Weapon Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">:<br></span><span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Restores 10 HP.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 209px"><th id="1662574278R435" style="height: 209px;"><div style="line-height: 209px">436</div></th><td class="s353">Veist Stinger<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Veist<br>Foundry</span></td><td class="s354"><div style="width:70px;height:209px;"><img src="https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLa9tbBqvWjMr3RMfIfmgVagvMQfbZG48ts-IHPyPytNkSypz6zf1N005vM2NP_hJAVmiY59dBPvaVkcb5o9jiv2Xxa1NKDeltBdSLBhvWCoGxNm-lcL_BA2VBWB1URnjMDbgew3bQ_QD0xCfUBFedMf4-VjA85YSlwI=w70-h209" title="Image" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s355" colspan="4">Hits have a chance to activate <span style="color:#9da640;">Veist Stinger</span> for 7 seconds, granting different bonuses based on the Weapon Archetype.<br><br><span style="color:#9da640;">Veist Stinger</span>:<br>Refills 25% of Magazine and 10% <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑?%</span> Decreased ADS Movement Speed Penalty.<br>Bows are additionally granted 0.85x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.8x</span> Draw Time Multiplier, but <span style="color:#e06666;">do not</span> receive the Magazine Refill.<br><span style="color:#a481e1;">Swords </span>are granted +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Charge Rate.<br><br><span style="color:#9da640;">Veist Stinger Activation Chances:<br>2%:</span> Auto Rifles and Submachine Guns.<br><span style="color:#9da640;">4%:</span> Sidearms<br><span style="color:#9da640;">10%:</span> Bows, Linear Fusion Rifles, and Sniper Rifles<br><br><span style="font-style:italic;color:#e06666;">Incurs a 4 second cooldown between reactivations.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 179px"><th id="1662574278R436" style="height: 179px;"><div style="line-height: 179px">437</div></th><td class="s356">Veteran&#39;s Wisdom<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">EDZ Weapons</span></td><td class="s357"><div style="width:70px;height:179px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUU7xgmXvVPxAeNuCY2zYH9WyNPbW6OXH31AXlN8csafNqngxLf_BneAEtJfMGr7AOsrMdZL4xgEcCAJN2epny7ruptzSqvFB-aKsIxbroq4ldTXxFfSmtljf2AgO3_Jfa6_ZDsqosnOzxTEcjXaptjywYdqvGbXK1aX8A=s179-w70-h179" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s358" colspan="4"><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Upon scoring a </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#f1c232;">Precision Kill</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> </span><span style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;">OR </span><span style="font-style:italic;">3 Weapon Kills</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> within</span><span style="font-style:italic;"> 3 seconds</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> of each:<br></span>Triggers a <span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Shockwave</span> at <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Enemy Death Location</span>.<br><span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Shockwave</span> deals <span style="color:#999999;">damage </span>over 8 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑9</span> meters without falloff, and inflicts <span style="color:#dd7e6b;">Exhaust </span>for 10 seconds, <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">reducing Combatant Damage Output by 25%</span>.<br><br><span style="color:#999999;">Kinetic Shockwave Damage</span>:<br><span style="color:#999999;">Auto Rifle, Pulse Rifle</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">20</span><br><span style="color:#e0a261;">SMG</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span><br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Sniper</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">23</span><br><span style="color:#e0a261;">Fusion Rifle</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span><br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Sword</span> = <span style="color:#a4c2f4;">?</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 119px"><th id="1662574278R437" style="height: 119px;"><div style="line-height: 119px">438</div></th><td class="s359">Wild Card<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Cassoid<br>Foundry</span></td><td class="s360"><div style="width:70px;height:119px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xVCNUbc9_VllPMFepPbk46wdOxI044pBrTl5_eD9avSQyb5mMeBFA5G1g1HqUJ0mATh-UnUEvcTA4dkPxpZ19Fxl9wO31ZXbVo_RKrOaKUQf-powcXpaHBWqjRV2DGGvMoayItaXWmAN3-YA9JKPNbrc1DBo_TsziNXpuU=s119-w70-h119" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s361" colspan="4">Kills release a varying amount of <span style="color:#d4c75b;">Telesto Bolts </span>on top of where the enemy died. <span style="color:#d4c75b;">Bolt Quantity </span>is tied to Enemy Rank.<br><span style="color:#a4c2f4;">Rank-and-File = 1 | Elites = 3 | Minibosses = ? | Bosses and Champions = 7</span> | <span style="color:#ea9999;">Guardians = 3<br></span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">Incurs a 6 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;">↑5 </span><span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">second cooldown between additional Bolt spawns. <br></span><br><span style="color:#d4c75b;">Bolts:<br></span>Identical to <span style="color:#ffd966;">Telesto Bolts</span> in behavior, exploding on proximity or contact, dealing up to 39.5 damage and last up to 10.5 seconds after embedding onto a surface.<br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">Damage against Combatants scales with </span><span style="font-style:italic;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;-webkit-text-decoration-skip:none;color:#a4c2f4;"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://www.google.com/url?q=http://url.d2clarity.com/combatant-scaling&amp;sa=D&amp;source=editors&amp;ust=1792870195694342&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PES2f8rywDuOKWTimeQF1">Combatant Rank Modifiers</a></span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#a4c2f4;">.</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 359px"><th id="1662574278R438" style="height: 359px;"><div style="line-height: 359px">439</div></th><td class="s362">Willing Vessel <br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Episode: Heresy</span></td><td class="s309"><div style="width:70px;height:359px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV204DKQDMEUkryhQPjzjD7SMhijcdpd2-9MGb1w7HlYpOKIrclFgPf38VsiQdZPA2TxX1YzUFfWYF9yqvXep_B1Po_SPYiJgh70R7QFD4P8ocTDhKkBQ2YAP0kHU88a6h9DQCR-M7x33iDdeXWgXdbz-WpcLm0wldmrOY=s359-w70-h359" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s310" colspan="4">Dealing damage or scoring kills increments a Damage based counter towards stat bonuses.<br>100% Counter is displayed as <span style="color:#5db69e;">x5 Willing Vessel</span>. Counter constantly decreases by 2.2?% every 1? seconds.<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#89cdd1;">Visual Buff Stacks</span><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;"> to Damage Thresholds:</span><br><span style="color:#63d275;">Auto</span>: ? | ? | ? | ? | ?<br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Bow</span>: ~180 | ~750 | ? | ? | ?<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">Sidearm</span>: ? | ? | ? | ? | ?<br><span style="color:#63d275;">SMG </span>: ? | ? | ? | ? | ?<br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Fusion Rifle</span>: ? | ? | ? | ? | ?<br><span style="color:#63d275;">Glaive</span>: ? | ? | ? | ? | ?<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">GL</span>: I | don&#39;t | think | so | lmao<br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">LFR</span>: ~380 | ~1750 | ~3450 | ~4150 | ~6200<br><span style="color:#89cdd1;">MG</span>: ~385 | ? | ? | ? | ?<br><span style="color:#bba5f3;">Sword</span>: ? | ? | ? | ? | ?<br><br>Grants a continuously increasing Stability, Handling, Reload Speed, and Charge Rate stat bonus as more damage/kills are scored.<br>Stat Bonuses (at the start of the stack):<br>x1 = +? Stability, +? Handling, +2? Reload Speed, 0.?x Draw/Charge Time Multiplier, and +20 Charge Rate<br>x2 = +? Stability, +? Handling, +5 Reload Speed, 0.?x Draw/Charge Time Multiplier, and +40 Charge Rate<br>x3 = +? Stability, +? Handling, +10 Reload Speed, 0.?x Draw/Charge Time Multiplier, and +50 Charge Rate<br>x4 = +? Stability, +? Handling, +25 Reload Speed, 0.?x Draw/Charge Time Multiplier, and +70 Charge Rate<br>x5 = +20? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+? </span>Stability, +30? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, +30 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed, 0.85x <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑0.?x</span> Draw/Charge Time Multiplier, and +80 <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Charge Rate<br><br>This is basically Target Lock&#39;s S Curve mixed with <span style="color:#6aa84f;">Field-Tested</span> on top of being <span style="font-style:italic;color:#dd7e6b;">actually damage based</span><span style="font-style:italic;">, so it is much harder to test, sorry!</span></td></tr><tr style="height: 134px"><th id="1662574278R439" style="height: 134px;"><div style="line-height: 134px">440</div></th><td class="s363">Winterized Gear<br><br><span style="font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;">Europa<br>Destination</span></td><td class="s364"><div style="width:70px;height:134px;"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xXZpAq53kit1QN9Tba2q6WJgTnes14cVZ7iDNE3RRj0nL_fOEkSVe1m4qXgLOm3zcWN4pmqWbFqPA4VPhueFdijYqC1l07L7XXrQGwdpsj4_I8CVoi9pyVnTZC-C6db6CQ-Qrj-ssr6X0q32hS-C0PJSliyROl1Bu3BwCo=s134-w70-h134" style="width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;"/></div></td><td class="s365" colspan="4">Grants <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Winterized Gear Ready</span>.  <br>Transforms into <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Winterized Gear x3 </span>upon dealing or receiving damage.<br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Winterized Gear Ready </span>is reacquired 12 seconds after <span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Winterized Gear</span> expires.<br><br><span style="color:#6fa8dc;">Winterized Gear x3</span> = +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Stability, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, and +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed for 5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#9fc5e8;">Winterized Gear x2</span> = +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Stability, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, and +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Reload Speed for 5 seconds.<br><span style="color:#cfe2f3;">Winterized Gear x1</span> = +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Stability, +? <span style="color:#ffd966;">↑+?</span> Handling, and +?<span style="color:#ffd966;"> ↑+? </span>Reload Speed for 5 seconds.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><script nonce="9v-GYLCIJJeCSRSqvUm-rQ">switchToSheet('1662574278');</script></body></html>